<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible 2014</book>
  <para style="h">Lukka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Enjiri nga bwe Yawandiikibwa Lukka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lukka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Enjiri nga bwe Yawandiikibwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lukka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Abantu bangi bagezezzaako okuwandiika ebyafaayo ebyatuukirizibwa mu ffe, <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>ng’abo abaasooka edda bwe baabitubuulira, nga be baali abajulirwa era abaweereza b’Ekigambo okuviira ddala ku lubereberye. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Bwe ntyo bwe mmaze okukakasiza ddala buli kintu n’obwegendereza okuva ku by’olubereberye okutuukira ddala ku byasembayo, ne ndaba nga kirungi okukuwandiikira ggwe Teefiro ow’ekitiibwa ennyo, ndyoke mbikuwandiikire nga bwe byaliraanagana. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Olyoke omanye amazima g’ebyo bye wayigirizibwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okulanga Okuzaalibwa kwa Yokaana Omubatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Awo mu biro Kabaka Kerode we yafugira Obuyudaaya, waaliwo kabona erinnya lye Zaakaliya, nga wa mu kitongole kya Abiya, nga mukyala we naye yali wa mu kika kya Alooni, erinnya lye Erisabesi. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Abantu abo bombi baali batuukirivu mu maaso ga Katonda, era nga batambulira mu mateeka ga Katonda gonna, ne mu biragiro bya Mukama, nga tebaliiko kya kunenyezebwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Bombi baali bakaddiye nnyo, era tebaalina mwana, kubanga Erisabesi yali mugumba.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Awo lwali lumu, Zaakaliya bwe yali ng’ali ku mulimu gwe ogw’obwakabona mu maaso ga Katonda, kubanga kye kyali ekiseera eky’oluwalo lwe, <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>n’alondebwa okwoteza obubaane mu yeekaalu ya Mukama, ng’emirimu gy’obwakabona bwe gyabanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Mu ssaawa eyo ey’okwoteza obubaane ekibiina kyonna eky’abantu baali bakuŋŋaanidde mu luggya lwa Yeekaalu.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Awo malayika wa Mukama n’alabikira Zaakaliya, n’ayimirira ku luuyi olwa ddyo olw’ekyoto okwoterezebwa obubaane! <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zaakaliya n’atya nnyo bwe yalaba malayika, entiisa n’emukwata. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Naye malayika n’amugamba nti, “Totya Zaakaliya! Kubanga okusaba kwo kuwuliddwa, era mukazi wo Erisabesi ajja kukuzaalira omwana wabulenzi. Olimutuuma erinnya Yokaana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Mwembi mulisanyuka nnyo ne mujaguza. Era bangi abalibasanyukirako olw’okuzaalibwa kwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Kubanga aliba mukulu mu maaso ga Katonda. Talinywa mwenge wadde ekitamiiza kyonna. Era alijjuzibwa Mwoyo Mutukuvu ng’akyali mu lubuto lwa nnyina. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Era alireetera abaana ba Isirayiri bangi okudda eri Mukama Katonda waabwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Aliweerereza mu mwoyo ne mu maanyi aga nnabbi Eriya, n’akyusa emitima gy’aba kitaabwe okudda eri abaana baabwe, n’okukyusa emitima gy’abajeemu okudda eri amagezi g’abatuukirivu alyoke ateeketeeke abantu okulindirira Mukama.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zaakaliya n’agamba malayika nti, “Ekyo nnaakimanya ntya? Kubanga nze ndi mukadde, ne mukazi wange naye akaddiya nnyo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Malayika n’amugamba nti, “Nze Gabulyeri ayimirira mu maaso ga Katonda, era y’antumye okwogera naawe n’okukuleetera amawulire gano. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Naye olw’okuba nga tokkirizza bigambo byange, ojja kuziba omumwa, era togenda kuddamu kwogera okutuusa ng’ebintu ebyo bimaze okubaawo. Kubanga ebigambo byange byonna birimala kutuukirira mu kiseera kyabyo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Abantu abaali balindirira ebweru wa Yeekaalu okulaba Zaakaliya ne beewuunya nnyo ekyamulwisaayo ennyo bw’atyo. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Oluvannyuma ennyo bwe yavaayo, yali tasobola kwogera nabo, ne bategeera nga mu Yeekaalu afuniddeyo okwolesebwa. N’asigala ng’azibye omumwa naye ng’abategeeza mu bubonero.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>N’abeera mu Yeekaalu okutuusa ennaku ze ez’oluwalo lwe zaggwaako n’alyoka addayo eka. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Ennaku ezo bwe zaayitawo, mukazi we Erisabesi n’aba olubuto, ne yeekwekera ebbanga lya myezi etaano. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>N’agamba nti, “Mukama nga wa kisa kingi, kubanga anziggyeeko ensonyi olw’obutaba na mwana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzaalibwa kwa Yesu Kulangibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Awo mu mwezi ogw’omukaaga, Katonda n’atuma malayika Gabulyeri mu kibuga Nazaaleesi eky’omu Ggaliraaya <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>eri omuwala erinnya lye Maliyamu, nga tamanyi musajja, eyali ayogerezebwa omusajja erinnya lye Yusufu, ow’omu lulyo lwa Dawudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Awo Gabulyeri n’alabikira Maliyamu n’amulamusa nti, “Mirembe! Ggwe aweereddwa omukisa! Mukama ali naawe!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Maliyamu n’atya, n’abulwa n’ekyokwogera, ng’okulamusa okwo kumutabudde, nga n’amakulu gaakwo tagategeera. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Awo malayika n’amugamba nti, “Totya, Maliyamu, kubanga olabye ekisa mu maaso ga Katonda. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Kubanga, laba, olibeera olubuto, olizaala omwana wabulenzi era olimutuuma erinnya, Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Agenda kuba mukulu, wa kitiibwa, era aliyitibwa Omwana w’Oyo Ali Waggulu Ennyo, era Mukama Katonda alimuwa entebe ey’obwakabaka eya jjajjaawe Dawudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Alifuga ennyumba ya Yakobo emirembe gyonna, era n’obwakabaka bwe tebulikoma.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Awo Maliyamu n’abuuza malayika nti, “Ekyo kiriba kitya? Kubanga simanyi musajja.”<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Malayika n’amuddamu nti, “Mwoyo Mutukuvu alikukkako, n’amaanyi g’Oyo Ali Waggulu Ennyo galikubuutikira, n’omwana alizaalibwa aliba mutukuvu, Omwana wa Katonda. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Laba, muganda wo Erisabesi eyayitibwanga omugumba, kati ali lubuto lwa myezi mukaaga mu bukadde bwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Kubanga buli kigambo kiyinzika eri Katonda.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Maliyamu n’addamu nti, “Nze ndi muweereza wa Mukama, kibe ku nze nga bw’ogambye.” Malayika n’ava w’ali, n’agenda.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maliyamu Akyalira Erisabesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Awo mu biro ebyo, Maliyamu n’ayanguwa okugenda mu nsi ya Buyudaaya ey’ensozi, mu kibuga kyayo. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>N’ayingira mu nnyumba ya Zaakaliya n’alamusa Erisabesi. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Naye Maliyamu bwe yalamusa Erisabesi, omwana eyali mu lubuto lwa Erisabesi n’abuukabuuka era n’ajjuzibwa Mwoyo Mutukuvu. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Erisabesi n’alyoka ayogerera mu ddoboozi ery’omwanguka nti, “Oweereddwa omukisa, ggwe mu bakazi, era n’omwana ali mu lubuto lwo aweereddwa omukisa. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Nga nfunye ekitiibwa kinene ggwe nnyina wa Mukama wange okujja okunkyalira! <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Kubanga bw’oyingidde n’onnamusa, omwana ali mu lubuto lwange oluwulidde ku ddoboozi lyo ne yeekyusakyusa olw’essanyu! <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Oweereddwa omukisa bw’okkirizza nti ebintu ebyo Mukama bya kwogeddeko birituukirizibwa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oluyimba lwa Maliyamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Maliyamu n’agamba nti,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>“Emmeeme yange etendereza Mukama.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47">N’omwoyo gwange gusanyukidde Katonda omulokozi wange,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>Kubanga alabye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">obuwombeefu bw’omuweereza we.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Kubanga laba, okuva kaakano, ab’emirembe gyonna banaampitanga eyaweebwa omukisa.<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Kubanga Owaamaanyi ankoledde ebikulu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">N’erinnya lye ttukuvu.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>N’okusaasira kwe kwa mirembe na mirembe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">eri abo abamutya.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Akoze eby’amaanyi n’omukono gwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">Asaasaanyizza ab’emitima egy’amalala.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Awanudde abafuzi ku ntebe zaabwe ez’obwakabaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">n’agulumiza abawombeefu.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Abali mu kwetaaga abakkusizza ebirungi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">Naye abagagga n’abagoba nga tabawaddeeyo kantu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Adduukiridde omuweereza we Isirayiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">n’ajjukira okusaasira,<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>nga bwe yayogera ne bajjajjaffe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">eri Ibulayimu n’ezzadde lye emirembe gyonna.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Maliyamu n’amala ewa Erisabesi muganda we, ng’emyezi esatu, n’alyoka addayo ewuwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzaalibwa kwa Yokaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Awo ekiseera kya Erisabesi eky’okuzaala ne kituuka, n’azaala omwana wabulenzi. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Baliraanwa ba Erisabesi n’ab’ekika kye ne bawulira nga Mukama bw’amulaze ekisa, ne basanyukira wamu naye.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Awo omwana bwe yaweza ennaku omunaana, ne bajja okumukomola, bonna nga balowooza nti ajja kutuumibwa erinnya lya kitaawe Zaakaliya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Naye Erisabesi n’abagamba nti, “Nedda, ajja kutuumibwa Yokaana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Ne bamuwakanya nga bagamba nti, “Mu kika kyo kyonna tetuwulirangayo yatuumibwa linnya eryo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Ne babuuza kitaawe w’omwana erinnya ly’ayagala atuumibwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>N’abasaba eky’okuwandiikako, n’awandiikako nti, “Erinnya lye ye Yokaana!” Bonna ne beewuunya nnyo! <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Amangwago akamwa ka Zaakaliya ne kagguka, n’olulimi lwe ne lusumulukuka, n’atandika okwogera n’okutendereza Katonda. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Abantu bonna ab’omu kitundu ekyo ne batya nnyo, era ebigambo ebyo ne bibuna mu nsi yonna ey’e Buyudaaya ey’ensozi. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Buli eyawulira ebigambo ebyo n’abirowoozaako nnyo mu mutima gwe, ne yeebuuza nti, “Naye omwana ono bw’alikula aliba atya?” Kubanga awatali kubuusabuusa, omukono gwa Mukama gwali wamu naye.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oluyimba lwa Zaakaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Awo Zaakaliya kitaawe, n’ajjula Mwoyo Mutukuvu n’awa obunnabbi nti,<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Atenderezebwe Mukama Katonda wa Isirayiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">kubanga akyalidde abantu be, era abanunudde.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Yatuyimusiriza obuyinza obw’obulokozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">mu nnyumba y’omuddu we Dawudi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Nga bwe yasuubiriza mu bigambo bya bannabbi be abatukuvu ab’edda ennyo,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Okulokolebwa mu balabe baffe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">n’okuva mu mukono gw’abo bonna abatukyawa,<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>okulaga bajjajjaffe ekisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">n’ajjukira n’endagaano ye entukuvu,<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>ekirayiro kye yalayirira jjajjaffe Ibulayimu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>okukituukiriza, n’okulokolebwa okuva mu mukono gw’abalabe baffe awatali kutya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">tulyoke tuweereze mu maaso ge,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>mu butukuvu ne mu butuukirivu ennaku zonna ez’obulamu bwaffe.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>“Naawe, mwana wange, oliyitibwa nnabbi w’Oyo Ali Waggulu Ennyo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">kubanga gw’olikulembera Mukama okumuteekerateekera amakubo ge.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Okumanyisa abantu be obulokozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">obw’okusonyiyibwa ebibi byabwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Byonna birituukirira olw’ekisa kya Katonda waffe ekingi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">Emmambya esala eritukyalira okuva mu ggulu,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>okwakira abo abatudde mu kizikiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">ne mu kisiikirize eky’okufa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">okuluŋŋamya ebigere byaffe mu kkubo ery’emirembe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Omwana n’akula n’ayongerwako amaanyi mu mwoyo, n’abeera mu malungu okutuusa ku lunaku lwe yayolesebwa eri Isirayiri.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuzaalibwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Awo olwatuuka mu biseera ebyo, Kayisaali Agusito n’ayisa etteeka abantu bonna beewandiisa. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Okubala kuno kwe kwasooka okubaawo ku mulembe gwa Kuleniyo nga ye gavana w’Obusuuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Obusuuli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ye Siriya mu biro bya kaakano</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Bonna ne bagenda okwewandiisa, buli muntu mu kibuga ky’ewaabwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Awo Yusufu n’ava e Nazaaleesi eky’e Ggaliraaya, n’agenda mu kibuga kya Dawudi ekiyitibwa Besirekemu eky’e Buyudaaya, kubanga yali wa mu kika kya Dawudi, <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>yeewandiise ne Maliyamu eyali olubuto, oyo gwe yali ayogereza. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Naye bwe baali bali eyo ekiseera kya Maliyamu eky’okuzaala ne kituuka. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>N’azaala omwana we omubereberye omulenzi, n’amubikka mu bugoye, n’amuzazika mu lutiba ente mwe ziriira, kubanga tebaafuna kifo mu nnyumba y’abagenyi.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Mu kiro ekyo waaliwo abasumba abaali mu kitundu ekyo kye kimu ku ttale nga bakuuma endiga zaabwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Awo malayika wa Mukama n’abalabikira, ne waakaayakana n’ekitiibwa kya Mukama, ne batya nnyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Malayika n’abagumya nti, “Temutya, kubanga mbaleetedde amawulire amalungi ag’essanyu eringi, era nga ga bantu bonna. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Kubanga Omulokozi, ye Kristo Mukama waffe azaaliddwa leero mu kibuga kya Dawudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Ku kino kwe munaamutegeerera: Mujja kulaba omwana omuwere, ng’abikkiddwa mu ngoye, ng’azazikiddwa mu lutiba lw’ente.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Amangwago eggye lya bamalayika ab’omu ggulu ne beegatta ne malayika oyo ne batendereza Katonda nga bagamba nti,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Ekitiibwa kibe eri Katonda Ali Waggulu ennyo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">N’emirembe gibe mu nsi eri abantu Katonda b’asiima.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Awo bamalayika bwe baamala okuddayo mu ggulu, abasumba ne bateesa nti, “Tugende e Besirekemu tulabe kino ekibaddewo, Mukama ky’atutegeezezza.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Ne bayanguwa ne bagenda, ne balaba Maliyamu ne Yusufu, n’omwana omuwere ng’azazikiddwa mu lutiba lw’ente. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Awo abasumba ne bategeeza bye baalabye, n’ebya bategeezeddwa ebikwata ku mwana oyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Bonna abaawulira ebigambo by’abasumba ne beewuunya nnyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Naye Maliyamu n’akuumanga ebigambo ebyo mu mutima gwe era ng’abirowoozaako nnyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Awo abasumba ne baddayo gye balundira ebisibo byabwe, nga bagulumiza era nga batendereza Katonda, olw’ebyo byonna bye baawulira era ne bye baalaba nga bwe baali bategeezeddwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Atwalibwa mu Yeekaalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Olunaku olw’omunaana olw’okukomolerwako bwe lwatuuka, n’atuumibwa erinnya <char style="em">Yesu</char>, malayika lye yayogera nga Yesu tannaba kuba mu lubuto lwa nnyina.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Awo ekiseera bwe kyatuuka Maliyamu okugenda mu Yeekaalu atukuzibwe, ng’amateeka ga Musa bwe galagira ne batwala Yesu e Yerusaalemi okumuwaayo eri Mukama. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Kubanga mu mateeka ago, Katonda yalagira nti, “Omwana omubereberye bw’anaabanga omulenzi, anaaweebwangayo eri Mukama.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Era mu kiseera kye kimu bakadde ba Yesu ne bawaayo ssaddaaka amateeka nga bwe galagira okuwaayo amayiba abiri oba enjiibwa bbiri.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Ku lunaku olwo, waaliwo omusajja erinnya lye Simyoni, eyabeeranga mu Yerusaalemi, nga mutuukirivu, ng’atya Katonda, era ng’ajjudde Mwoyo Mutukuvu, ng’alindirira okusanyusibwa kwa Isirayiri. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Kubanga yali abikkuliddwa Mwoyo Mutukuvu nti tagenda kufa nga tannalaba ku Kristo, Omulokozi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Mwoyo Mutukuvu n’amuluŋŋamya okujja mu Yeekaalu. Maliyamu ne Yusufu bwe baaleeta Omwana Yesu okumuwaayo eri Mukama ng’amateeka bwe galagira, ne Simyoni naye yaliwo. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simyoni n’ajja n’asitula Omwana mu mikono gye, n’atendereza Katonda ng’agamba nti,<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Mukama wange, kaakano osiibule omuweereza wo mirembe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">ng’ekigambo kyo bwe kigamba.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Kubanga amaaso gange galabye Obulokozi bwo,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>bwe wateekateeka mu maaso g’abantu bonna,<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>okuba Omusana ogw’okwakira amawanga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">N’okuleetera abantu bo Abayisirayiri ekitiibwa!”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Kitaawe w’omwana ne nnyina ne beewuunya ebigambo ebyayogerwa ku Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Awo Simyoni n’abasabira omukisa. N’alyoka n’agamba Maliyamu nti, “Omwana ono bangi mu Isirayiri tebagenda kumukkiriza, era alireetera bangi okugwa n’abalala ne bayimusibwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Era naawe ennaku eri ng’ekitala erikufumita omutima, n’ebirowoozo by’omu mitima gy’abantu birimanyibwa.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Waaliwo nnabbi omukazi, ayitibwa Ana, muwala wa Fanweri, ow’omu kika kya Aseri, era nga mukadde nnyo, eyafumbirwa nga muwala muto n’amala ne bba emyaka musanvu gyokka, bba n’afa, <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>n’asigala nga nnamwandu. Mu kiseera kino yali yaakamala emyaka kinaana mu ena, era teyavanga mu Yeekaalu ng’asiiba n’okwegayiriranga Katonda emisana n’ekiro. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Awo Ana mu kiseera ekyo yali ayimiridde okumpi ne Maliyamu ne Yusufu, naye n’atandika okutendereza Katonda ng’amwogerako eri abo bonna abaali balindirira okununulibwa kwa Yerusaalemi.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Awo bakadde ba Yesu bwe baamala okutuukiriza byonna ng’amateeka ga Mukama bwe galagira, ne baddayo e Nazaaleesi eky’omu Ggaliraaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Omwana n’akula, n’aba w’amaanyi, n’ajjuzibwa amagezi n’ekisa kya Katonda kyali ku ye.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Bakadde ba Yesu buli mwaka bagendanga mu Yerusaalemi ku Mbaga y’Okuyitako. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Awo Yesu bwe yaweza emyaka kkumi n’ebiri egy’obukulu n’ayambuka e Yerusaalemi ne bakadde be ku mbaga, nga empisa yaabwe bwe yali. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Awo embaga ng’ewedde, ne bakyusa okuddayo ewaabwe, naye omulenzi Yesu n’asigala mu Yerusaalemi, naye bazadde be ne batakimanya. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Kubanga baalowooza nti ali ne bannaabwe mu kibiina ekirala, ekiro ekyo bwe bataamulaba, ne bamunoonya mu kibiina omwali baganda baabwe ne mikwano gyabwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Bwe bataamulaba kwe kuddayo e Yerusaalemi nga bamunoonya. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Awo nga baakamunoonyeza ennaku ssatu, ne bamusanga ng’atudde mu Yeekaalu n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka ng’abawuliriza awamu n’okubabuuza ebibuuzo. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Bonna abaali bamuwuliriza ne beewuunya nnyo olw’amagezi ge n’okuddamu kwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Awo bazadde be bwe baamulaba ne beewuunya nnyo, nnyina n’amugamba nti, “Mwana waffe otukoze ki kino? Kitaawo nange tweraliikiridde nnyo nga tukunoonya!”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Yesu n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Mubadde munnoonyeza ki? Temwategedde nga kiŋŋwanidde okukola ebintu bya Kitange?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Naye ne batategeera bigambo ebyo bye yabagamba.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>N’asituka n’agenda nabo e Nazaaleesi, n’abagonderanga; kyokka nnyina ebigambo ebyo byonna n’abikuuma mu mutima gwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Awo Yesu n’akula mu mubiri, mu magezi, era n’alaba ekisa mu maaso ga Katonda ne mu maaso g’abantu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yokaana Omubatiza Alongoosa Ekkubo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Awo mu mwaka ogw’ekkumi n’ettaano ogw’okufuga kwa Kayisaali Tiberiyo, Pontiyo Piraato bwe yali nga ye gavana wa Buyudaaya, Kerode nga y’afuga Ggaliraaya, muganda we Firipo nga y’afuga Italiya ne Tirakoniti, ne Lusaniya nga y’afuga Abireene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Ana ne Kayaafa nga be Bakabona Abasinga Obukulu, Yokaana, mutabani wa Zaakaliya ng’ali mu ddungu, n’afuna obubaka obuva eri Katonda. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Yokaana n’atambulanga ng’agenda abuulira mu bitundu ebyetoolodde Yoludaani, ng’ategeeza abantu obubaka obw’okubatizibwa obw’okwenenya olw’okusonyiyibwa ebibi, <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>nga bwe kyawandiikibwa mu kitabo eky’ebigambo bya nnabbi Isaaya nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Eddoboozi ly’oyo ayogerera mu ddungu nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Mulongoose ekkubo lya Mukama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Muluŋŋamye amakubo ge;<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Buli kiwonvu kirijjuzibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">na buli lusozi n’akasozi birisendebwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">na buli ekyakyama kirigololwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">n’obukubo obulimu obugulumugulumu bulifuuka enguudo ez’omuseetwe.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Abalina omubiri bonna baliraba obulokozi bwa Katonda.”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Kyeyava agamba abantu abajjanga gy’ali okubatizibwa nti, “Mmwe abaana b’emisota, ani eyabalabula okudduka obusungu obugenda okujja? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Kale mubale ebibala ebiraga nga mwenenyezza, so temwogera munda zammwe nti tulina jjajjaffe Ibulayimu. Kubanga mbagamba nti Katonda asobola, mu mayinja gano, okuggyiramu Ibulayimu abazzukulu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Ne kaakano embazzi eteekeddwa ku kikolo ky’emiti. Noolwekyo buli muti ogutabala bibala birungi gujja kutemebwawo gusuulibwe mu muliro.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Ekibiina ne kimumubuuza nti, “Kale tukole ki?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Yokaana n’abaddamu ng’agamba nti, “Alina ekkooti ebbiri, emu agigabire atalina, n’oyo alina emmere aweeko oyo atalina kyakulya.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Awo abasolooza b’omusolo nabo, ne bajja babatizibwe. Ne babuuza Yokaana nti, “Omuyigiriza tukole ki?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Yokaana n’abaddamu nti, “Temusoloozanga muwendo gusukka ku ogwo ogwalagibwa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Abaserikale nabo ne babuuza Yokaana nti, “Ate ffe, tukole tutya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Yokaana n’abagamba nti, “Temuggyangako bantu nsimbi zaabwe. So temubawaayirizanga, n’empeera ebaweebwa ebamalenga.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Abantu baali balindirira nga basuubira, era nga buli muntu yeebuuza obanga Yokaana ye Kristo. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Yokaana n’addamu bonna ng’agamba nti, “Nze mbabatiza na mazzi, naye waliwo ajja, alina obuyinza okunsinga, n’okusaanira sisaanira na kusumulula lukoba lwa ngatto ze. Oyo alibabatiza n’omuliro ne Mwoyo Mutukuvu; <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>n’olugali luli mu mukono gwe okulongoosa egguuliro lye n’okukuŋŋaanyiza eŋŋaano mu tterekero lye, naye ebisusunku alibyokya n’omuliro ogutazikira.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Yokaana n’abuulirira abantu ebigambo bingi ebirala, nga bw’ababuulira Enjiri.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Naye Yokaana bwe yanenya Kerode, omufuzi, olw’okutwala Kerodiya eyali muka muganda we, n’olw’ebibi ebirala Kerode bye yali akoze, <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>ate ku ebyo byonna Kerode n’ayongerako na kino: n’akwata Yokaana n’amuggalira mu kkomera.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okubatizibwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Olunaku lumu, abantu bonna abaaliwo nga babatizibwa, ne Yesu n’abatizibwa. Yesu n’asaba, eggulu ne libikkuka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Mwoyo Mutukuvu n’amukkako mu kifaananyi eky’ejjiba. Eddoboozi ne liva mu ggulu ne ligamba nti, “Ggwe Mwana wange omwagalwa gwe nsanyukira ennyo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olulyo lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesu yali awezezza emyaka ng’amakumi asatu bwe yatandika omulimu gwe. Yesu nga bwe kyalowoozebwa, yali mwana wa Yusufu:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 3:23"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">ne Yusufu nga mwana wa Eri, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Eri nga mwana wa Mattati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">ne Mattati nga mwana wa Leevi, ne Leevi nga mwana wa Mereki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">ne Mereki nga mwana wa Yanayi, ne Yanayi nga mwana wa Yusufu,<verse eid="LUK 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>ne Yusufu nga mwana wa Mattasiya, ne Mattasiya nga mwana wa Amosi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">ne Amosi nga mwana wa Nakkumu, ne Nakkumu nga mwana wa Esuli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">ne Esuli nga mwana wa Naggayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>ne Naggayi nga mwana wa Maasi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">ne Maasi nga mwana wa Mattasiya, ne Mattasiya nga mwana wa Semeyini,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">ne Semeyini nga mwana wa Yoseki, ne Yoseki nga mwana wa Yoda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>ne Yoda nga mwana wa Yokanaani, ne Yokanaani nga mwana wa Lesa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">ne Lesa nga mwana wa Zerubbaberi, ne Zerubbaberi nga mwana wa Seyalutyeri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">ne Seyalutyeri nga mwana wa Neeri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>ne Neeri nga mwana wa Mereki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">ne Mereki nga mwana wa Addi, ne Addi nga mwana wa Kosamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">ne Kosamu nga mwana wa Erumadamu, ne Erumadamu nga mwana wa Eri,<verse eid="LUK 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>ne Eri nga mwana wa Yoswa, ne Yoswa nga mwana wa Eryeza,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">ne Eryeza nga mwana wa Yolimu, ne Yolimu nga mwana wa Mattati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">ne Mattati nga mwana wa Leevi,<verse eid="LUK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>ne Leevi nga mwana wa Simyoni, ne Simyoni nga mwana wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">ne Yuda nga mwana wa Yusufu, ne Yusufu nga mwana wa Yonamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">ne Yonamu nga mwana wa Eriyakimu,<verse eid="LUK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>ne Eriyakimu nga mwana wa Mereya, ne Mereya nga mwana wa Menna,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">ne Menna nga mwana wa Mattasa, ne Mattasa nga mwana wa Nasani,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">ne Nasani nga mwana wa Dawudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>ne Dawudi nga mwana wa Yese,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">ne Yese nga mwana wa Obedi, ne Obedi nga mwana wa Bowaazi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">ne Bowaazi nga mwana wa Salumooni, ne Salumooni nga mwana wa Nakusoni,<verse eid="LUK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>ne Nakusoni nga mwana wa Amminadaabu, ne Aminadaabu nga mwana wa Aluni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">ne Aluni nga mwana wa Kezulooni, ne Kezulooni nga mwana wa Pereezi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">ne Pereezi nga mwana wa Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>ne Yuda nga mwana wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">ne Yakobo nga mwana wa Isaaka, ne Isaaka nga mwana wa lbulayimu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">ne Ibulayimu nga mwana wa Teera, ne Teera nga mwana wa Nakoli,<verse eid="LUK 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>ne Nakoli nga mwana wa Serugi, ne Serugi nga mwana wa Lewu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">ne Lewu nga mwana wa Peregi, ne Peregi nga mwana wa Eberi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">ne Eberi nga mwana wa Seera, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>ne Sera nga mwana wa Kayinaani,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">ne Kayinaani nga mwana wa Alupakusaadi, ne Alupakusaadi nga mwana wa Seemu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">ne Seemu nga mwana wa Nuuwa, ne Nuuwa nga mwana wa Lameka,<verse eid="LUK 3:36"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>ne Lameka nga mwana wa Mesuseera, ne Mesuseera nga mwana wa Enoki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">ne Enoki nga mwana wa Yaledi, ne Yaledi nga mwana wa Makalaleri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">ne Makalaleri nga mwana wa Kayinaani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>ne Kayinaani nga mwana wa Enosi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">ne Enosi nga mwana wa Seezi, ne Seezi nga mwana wa Adamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">ne Adamu nga mwana wa Katonda.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Okukemebwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Awo Yesu, ng’ajjudde Mwoyo Mutukuvu, n’avaayo ku mugga Yoludaani, Omwoyo n’amutwala mu ddungu, <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>n’akemebwa Setaani okumala ennaku amakumi ana. Ebbanga eryo lyonna yalimala nga talidde ku mmere, bwe lyaggwaako enjala n’emuluma.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Setaani n’agamba Yesu nti, “Obanga oli, Mwana wa Katonda, gamba ejjinja lino lifuuke emmere.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Naye Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Kyawandiikibwa nti, ‘Omuntu taabenga mulamu lwa mmere yokka.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Awo Setaani n’amulinnyisa waggulu, mu kaseera katono n’amulaga obwakabaka bwonna obw’omu nsi. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Setaani n’amugamba nti, “Nzija kukuwa obuyinza ku obwo bwonna n’ekitiibwa kyabwo, kubanga bwonna bwa mpeebwa era nnyinza okubuwa omuntu yenna gwe njagala. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Bw’onoofukamira n’onsinza byonna ebyo bijja kuba bibyo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Naye Yesu n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Kyawandiikibwa nti, ‘Osinzanga Mukama Katonda wo, era gw’oweerezanga yekka.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Ate Setaani n’amutwala mu Yerusaalemi, n’amulinnyisa waggulu ku kasolya ka Yeekaalu awasingira ddala obutumbiivu, n’amugamba nti, “Obanga oli Mwana wa Katonda, buuka weesuule wansi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Kubanga kyawandiikibwa nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">“ ‘Katonda aliragira bamalayika be</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">bakukuume.<verse eid="LUK 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Era balikuwanirira mu mikono gyabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">oleme okwerumya nga weekonye ekigere kyo ku jjinja.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yesu n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Kyawandiikibwa nti, ‘Tokemanga Mukama Katonda wo.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Awo Setaani bwe yamaliriza okukema Yesu mu buli ngeri yonna, n’amuviira okutuusa ekiseera ekirala.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Atandika Omulimu gwe mu Ggaliraaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Awo Yesu n’akomawo mu Ggaliraaya ng’ajjudde amaanyi aga Mwoyo Mutukuvu, n’ayogerwako mu bitundu byonna ebyetoolodde mu byalo. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>N’ayigirizanga mu makuŋŋaaniro gaabwe, era bonna ne bamutendereza.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Bwe yatuuka e Nazaaleesi, ekibuga mwe yakulira, n’agenda mu kkuŋŋaaniro ku Ssabbiiti, nga bwe yali empisa ye. N’ayimuka okusoma. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Ne bamuwa ekitabo kya nnabbi Isaaya, n’abikkula omuzingo gw’empapula n’alaba awagamba nti,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omwoyo wa Mukama ali ku nze.</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">Anfuseeko amafuta okubuulira abaavu Enjiri.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">Antumye okubuulira abasibe okuteebwa,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">n’abazibe b’amaaso okuzibulwa amaaso balabe,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">n’abanyigirizibwa okufuna eddembe,</char><verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>
    <char style="wj">n’okulangirira ekiseera kya Mukama eky’okulagiramu ekisa kye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>N’azingako omuzingo n’aguddiza omuweereza, n’atuula. Abantu bonna mu kkuŋŋaaniro ne bamusimba amaaso. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>N’atandika okubategeeza nti, <char style="wj">“Olwa leero, Ebyawandiikibwa bino bye muwulidde bituukiridde!”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Bonna abaaliwo ne bamutenda nga beewuunya ebigambo bye ebyekisa ebyava mu kamwa ke, nga bwe beebuuza nti, “Ono si ye mutabani wa Yusufu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ddala ddala muliyinza n’okuŋŋamba mu lugero luno nti, ‘Omusawo, weewonye,’ nga mugamba nti, ‘Buli kye twawulira mu Kaperunawumu, kikolere na wano mu kyalo kyo.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Naye n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ddala ddala mbagamba nti, Tewali nnabbi ayanirizibwa mu kyalo ky’ewaabwe!</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/><char style="wj">Naye mazima mbagamba nti, waaliwo bannamwandu bangi mu biseera bya nnabbi Eriya, mu Isirayiri enkuba bwe yamala emyaka esatu n’ekitundu nga tetonnya, n’enjala n’egwa mu nsi yonna.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/><char style="wj">Naye nnabbi Eriya teyatumibwa eri omu ku bannamwandu abo, wabula yatumibwa eri nnamwandu ow’e Zalefaasi mu Sidoni.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/><char style="wj">Ne mu biseera bya nnabbi Erisa waaliwo abagenge</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kiyinza okuba endwadde endala ez’olususu</char></note> <char style="wj">bangi mu Isirayiri, naye tewali n’omu ku bo eyalongoosebwa okuggyako Naamani Omusuuli.”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Bonna abaali mu kuŋŋaaniro ne bakwatibwa obusungu olw’ebigambo ebyo, <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>ne basituka, ne bamusindiikiriza okumutuusa ebweru w’ekibuga ku bbangabanga ly’olusozi ekibuga kyabwe kwe kyazimbibwa, bamusindike agwe eri wansi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Naye n’abayitamu wakati ne yeetambulira.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Agoba Dayimooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Awo Yesu n’alaga e Kaperunawumu, ekibuga eky’e Ggaliraaya n’abayigirizanga ku nnaku eza Ssabbiiti. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Ne beewuunya nnyo okuyigiriza kwe. Kubanga yayogeranga nga nnannyini buyinza.<verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Mu kkuŋŋaaniro, mwalimu omusajja eyaliko ddayimooni n’atandika okuwowoggana nti, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Woowe! Otulanga ki, ggwe Yesu ow’e Nazaaleesi? Ozze kutuzikiriza? Nze nkumanyi, ggwe mutukuvu wa Katonda.”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesu n’amuboggolera ng’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Sirika! Muveeko!”</char> Awo dayimooni n’asuula eri omusajja wansi wakati mu bantu, n’amuvaako nga tamulumizza.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Buli muntu n’atya nnyo nga bwe beebuuzaganya nti, “Kigambo ki kino? Kubanga alagira n’obuyinza n’amaanyi emyoyo emibi ne giva mu muntu, ekireetera ne dayimooni okumugondera.” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Amawulire agakwata ku Yesu ne gabuna mu kitundu ekyo kyonna ekyetoolodde awo.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awonya Abalwadde Bangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Awo Yesu bwe yava mu kkuŋŋaaniro, n’alaga mu maka ga Simooni. Yasanga nnyina mukazi wa Simooni omusujja gumuluma nnyo, abantu ne bamwegayiririra ku lulwe. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Yesu n’ayimirira okumpi n’omulwadde we yali, n’alagira omusujja gumuwoneko, amangwago omulwadde n’awona, n’asituka n’abaweereza!<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Obudde bwe bwali buwungeera, abantu bonna abaalina abalwadde ab’endwadde eza buli ngeri, ne babaleeta eri Yesu, n’abassaako emikono buli omu n’amuwonya. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Abamu baaliko baddayimooni, Yesu n’abalagira ne bava ku balwadde nga bwe baleekaana nti, “Ggwe Mwana wa Katonda.” Naye kubanga baamumanya nga ye Kristo, n’atabaganya kukyogerako.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Bwe bwakya Yesu n’alaga mu kifo etali bantu. Ekibiina ky’abantu ne bamunoonya, okutuusa lwe baamulaba ne balaga gy’ali ne bamwegayirira aleme kubavaako. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Naye n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Kinsaanira okubuulira Enjiri y’obwakabaka bwa Katonda ne mu bifo ebirala kubanga eyo y’ensonga kyenava ntumibwa.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Yesu ne yeeyongera okubuulira mu makuŋŋaaniro gaabwe mu Buyudaaya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Abayigirizwa Abaasooka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Awo Yesu yali ayimiridde ku lubalama lw’ennyanja y’e Genesaleeti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ye Nnyanja ey’e Ggaliraaya</char></note> ng’ayigiriza, ebibiina nga bamunyigiriza nga bawuliriza ekigambo kya Katonda, <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>n’alengera amaato abiri ameereere nga gali kumpi n’olukalu, nga bannannyinigo abavubi, bagalese awo, nga bayoza obutimba bwabwe. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yesu n’alinnya mu lyato erimu eryali erya Simooni, n’amusaba alisembezeeko katono mu nnyanja, n’alituulamu, asinziire omwo okuyigiriza ebibiina.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Bwe yamala okuyigiriza n’agamba Simooni nti, <char style="wj">“Kale kaakano sembeza eryato lyo ebuziba, mu mazzi amangi, musuule obutimba bwammwe mu nnyanja, mujja kukwasa ebyennyanja bingi!”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simooni n’addamu nti, “Mukama waffe, twateganye dda ekiro kyonna, naye ne tutakwasa kantu. Naye ggwe nga bw’otugambye, nzija kusuula obutimba.”<verse eid="LUK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Awo bwe baakola bwe batyo, obutimba bwabwe bwajjula ebyennyanja, ne butandika n’okukutuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Ne bawenya ku bannaabwe abaali mu lyato liri eddala bajje babayambe, ne bajja, amaato gombi ne gajjula ebyennyanja, ne gajula n’okusaanawo.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Awo Simooni Peetero bwe yakiraba, n’afukamira mu maaso ga Yesu n’amugamba nti, “Mukama wange, nkwegayiridde ndeka, kubanga ndi mwonoonyi nnyo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Kubanga obungi bw’ebyennyanja bye baakwasa bwa muwuniikirizza nnyo awamu ne banne bwe baavubanga, <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Yakobo ne Yokaana abaana ba Zebbedaayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Totya! Okuva kaakano ojjanga kuvuba myoyo gya bantu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Amaato gaabwe olwagoba ku lubalama ne baleka awo byonna ne bagenda naye.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awonya Omusajja Omugenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Mu kibuga Yesu mwe yali akyadde mwalimu omusajja eyali alwadde ebigenge. Bwe yalaba Yesu n’avuunama mu maaso ge, n’amwegayirira nti, “Mukama wange, bw’oba ng’oyagala, oyinza okunnongoosa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesu n’agolola omukono gwe n’amukwatako, ng’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Njagala, longooka.”</char> Amangwago ebigenge by’omusajja ne bimuwonako.<verse eid="LUK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yesu n’alagira omusajja nti, <char style="wj">“Tobaako muntu n’omu gw’ogamba, naye genda weeyanjule eri kabona oweeyo ekiweebwayo olw’okulongosebwa nga Musa bwe yalagira, kibeere obujulirwa gye bali.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Naye ne yeeyongera bweyongezi okubunya ettutumu ly’obuyinza bwa Yesu era ebibiina binene ne bikuŋŋaana okumuwulira n’okuwonyezebwa endwadde zaabwe. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Naye bwe yasalangawo akabanga, ne yeeyawula n’alagako mu bifo eteri bantu, okusaba.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awonya Akoozimbye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Lwali lumu Yesu yali ayigiriza abakulembeze b’Abayudaaya, n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka nabo nga batudde awo, abaali bavudde mu buli kyalo eky’e Ggaliraaya ne Buyudaaya era n’e Yerusaalemi. Amaanyi ga Mukama gaali ku ye okuwonya. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Awo abasajja ne bajja nga basitudde omusajja ku katanda eyali akoozimbye. Ne bagezaako okumuyingiza okumuleeta Yesu we yali. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Naye bwe bataasobola kumuyingiza olw’ekibiina ekinene ne balinnya waggulu ku kasolya, ne baggyawo ku mategula ne bayisaamu omulwadde ne bamussa ng’agalamidde ku katanda ke ne baamutereereza ddala mu maaso ga Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Awo Yesu bwe yalaba okukkiriza kwabwe, n’agamba omusajja akoozimbye nti, <char style="wj">“Omusajja, ebibi byo bikusonyiyiddwa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Abafalisaayo n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka ne beebuuzaganya nti, “Ono ye ani avvoola! Ani ayinza okusonyiwa ebibi wabula Katonda yekka?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Nate Yesu bwe yamanya ebirowoozo byabwe, n’ababuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Lwaki mulowooza bwe mutyo mu mutima gwammwe?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/><char style="wj">Ekyangu kye kiri wa? Okwogera nti ebibi byo bikusonyiyiddwa oba nti situka otambule?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/><char style="wj">Naye mulyoke mutegeere nti, Omwana w’Omuntu alina obuyinza ku nsi okusonyiwa ebibi.”</char> N’agamba eyali akozimbye nti, <char style="wj">“Situka, ositule akatanda ko, weddireyo ewuwo.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Amangwago omusajja n’asituka n’asitula akatanda kwe yali agalamidde, n’addayo ewuwe ng’agulumiza Katonda. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Abantu bonna ne bajjula encukwe. Ne bagulumiza Katonda nga bajjudde entiisa nga boogera nti, “Tulabye ebyewuunyisa leero.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ayita Leevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Oluvannyuma lw’ebyo Yesu n’avaayo n’alaba omusolooza w’omusolo, erinnya lye Leevi ng’atudde omusolo we gukuŋŋaanyizibwa, n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ngoberera.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Leevi n’aleka awo byonna, n’asitukiramu n’amugoberera.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Awo Leevi n’afumbira Yesu ekijjulo eky’amaanyi mu maka ge. Waaliwo abasolooza banne ab’omusolo bangi, n’abantu abalala bangi, abaali ku kijjulo ekyo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Naye Abafalisaayo n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka ne beemulugunya, olw’abayigirizwa be nga bagamba nti, “Lwaki mulya era ne munywa n’abasolooza b’omusolo n’abalina ebibi?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesu n’abaanukula nti, <char style="wj">“Abalwadde be beetaaga omusawo, so si abo abatali balwadde.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/><char style="wj">Sajja kuyita batuukirivu wabula abalina ebibi okwenenya.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Kyokka ne bamugamba nti, “Abayigirizwa ba Yokaana batera okusiiba n’okusaba. N’abayigirizwa b’Abafalisaayo nabo bwe batyo. Naye ababo balya ne banywa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Naye Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Abagenyi bayinza okusiiba ng’awasizza omugole akyali nabo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/><char style="wj">Naye ekiseera kijja, awasizza omugole ng’abaggiddwako olwo ne balyoka basiiba.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Awo Yesu n’abagerera olugero nti, <char style="wj">“Tewali ayuza kiwero mu lugoye oluggya alyoke azibise ekituli mu lugoye olukadde. Bw’akikola, ekiwero ekiggya kiyuza olukadde, n’ekiwero ekiggya tekijja kugendera wamu na lugoye olukadde.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/><char style="wj">Era tewali ateeka wayini omusu mu nsawo enkadde ez’amaliba ga wayini, kubanga wayini omusu ajja kuziyuza ayiike.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/><char style="wj">Naye wayini omusu ateekebwa mu nsawo za maliba empya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/><char style="wj">Era tewali anywa ku wayini omukadde ate ayagala okunywa ku wayini omusu. Kubanga agamba nti, ‘Omukadde ye asinga omusu.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ye Mukama wa Ssabbiiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Awo ku lunaku lumu olwa Ssabbiiti, Yesu n’abayigirizwa be bwe baali bayita mu nnimiro y’emmere ey’empeke, abayigirizwa be ne banoga ku birimba by’emmere ey’empeke ne babikunya mu ngalo zaabwe, ne balya. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Naye Abafalisaayo abamu ne bagamba nti, “Lwaki mukola ekitakkirizibwa ku Ssabbiiti?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesu n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Temusomanga ku Dawudi kye yakola, enjala bwe yamuluma n’abo be yali nabo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/><char style="wj">Yayingira mu nnyumba ya Katonda, n’addira emigaati egy’okulaga, n’atoola n’alyako, n’awaako ne be yali nabo ne balya so ng’ekyo kyali tekikkirizibwa muntu yenna okuggyako bakabona.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Omwana w’Omuntu, ye Mukama wa Ssabbiiti.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awonya Omusajja ow’Omukono Ogukaze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Ku lunaku lwa Ssabbiiti olulala Yesu yali ng’ayigiriza mu kkuŋŋaaniro nga mulimu n’omusajja eyalina omukono ogukaze. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Abannyonnyozi b’amateeka n’Abafalisaayo ne bamusimbako amaaso okulaba obanga anaawonya ku Ssabbiiti, babeeko n’ekintu kye baneekwasa bamuvunaane omusango. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Naye Yesu n’ategeera ebirowoozo byabwe. N’agamba omusajja eyalina omukono ogukaze nti, <char style="wj">“Situka oyimirire wakati wano.”</char> N’asituka n’ayimirira.<verse eid="LUK 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Yesu n’alyoka agamba Abafalisaayo n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka nti, <char style="wj">“Muleke mbabuuze; Kirungi okukola ekirungi ku Ssabbiiti oba okukola ekibi? Kirungi okuwonya obulamu oba okubuzikiriza?”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>N’abeetoolooza amaaso kinnoomu, n’alyoka agamba omusajja nti, <char style="wj">“Golola omukono gwo.”</char> Omusajja n’agolola omukono gwe ne guwona. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Naye ne bajjula obusungu, ne boogera bokka ne bokka kye banaakola Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abatume Ekkumi n’Ababiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Awo olwatuuka mu nnaku ezo, Yesu n’alinnya waggulu ku lusozi okusaba, n’asaba ekiro kyonna eri Katonda. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Obudde bwe bwakya, n’ayita abayigirizwa be n’abalondako kkumi n’ababiri, n’abafuula abatume. Amannya gaabwe ge gano:<verse eid="LUK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simooni, gwe yatuuma Peetero, ne Andereya, muganda wa Simooni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">ne Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">ne Yokaana,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">ne Firipo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">ne Battolomaayo,<verse eid="LUK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>ne Matayo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">ne Tomasi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">ne Yakobo, omwana wa Alufaayo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">ne Simooni, ow’omu kibiina ky’obufuzi eky’Abazerote,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abazerote </char><char style="ft" closed="false">baali balwanirizi ba ddembe nga baagala eggwanga lyabwe okwefuga babeere n’Obwakabaka obwabwe</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>ne Yuda, omwana wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:16">ne Yuda Isukalyoti, oluvannyuma eyamulyamu olukwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ayigiriza era Awonya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Awo Yesu bwe yava ku lusozi awamu nabo, n’ayimirira wansi w’olusozi mu lusenyi awatereevu, ekibiina kinene eky’abayigirizwa be, n’ekibiina kinene eky’abantu abaava mu Buyudaaya yonna ne Yerusaalemi n’ebitundu eby’oku lubalama lw’ennyanja olwa Ttuulo ne Sidoni, <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>ne bajja okumuwuliriza n’okuwonyezebwa endwadde zaabwe. Abo abaali batawaanyizibwa emyoyo emibi ne bawonyezebwa; <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>era abantu bonna ne bafuba okumukwatako, kubanga amaanyi agawonya gaamuvangamu nga gawonya buli muntu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Awo Yesu n’atunuulira abayigirizwa be enkaliriza n’agamba nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">“Mulina omukisa abaavu,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">kubanga obwakabaka bwa Katonda bwammwe.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>
    <char style="wj">Mulina omukisa abalumwa enjala kaakano,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">kubanga mulikkusibwa.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">Mulina omukisa abakaaba kaakano,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">kubanga muliseka.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>
    <char style="wj">Mulina omukisa bwe babakyawa, ne babeewala, ne babavuma,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">ne basiiga erinnya lyammwe enziro,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">olw’Omwana w’Omuntu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Musanyukanga ku lunaku olwo ne mujaguza, kubanga empeera yammwe nnene mu ggulu, kubanga ebintu ebyo bajjajjammwe baabikola bannabbi abaabasooka.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye zibasanze mmwe abagagga,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">
    <char style="wj">kubanga mufunye essanyu lyammwe erijjuvu.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>
    <char style="wj">Zibasanze mmwe abalya ne mukkuta kaakano,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">kubanga mulirumwa enjala.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">Zibasanze mmwe abaseka kaakano,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">kubanga mulikungubaga, ne mukaaba.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>
    <char style="wj">Zibasanze mmwe abantu bonna bwe babawaana,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">
    <char style="wj">kubanga bwe batyo bajjajjammwe bwe baayisa bannabbi aboobulimba.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye mmwe abampuliriza mbagamba nti: Mwagalenga abalabe bammwe, n’ababakyawa mubayisenga bulungi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/><char style="wj">Ababakolimira mubasabirenga omukisa; ababayisa obubi mubasabirenga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/><char style="wj">Omuntu bw’akukubanga oluyi ku luba olumu, omukyusizanga n’akukuba ne ku lwokubiri! Omuntu bw’akunyagangako ekkooti yo, n’essaati yo ogimulekeranga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/><char style="wj">Omuntu yenna akusabanga omuwanga; era n’oyo akuggyangako ebintu byo tobimusabanga kubikuddizza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/><char style="wj">Kye mwagala abantu okubakoleranga, nammwe mubibakoleranga bwe mutyo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bwe munaayagalanga abo ababaagala bokka, munaagasibwa ki? Kubanga n’abakozi b’ebibi bwe beeyisa bwe batyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/><char style="wj">Bwe munaayisanga obulungi abo bokka ababayisa obulungi, munaagasibwa ki? Kubanga n’abakozi b’ebibi bwe bakola bwe batyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/><char style="wj">Bwe munaawolanga abo bokka be musuubira okubasasula mmwe, munaagasibwangamu ki? Kubanga n’abakozi b’ebibi bawola bakozi ba bibi bannaabwe, basobole okusasulwa omuwendo gwe gumu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/><char style="wj">Naye mmwe mwagalenga abalabe bammwe! Mubayisenga bulungi! Muwolenga nga temusuubira kusasulwa magoba. Bw’etyo empeera yammwe eriba nnene era muliba baana b’oyo Ali Waggulu Ennyo. Kubanga wa kisa eri abatasiima n’abakozi b’ebibi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/><char style="wj">Mubeerenga ba kisa nga Kitammwe bw’ali ow’ekisa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okusalira Abalala Emisango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>
    <char style="wj">“Temusalanga musango, nammwe muleme okusalirwa omusango. Temusingisanga musango, nammwe muleme okusingibwa. Musonyiwenga era nammwe mulisonyiyibwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/><char style="wj">Mugabenga nammwe muliweebwa. Ekigera ekirungi ekikattiddwa, ekisuukundiddwa, eky’omuyiika kiribakwasibwa. Kubanga ekigera kye mugereramu nammwe mwe muligererwa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Awo Yesu n’abagerera olugero luno nti, <char style="wj">“Ddala ddala omuzibe w’amaaso ayinza okukulembera muzibe munne? Bombi tebajja kugwa mu kinnya?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/><char style="wj">Omuyizi tasaana kusinga amuyigiriza, kyokka bw’aba ng’atendekeddwa bulungi, buli muntu aliba ng’omusomesa we.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>
    <char style="wj">“Lwaki otunuulira akasasiro akali ku liiso lya muganda wo, naye n’otolaba kisiki kiri ku liiso lyo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/><char style="wj">Oyinza otya okugamba muganda wo nti, ‘Muganda wange, leka nkuggyeko akasasiro akakuli ku liiso,’ naye nga ekisiki ekiri ku liryo tokiraba? Munnanfuusi ggwe! Sooka oggyeko ekisiki ku liiso lyo, olyoke olabe bulungi olwo oggyeko akasasiro akali ku liiso lya muganda wo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omuti omulungi tegubala bibala bibi, so n’omuti omubi tegubala bibala birungi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/><char style="wj">Buli muti gutegeererwa ku bibala byagwo. Abantu tebanoga ttiini ku busaana so tebanoga mizabbibu ku mweramannyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/><char style="wj">Omuntu omulungi afulumya ebirungi okuva mu mutima gwe omulungi, n’omuntu omubi afulumya ebibi okuva mu mutima gwe omubi. Kubanga akamwa koogera ku biba bijjudde mu mutima.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuzimbi omugezi n’atali mugezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>
    <char style="wj">“Lwaki mumpita nti, ‘Mukama waffe, Mukama waffe,’ so nga bye mbagamba si bye mukola?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/><char style="wj">Buli ajja gye ndi n’awulira ebigambo byange, n’abikola, ka mbalage bw’afaanana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/><char style="wj">Afaanana ng’omuntu eyazimba ennyumba, eyasima omusingi wansi ennyo n’atuuka ku lwazi. Amataba bwe gajja, ne gajjuza omugga tegaasobola kunyeenya nnyumba eyo kubanga yazimbibwa bulungi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/><char style="wj">Naye omuntu awuliriza ebigambo byange n’atabikola, afaanana n’omusajja eyazimba ennyumba ku ttaka nga tasimye musingi. Omugga bwe gwajjula, ne gwanjaala, ne gukuba ennyumba n’egwa, era n’okugwa kw’ennyumba eyo kwali kunene nnyo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Okukkiriza kw’Omuserikale Omuruumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Awo Yesu bwe yamala okutegeeza abantu ebigambo ebyo byonna n’ayingira mu Kaperunawumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Mu kiseera ekyo, omukulu w’ekitongole ky’abaserikale ekikumi, yalina omuddu we gwe yali ayagala ennyo, yali mulwadde nnyo ng’ali kumpi n’okufa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Omukulu w’ekitongole oyo bwe yawulira ebifa ku Yesu, n’atuma abamu ku bakulembeze b’Abayudaaya eri Yesu bamusabe ajje awonye omuddu we. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Bwe baatuuka eri Yesu ne bamwegayirira nnyo nga bagamba nti, “Omusajja ono asaanira okuyambibwa nga bw’akusabye, <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>kubanga ayagala nnyo eggwanga lyaffe, era ye yatuzimbira ne kkuŋŋaaniro lyaffe!” <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Bw’atyo Yesu n’agenda nabo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Naye Yesu bwe yali akyali mu kkubo nga tannatuuka ku nnyumba, omukulu w’ekitongole n’atuma mikwano gye eri Yesu ng’agamba nti, “Mukama wange, teweeteganya bw’otyo, kubanga nze sisaanira kukusembeza mu nju yange. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Era kyenavudde nnema okujja gy’oli nze nzennyini. Naye yogera bwogezi ekigambo, omuweereza wange anaawona! <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Kubanga nange nnina abakulu abantwala, ate waliwo n’abali wansi wange be nninako obuyinza. Bwe ŋŋamba ono nti, ‘Genda,’ agenda, n’omulala nti, ‘Jjangu,’ ajja; n’omuddu wange nti, ‘Kola kino,’ akikola.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesu bwe yawulira ebigambo ebyo n’amwewuunya nnyo, n’akyukira ekibiina ky’abantu abaali bamugoberera n’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mbagamba nti sirabanga kukkiriza kunene nga kuno, wadde mu Isirayiri.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Awo omukulu w’ekitongole be yatuma eri Yesu bwe baddayo mu nnyumba ye, baasanga omuddu awonye.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Azuukiza Mutabani wa Nnamwandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Awo ku lunaku olwaddirira, Yesu n’agenda n’abayigirizwa be n’ekibiina kinene ne kimugoberera mu kibuga ekiyitibwa Nayini. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Bwe yali asemberera omulyango gw’ekibuga, laba, abantu ne bafuluma mu kibuga nga beettisse omulambo gw’omuvubuka eyali mutabani w’omukazi nnamwandu, ate nga ye mwana we yekka. Ekibiina ky’abantu abaali bava mu kibuga baali bangi nnyo. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Awo Mukama waffe bwe yalaba nnamwandu n’amusaasira, n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Tokaaba.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>N’asemberera essanduuko, abaali bagisitudde ne bayimirira, Yesu n’ayogera nti, <char style="wj">“Omuvubuka, nkulagira nti ggolokoka!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Eyali afudde n’atuula era n’atandika okwogera. Yesu n’amuddiza nnyina.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Buli omu n’ajjula entiisa, ne batendereza Katonda nga bagamba nti, “Nnabbi ow’amaanyi atulabikidde, era Katonda akyalidde abantu be.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Ebigambo ebyo ne bibuna Buyudaaya yonna n’okwetooloola emiriraano gyayo.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ne Yokaana Omubatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Awo abayigirizwa ba Yokaana Omubatiza ne bategeeza Yokaana ebintu ebyo byonna. Yokaana n’ayita abayigirizwa be babiri, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>n’abatuma eri Mukama waffe okumubuuza nti, “Ggwe wuuyo gwe tusuubira okujja, oba tulindirireyo omulala?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Abayigirizwa ba Yokaana bwe baatuuka eri Yesu, ne bamutegeeza nti, “Yokaana Omubatiza atutumye okukubuuza nti, Ggwe wuuyo ajja oba tulindirirayo omulala?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Mu kiseera ekyo Yesu n’awonya endwadde nnyingi eza buli ngeri: n’abalema, n’abaaliko emyoyo emibi, n’azibula n’abazibe b’amaaso. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Abaatumibwa n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Muddeeyo eri Yokaana mumutegeeze byonna bye muwulidde ne bye mulabye. Abazibe b’amaaso bazibulwa amaaso ne balaba, n’abalema batambula, n’abagenge</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kiyinza okuba endwadde endala ez’olususu</char></note> <char style="wj">balongoosebwa, n’abaggavu b’amatu gagguka ne bawulira, n’abafu bazuukizibwa, era n’abaavu babuulirwa Enjiri.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/><char style="wj">Era alina omukisa oyo atanneesittalako.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Awo ababaka ba Yokaana bwe baagenda, Yesu n’abuulira ekibiina ebikwata ku Yokaana. N’ababuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Bwe mwagenda mu ddungu, mwagenderera kulaba ki? Olumuli olunyeenyezebwa n’empewo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/><char style="wj">Naye mwagenderera kulaba ki? Omusajja ayambadde engoye ezinekaaneka? Laba abambadde engoye ezinekaaneka, nga babeera mu bulamu bwa kikungu era babeera mu mbiri.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/><char style="wj">Naye mwagenderera kulaba ki? Nnabbi? Weewaawo ka mbabuulire, oyo asinga ne nnabbi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/><char style="wj">Y’oyo ebyawandiikibwa gwe byogerako nti,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Laba, ntuma omubaka wange okukukulembera,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">y’alikuteekerateekera ekkubo lyo mu maaso go.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mbagamba nti, mu bantu bonna abaali bazaaliddwa abakazi, tewali mukulu wa kitiibwa kukira Yokaana, naye ate oyo asembayo mu bwakabaka bwa Katonda asinga Yokaana ekitiibwa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Abantu bonna, awamu n’abasolooza b’omusolo, bwe baawulira ebigambo bya Yesu ebyo, ne batendereza Katonda, kubanga baali babatiziddwa mu kubatizibwa kwa Yokaana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Naye Abafalisaayo n’abayigiriza b’amateeka ne bagaana ebyo Katonda bye yabategekera, kubanga tebaabatizibwa Yokaana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Anenya ab’omu Biseera bye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Awo Yesu n’abuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Abantu ab’omulembe guno mbageraageranye na ki? Bafaanana batya?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/><char style="wj">Bafaanana ng’abaana abato abazannya emizannyo gyabwe mu katale, nga bagambagana nti,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Bwe twabafuuyira omulere,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">temwazina,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">Bwe twayimba oluyimba olw’okukungubaga,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">temwakungubaga.’</char><verse eid="LUK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>
    <char style="wj">Kubanga Yokaana Omubatiza bwe yajja teyalyanga mmere wadde okunywa omwenge, ne mugamba nti, ‘Aliko dayimooni!’</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/><char style="wj">Omwana w’Omuntu azze ng’alya emmere era ng’anywa ne mugamba nti, ‘Laba wa mululu era mutamiivu, mukwano gw’abasolooza b’omusolo n’aboonoonyi!’</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/><char style="wj">Naye amagezi geeragira mu butuukirivu olw’abaana baago bonna.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukazi Alina Ebibi Asiiga Yesu Amafuta ag’Akaloosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Awo omu ku Bafalisaayo n’ayita Yesu ku kijjulo, Yesu n’ayingira mu nnyumba, n’atuula ku mmeeza. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Awo omukazi ow’omu kibuga ekyo nga mwonoonyi, eyali ategedde nga Yesu ali mu nju eyo ey’Omufalisaayo, n’aleeta eccupa y’amafuta ag’akaloosa. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>N’ayimirira awali Yesu, n’akaaba, amaziga ne gatonnya ku bigere bya Yesu ne bitoba. Omukazi n’abisiimuuza enviiri ze, era n’abinywegera; n’abifukako amafuta ag’akaloosa.<verse eid="LUK 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Naye Omufalisaayo eyayita Yesu, ebyo bwe yabiraba, n’agamba munda ye nti, “Singa omuntu ono abadde nnabbi, yanditegedde omukazi amukwatako kyali era nga bw’ali omwonoonyi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Awo Yesu n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Simooni, nnina kye njagala okukubuulira.”</char> Simooni n’addamu nti, “Omuyigiriza, mbuulira.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>
    <char style="wj">“Waaliwo abantu babiri, omuwozi w’ensimbi be yali abanja. Omu yali amubanja ddinaali ebikumi bitaano, n’omulala ddinaali amakumi ataano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/><char style="wj">Naye ku bombi nga tekuliiko asobola kusasula bbanja lye. Eyali ababanja kwe kubasonyiwa. Kale, ku bombi aluwa alisinga okumwagala?”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simooni n’addamu nti, “Ndowooza oyo gwe yasonyiwa ebbanja erisingako obunene.” Yesu n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Olamudde bulungi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>N’alyoka akyukira omukazi n’agamba Simooni nti, <char style="wj">“Omukazi ono omulaba? Bwe nayingidde mu nnyumba yo, tewampadde mazzi ga kunaaba ku bigere byange. Naye abinaazizza n’amaziga ge n’abisiimuula n’enviiri ze.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/><char style="wj">Tewannyanirizza na kunnywegera, naye anywegedde ebigere byange emirundi mingi okuva lwe nayingidde.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/><char style="wj">Tewansiize mafuta ku mutwe gwange, naye ye asiize ebigere byange amafuta ag’akaloosa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/><char style="wj">Noolwekyo nkutegeeza nti omukazi ono asonyiyiddwa ebibi bye ebingi kubanga okwagala kwe kungi, naye oyo asonyiyibwa ebitono n’okwagala kwe kuba kutono.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Awo Yesu n’agamba omukazi nti, <char style="wj">“Osonyiyiddwa ebibi byo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Abo abaali ne Yesu ku mmeza ne beebuuzaganya nti, “Ono ye ani asonyiwa n’ebibi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Yesu n’agamba omukazi nti, <char style="wj">“Okukkiriza kwo kukulokodde, genda mirembe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Abakazi Abaayitanga ne Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Oluvannyuma lw’ebyo Yesu n’agenda ng’akyalira ebibuga ebinene n’ebitono ng’abuulira Enjiri y’obwakabaka bwa Katonda, n’abayigirizwa be ekkumi n’ababiri nga bali naye. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Waaliwo n’abakazi Yesu be yali agobyeko emyoyo emibi ne be yali awonyezza endwadde. Mu bo mwe mwali ne Maliyamu eyayitibwanga Magudaleene gwe yagobako baddayimooni omusanvu, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>ne Jowaana muka Kuza eyali omukulu w’olubiri lwa Kerode; ne Susaana, n’abalala bangi, abaatoolanga ku byabwe ne balabirira Yesu n’abayigirizwa be.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olugero lw’Omusizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Awo ekibiina kinene bwe kyali kikuŋŋaana, nga n’abantu abava mu buli kibuga bajja eri Yesu, Yesu n’abagerera olugero luno nti, <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/><char style="wj">“Omulimi yagenda mu nnimiro ye okusiga ensigo. Bwe yatandika okusiga ensigo, ezimu ne zigwa ku mabbali g’ekkubo ne bazirinnyirira, n’ebinyonyi eby’omu bbanga ne bizirya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/><char style="wj">Ensigo endala zaagwa ku lwazi, bwe zaamera ne zikala kubanga tezaalina mazzi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/><char style="wj">Ensigo endala zaagwa mu maggwa, bwe zaamera n’amaggwa nago ne gakula ne gazizisa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/><char style="wj">Naye ensigo endala n’azisiga mu ttaka eddungi, ne zikula ne zibala ebibala emirundi kikumi.”</char> N’amaliriza ng’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Alina amatu okuwulira awulire.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Abayigirizwa be ne bamubuuza amakulu g’olugero olwo. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>N’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Mmwe muweereddwa omukisa okumanya ebyama by’obwakabaka bwa Katonda, naye abalala, njogera gye bali mu ngero,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘bwe batunula baleme kulaba,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">bwe bawulira baleme kutegeera.’</char><verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kale, amakulu g’olugero olwo ge gano: Ensigo ky’ekigambo kya Katonda.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/><char style="wj">Ensigo ezaagwa ku mabbali g’ekkubo, be bawulira ekigambo, naye Setaani n’ajja n’akibaggyako mu mutima gwabwe, si kulwa nga bakkiriza ne balokolebwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/><char style="wj">Ezaagwa ku lwazi be bawulira ne basanyukira ekigambo, kyokka ne kitaba na mmizi. Be bakkiriza, naye okugezesebwa bwe kujja ne bagwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/><char style="wj">Ezaagwa mu maggwa, be bawulira ekigambo, naye okweraliikirira n’obugagga n’amasanyu g’omu bulamu ne bibazisa, ne bataleeta bibala bikuze bulungi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/><char style="wj">Naye ezaagwa ku ttaka eddungi be bantu abalungi era abeesigwa, era bakuuma ekigambo ku mitima ne babala ebibala n’obugumiikiriza.</char><verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Tewali muntu akoleeza ttaala ate nagisaanikirako akalobo oba n’agissa wansi w’ekitanda. Agiwanika waggulu ku kikondo, olwo lw’esobola okumulisiza abantu abayingira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/><char style="wj">Kubanga tewali kintu na kimu ekyakwekebwa ekitalikwekulwa, era tewali na kimu ekitalimanyibwa mu lwatu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/><char style="wj">Noolwekyo mwegendereze nga muwuliriza, kubanga oyo alina alyongerwako; naye oyo atalina, n’ekyo ky’alowooza nti alina kigenda kumuggyibwako.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnyina ne Baganda ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Awo nnyina ne baganda ba Yesu ne bajja okumulaba, naye ne batasobola kumutuukako olw’ekibiina ky’abantu ekinene. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Ne wabaawo amubuulira nti, “Nnyoko ne baganda bo obwedda bayimiridde wabweru, baagala kukulabako.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Yesu n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Mmange ne baganda bange be bano abawulira ekigambo kya Katonda ne bakigondera.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Akkakkanya Omuyaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Lwali lumu Yesu n’alinnya mu lyato n’abayigirizwa be, n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Tuwunguke tulage emitala w’ennyanja.”</char> Ne basimbula okugenda. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Bwe baali baseeyeeya Yesu ne yeebaka. Awo omuyaga ogw’amaanyi ne gukunta ku nnyanja, n’eryato ne liyuuga nnyo, ne baba mu kabi kanene.<verse eid="LUK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Abayigirizwa ne bamuzuukusa, ne bagamba nti, “Mukama waffe, Mukama waffe, tusaanawo!” N’azuukuka n’aboggolera omuyaga n’amazzi agaali geefuukudde. Ne bikkakkana, ennyanja n’etteeka! <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>N’alyoka abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Okukkiriza kwammwe kuluwa?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Ne batya, ne beewuunya nnyo, ne bagambagana nti, “Omuntu ono ye ani? Alagira omuyaga n’amazzi ne bimugondera!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awonya Omusajja Eyaliko Baddayimooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Awo ne bagoba emitala w’eri mu nsi y’Abageresene eyolekedde Ggaliraaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Awo Yesu bwe yava mu lyato omusajja eyaliko baddayimooni n’ajja okumusisinkana ng’ava mu kibuga. Omusajja oyo yali amaze ebbanga ddene nga tayambala ngoye, nga tasula na mu nju, wabula ng’asula mu ntaana. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Awo bwe yalaba Yesu n’awowoggana n’agwa wansi mu maaso ga Yesu, n’aleekaana nti, “Onjagaza ki, Yesu, Omwana wa Katonda Ali Waggulu Ennyo? Nkwegayiridde tombonyaabonya!”<verse eid="LUK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Kubanga Yesu yali alagidde omwoyo omubi guve ku musajja oyo. Emirundi mingi yalumbibwanga n’amaanyi mangi, ne bwe baamusibanga n’enjegere, n’akuumibwa mu masamba, yabikutulanga, ddayimooni n’amulaza mu ddungu.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Awo Yesu n’abuuza omusajja nti, <char style="wj">“Erinnya lyo ggwe ani?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Omusajja n’addamu nti, “Nze Ligyoni,” kubanga omusajja yaliko baddayimooni bangi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Baddayimooni ne beegayirira Yesu aleme okubagobera mu bunnya obutakoma.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Waaliwo eggana ly’embizzi, awo ku lusozi, nga lirya, baddayimooni ne beegayirira Yesu abasindike mu mbizzi ezo. Yesu n’abakkiriza. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Baddayimooni ne bava ku musajja ne bayingira mu mbizzi, amangwago eggana lyonna ne lifubutuka nga liserengeta olusozi, ne lyewanula ku bbangabanga, ne ligwa mu nnyanja, embizzi zonna ne zisaanawo. <verse eid="LUK 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Abalunzi b’embizzi ezo bwe baakiraba, ne badduka embiro ne bagenda, ne bategeeza ab’omu malundiro ne mu kibuga, ebintu byonna ebibaddewo. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Ekibiina ky’abantu ne bagenda okulaba ebibaddewo ne bajja eri Yesu, ne balaba omusajja eyagobwako baddayimooni ng’atudde awo awali ebigere bya Yesu ng’ayambadde engoye era nga mulamu ddala! Ne batya nnyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Abo abaaliwo okusookera ddala ne bategeeza abalala ng’omusajja eyaliko ddayimooni bwe yawonyezebwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Awo abantu bonna ab’ensi eyo ey’Abagerasene ne basaba Yesu abaviire, kubanga baali batidde nnyo. N’asaabala mu lyato n’avaayo.<verse eid="LUK 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Omusajja, eyagobwako baddayimooni n’amusaba agende naye, naye Yesu n’agaana. <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>N’agamba omusajja nti, <char style="wj">“Ddayo ewammwe obategeeze Katonda by’akukoledde.”</char> Omusajja n’agenda ng’ategeeza buli gwe yasanganga mu kibuga, Yesu bye yali amukoledde.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muwala wa Yayiro n’Omukazi Omulwadde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Yesu bwe yakomawo ekibiina ky’abantu ne bamwaniriza n’essanyu kubanga bonna baali bamulindirira. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Mu kiseera ekyo ne wajjawo omusajja erinnya lye Yayiro, eyali omukulembeze w’ekkuŋŋaaniro, n’agwa ku bigere bya Yesu n’amwegayirira ajje mu maka ge, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>kubanga muwala we omu yekka gwe yalina, eyali aweza emyaka nga kkumi n’ebiri yali afa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu n’agenda naye, naye ng’ekibiina kimunyigiriza. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Mu kibiina ky’abantu ekyo mwalimu omukazi eyali amaze emyaka kkumi n’ebiri ng’alwadde ekikulukuto ky’omusaayi. Yali atambudde nnyo mu basawo era nga bamumazeeko ebintu bye byonna ng’abasasula, naye ne watabaawo asobola kumuwonya. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Omukazi ono n’asemberera Yesu ng’amuvaako emabega, n’akoma ku lukugiro lw’ekyambalo kya Yesu, ekikulukuto ky’omusaayi ne kiwona mu kaseera ako kennyini!<verse eid="LUK 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesu n’abuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Ani ankutteko?”</char> Bonna ne beegaana, naye Peetero n’agamba nti, “Mukama waffe, ekibiina ky’abantu kinene abakwetoolodde era abantu bangi bakunyigiriza.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Naye Yesu n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Waliwo ankutteko kubanga mpulidde ng’amaanyi ganvaamu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Awo omukazi bwe yategeera ng’avumbuddwa, n’ajja ng’akankana n’agwa awo mu maaso ga Yesu, n’annyonnyola mu maaso g’abantu bonna ensonga kyeyavudde amukwatako, era nti n’obulwadde bwe bwawoneddewo!<verse eid="LUK 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yesu n’agamba omukazi nti, <char style="wj">“Muwala wange, okukkiriza kwo kukuwonyezza. Genda mirembe.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Awo Yesu bwe yali ng’akyayogera omuntu n’atuuka ng’ava mu maka g’omukulu w’ekkuŋŋaaniro, n’agamba Yayiro nti, “Muwala wo afudde! Omuyigiriza toyongera kumuteganya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Naye Yesu bwe yakiwulira n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Totya! Kkiriza bukkiriza, ajja kuba mulamu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Awo Yesu bwe yatuuka ku nnyumba ya Yayiro, n’atakkiriza bantu balala kuyingira naye mu nju wabula Peetero, ne Yokaana, ne Yakobo, ne kitaawe w’omwana, ne nnyina. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Mu kiseera ekyo abantu bonna baali bakaaba nga bakungubagira omwana oyo. Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mulekeraawo okukaaba! Omuwala tafudde wabula yeebase bwebasi!”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Ne bamusekerera nnyo, kubanga bonna baali bamanyi ng’omuwala afudde. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Naye Yesu n’akwata omuwala eyali afudde ku mukono, n’akoowoola ng’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mwana wange, golokoka!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Amangwago n’aba mulamu, n’asituka n’ayimirira. Yesu n’abalagira bamuwe ekyokulya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Bazadde b’omuwala ne beewuunya, naye Yesu n’abakuutira obutabuulirako muntu yenna ebibaddewo.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Atuma Ekkumi n’Ababiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Awo olunaku lwali lumu Yesu n’ayita abayigirizwa be ekkumi n’ababiri bonna awamu, n’abawa obuyinza okugoba baddayimooni ku bantu n’okuwonya endwadde. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>N’abawa obuyinza n’abatuma bagende bategeeze abantu ebigambo by’obwakabaka bwa Katonda era bawonye n’abalwadde. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>N’abalagira nti, <char style="wj">“Temwetwalira kintu kyonna nga mugenda, wadde omuggo, oba ensawo, oba emmere, wadde ffeeza wadde essaati ebbiri.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/><char style="wj">Na buli nnyumba mwe muyingiranga, mubeerenga omwo, era mwe muba muvanga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/><char style="wj">Bwe muyingiranga mu kibuga, abantu baamu ne batabaaniriza, mubaviirenga, era bwe mubanga mufuluma mu kibuga ekyo mukunkumulanga enfuufu ku bigere byammwe, ebe omujulirwa eri bo.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Ne bagenda nga bava mu kibuga ekimu nga badda mu kirala, nga babuulira Enjiri buli wamu era nga bawonya.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kerode Asoberwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Awo Kerode eyali afuga Ggaliraaya bwe yawulira ebintu ebyo byonna, n’asoberwa, kubanga abantu abamu baali bagamba nti, “Yokaana azuukidde mu bafu,” <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>n’abalala nti, “Eriya yali alabise,” n’abalala nti, “Omu ku bannabbi ab’edda azuukidde mu bafu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Naye Kerode ne yeebuuza nti, “Yokaana namutemako omutwe; naye ate kale ono ye ani gwe mpulirako ebigambo bino byonna?” N’ayagala okulaba Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Aliisa Abantu Enkumi Ettaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Awo abatume bwe baakomawo ne bategeeza Yesu bye baakola. Yesu n’abatwala mu kyama ne bagenda bokka mu kibuga ekiyitibwa Besusayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Naye ebibiina bwe baakitegeera ne kimugoberera. Yesu n’abaaniriza, n’abayigiriza ebigambo ebikwata ku bwakabaka bwa Katonda, n’abaali abalwadde n’abawonya.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Obudde bwe bwawungeera abayigirizwa ekkumi n’ababiri ne bajja gy’ali ne bamugamba nti, “Abantu bagambe bagende mu bibuga ebyetoolodde wano ne mu byalo beefunire we banaafuna ku mmere n’okusula, kubanga wano tuli mu ttale jjereere.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Yesu n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Mmwe mubawe ekyokulya!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Abayigirizwa be ne bamuddamu nti, “Wano tulinawo emigaati etaano gyokka n’ebyennyanja bibiri, mpozi nga tugenda tugulire abantu bano bonna emmere.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Waaliwo abasajja ng’enkumi ttaano. Naye Yesu n’agamba abayigirizwa be nti, <char style="wj">“Mutuuze abantu mu bibiina by’abantu ng’amakumi ataano buli kimu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Abayigirizwa ne bakola bwe batyo, bonna ne batuula. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Awo Yesu n’addira emigaati etaano n’ebyennyanja ebibiri n’atunula eri eggulu, ne yeebaza, n’amenyaamenya emigaati n’ebyennyanja, n’awa abayigirizwa be bagabule abantu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Bonna ne balya ne bakkuta, era obutundutundu obwalema bwe bwakuŋŋaanyizibwa ne bujjuza ebisero kkumi na bibiri.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetero Ayatula nti Yesu ye Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Lwali lumu Yesu bwe yali ng’asaba yekka kyokka nga n’abayigirizwa be bali awo, n’ababuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Ebibiina bimpita ani?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Ne baddamu nti, “Abamu bagamba nti Yokaana Omubatiza, abalala nti Eriya, ate nga waliwo abagamba nti omu ku bannabbi ab’edda y’azuukidde.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Yesu kwe kubabuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Naye mmwe mumpita ani?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Peetero n’addamu nti, “Ggwe Kristo wa Katonda.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Awo Yesu n’abakuutira, ng’abalagira obutakitegeezaako muntu yenna, <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>n’abategeeza nti, “Kigwanidde, Omwana w’Omuntu, okubonaabona ennyo, n’okugaanibwa abakulembeze b’Abayudaaya, ne bakabona abakulu, n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka, n’okuttibwa, naye ku lunaku olwokusatu okuzuukizibwa!”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Era bonna n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Omuntu yenna ayagala okungoberera asaana yeefiirize yekka yeetikke omusaalaba gwe buli lunaku, angoberere!</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/><char style="wj">Kubanga buli ayagala okulokola obulamu bwe, alibufiirwa. Na buli alifiirwa obulamu bwe ku lwange alibulokola.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/><char style="wj">Kubanga omuntu kirimugasa ki okulya ensi yonna, naye n’afiirwa obulamu bwe?</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/><char style="wj">Buli alinkwatirwa ensonyi, nze n’ebigambo byange, n’Omwana w’Omuntu, alimukwatirwa ensonyi, bw’alijja mu kitiibwa kye ne mu kya Kitaawe ne mu kya bamalayika abatukuvu.</char><verse eid="LUK 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye ddala ddala mbagamba nti abamu ku abo abayimiridde wano waliwo abatalirega ku kufa okutuusa nga bamaze okulaba obwakabaka bwa Katonda.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufuusibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Awo nga wayiseewo ng’ennaku munaana, Yesu n’atwala Peetero ne Yokaana ne Yakobo ne bambuka ku lusozi okusaba. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Bwe yali ng’asaba endabika y’amaaso ge n’ekyusibwa, ebyambalo bye ne byeruka ne bitukula nnyo era ne byakaayakana. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Awo abantu babiri ne balabika nga banyumya ne Yesu, omu yali Musa n’omulala Eriya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>abaali bamasamasa mu kitiibwa kyabwe nga boogera ku kufa kwa Yesu, kwe yali agenda okutuukiriza mu Yerusaalemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Peetero ne banne otulo twali tubakutte era nga beebase, Bwe baazuukuka ne balaba ekitiibwa kya Yesu n’abantu ababiri abaali bayimiridde naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Awo Musa ne Eriya bwe baali bagenda, Peetero nga tamanyi ne kyayogera, n’agamba nti, “Mukama wange kirungi ffe okubeera wano. Ka tuzimbe wano ensiisira ssatu, emu yiyo, endala ya Musa n’endala ya Eriya!”<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Naye yali akyayogera ebyo ekire ne kibabikka, abayigirizwa ne bajjula okutya nga kibasaanikidde. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Eddoboozi ne liva mu kire ne ligamba nti, “Ono ye Mwana wange, gwe nneeroboza, mumuwulirize!” <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Eddoboozi bwe lyasiriikirira, Yesu n’asigalawo yekka. Abayigirizwa abo bye baalaba ne bye baawulira ne babikuuma mu mitima gyabwe, ne batabibuulirako muntu yenna mu kiseera ekyo.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awonya Omwana Eyaliko Dayimooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Awo enkeera bwe baakomawo nga bava ku lusozi, ekibiina ekinene ne kijja okusisinkana Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Omusajja eyali mu kibiina n’ayogerera waggulu ng’agamba nti, “Omuyigiriza, nkwegayiridde tunula ku mutabani wange ono kubanga yekka gwe nnina. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Kubanga ddayimooni buli bbanga amukwata n’amuwowogganya, era n’amukankanya n’abimba ejjovu n’amusuula eri era tayagala kumuleka, amumaliramu ddala amaanyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Neegayiridde abayigirizwa bo bamumugobeko, naye ne batasobola.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Awo Yesu n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Mmwe omulembe ogutakkiriza era ogwakyama, ndibeera nammwe kutuusa ddi? Era ndibagumiikiriza kutuusa ddi? Leeta wano omwana wo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Omulenzi bwe yali ajja eri Yesu dayimooni n’amusuula wansi n’amukankanya nnyo. Yesu n’aboggolera omwoyo omubi n’awonya omwana, n’amuddiza kitaawe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Abantu bonna ne beewuunya obuyinza bwa Katonda. Awo buli muntu bwe yali akyewuunya eby’ekitalo ebyo Yesu bye yali akola, n’agamba abayigirizwa be nti, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/><char style="wj">“Muwulirize nnyo kye ŋŋenda okubagamba. Omwana w’Omuntu, agenda kuliibwamu olukwe.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Naye abayigirizwa tebaategeera ky’agambye n’amakulu gaakyo. Kubanga kyali kibakwekebbwa, baleme okutegeera ate nga batya okukimubuuza.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Awo empaka ne zisituka mu bayigirizwa ba Yesu, nga bawakanira aliba omukulu mu bo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Naye Yesu bwe yategeera ebirowoozo byabwe n’addira omwana omuto n’amuyimiriza w’ali. <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Buli muntu asembeza omwana ono omuto mu linnya lyange ng’asembezezza Nze, na buli ansembeza aba asembezezza oyo eyantuma. Oyo asembayo okuba owa wansi mu mmwe, ye mukulu okubasinga.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Awo Yokaana n’agamba Yesu nti, “Mukama waffe, twalaba omuntu ng’agoba baddayimooni mu linnya lyo ne tugezaako okumuziyiza kubanga tayita naffe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Naye Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Temumuziyizanga kubanga oyo atalwana nammwe abeera ku ludda lwammwe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Awo ekiseera eky’okulinnya kwe mu ggulu bwe kyali kisembedde, n’amalirira okugenda e Yerusaalemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>N’atuma ababaka mu maaso ne balaga mu kibuga ky’Abasamaliya okumutegekera. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Naye abantu b’eyo ne batamwaniriza, kubanga yali amaliridde okulaga mu Yerusaalemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Abayigirizwa Yakobo ne Yokaana bwe baakiraba ne babuuza Yesu nti, “Mukama waffe, tuyite omuliro okuva mu ggulu gubazikirize?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Naye Yesu n’akyuka n’abanenya. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Ne bagenda mu kabuga akalala.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Awo bwe baali bali mu kkubo omu ku bo n’amugamba nti, “Nnaakugobereranga wonna w’onoogendanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesu n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ebibe birina obunnya bwabyo mwe bisula, n’ennyonyi zirina ebisu, naye Omwana w’Omuntu, talina kifo kya kuwumulizaamu mutwe gwe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>N’agamba omusajja omulala nti, <char style="wj">“Ngoberera.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Omusajja n’addamu nti, “Mukama wange, nzikiriza mmale okugenda okuziika kitange.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yesu n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Leka abafu baziike abafu baabwe, naye ggwe genda olangirire obwakabaka bwa Katonda.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>N’omulala n’agamba Yesu nti, “Nnaakugobereranga Mukama wange. Naye sooka ondeke mmale okusiibula ab’omu maka gange.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Naye Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Omuntu yenna akwata ekyuma ekirima mu ngalo ze ate n’atunula emabega, tasaanira bwakabaka bwa Katonda.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Atuma Abayigirizwa Ensanvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Awo oluvannyuma lw’ebyo Yesu n’alonda abayigirizwa abalala nsanvu mu babiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne mu lunny 17</char></note>, n’abatuma babiri babiri bamukulembere bagende mu buli kibuga ekinene, na buli kifo mwe yali anaatera okutuuka. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Eby’okukungula bingi, naye abakozi abakungula batono. Noolwekyo musabe nannyini nnimiro, aweereze abakozi mu nnimiro ye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/><char style="wj">Kale, mugende. Kyokka mbatuma ng’abaana b’endiga mu misege.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/><char style="wj">Temugenda na nsimbi era temutwala nsawo ya kusabiriza wadde omugogo gw’engatto, ate temubaako gwe mulamusa mu kkubo.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Buli nnyumba gye muyingirangamu musookanga kugamba nti, ‘Emirembe gibeere mu nnyumba eno.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/><char style="wj">Ennyumba eyo bw’eneebangamu omuntu ow’emirembe, emirembe gyammwe ginaabeeranga ku ye, bwe kitaabenga bwe kityo, emirembe gyammwe ginaabaddiranga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/><char style="wj">Mu nnyumba omwo, mwe musookedde, munaalyanga era ne munywa nabo, kubanga omukozi asaanira empeera ye. Temuvanga mu nnyumba emu ne mudda mu ndala.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Buli kibuga kye mutuukangamu ne babaaniriza, mulyenga ebyo bye babawadde okulya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/><char style="wj">Muwonyenga abalwadde abalimu, era mugambenga abantu abo nti, ‘Obwakabaka bwa Katonda bubasemberedde.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/><char style="wj">Naye bwe muyingiranga mu kibuga kyonna ne batabaaniriza, mulaganga mu nguudo zaakyo ne mugamba nti,</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/><char style="wj">‘N’enfuufu ekwatidde ku bigere byaffe tugibakunkumulira. Naye mumanye kino nti obwakabaka bwa Katonda busembedde.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/><char style="wj">Mbategeeza nti ku lunaku luli, Sodomu kigenda kugumiikirizika okusinga ekibuga ekyo.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Zikusanze, ggwe Kolaziini! Naawe zikusanze, Besusayida! Kubanga ebyamagero ekyakolerwa mu mmwe, singa byakolerwa mu Ttuulo ne mu Sidoni, abantu baamu bandibadde beenenya dda, nga bambadde n’ebibukutu nga batudde mu vvu okulaga nti beenenyezza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/><char style="wj">Naye Ttuulo ne Sidoni birisaasirwa okusinga mmwe ku lunaku olw’okusalirako omusango.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/><char style="wj">Ate ggwe Kaperunawumu, oligulumizibwa okutuuka mu ggulu? Nedda, ogenda kuserengesebwa wansi emagombe.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Buli abawuliriza mmwe aba awulirizza Nze, na buli abanyooma aba anyoomye Nze, n’oyo anyooma Nze aba anyoomye eyantuma.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Awo abayigirizwa ensavu mu ababiri bwe baakomawo, nga basanyuka ne bategeeza Yesu nti, “Mukama waffe, ne baddayimooni baatugondera mu linnya lyo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Nalaba Setaani ng’agwa okuva mu ggulu ng’okumyansa kw’eraddu!</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/><char style="wj">Laba mbawadde obuyinza okulinnya ku misota ne ku njaba ez’obusagwa n’okuwangula amaanyi gonna ag’omulabe. Era tewali kigenda kubakola kabi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/><char style="wj">Naye temusanyuka nnyo kubanga baddayimooni babagondera, wabula mujaguze nti amannya gammwe gawandiikiddwa mu ggulu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Mu kiseera ekyo Yesu n’ajjula essanyu ku bwa Mwoyo Mutukuvu n’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Nkutendereza Kitange, Mukama w’eggulu n’ensi, kubanga wakweka ebintu bino abagezi n’abayivu, naye n’obibikkulira abaana abato. Weewaawo Kitange, bw’otyo bwe wasiima.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kitange yankwasa ebintu byonna. Tewali amanyi Mwana wabula Kitange, era tewali amanyi Kitange wabula Omwana awamu n’abo Omwana b’asiima okubamubikkulira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Awo n’akyukira abayigirizwa be n’abagamba mu kyama nti, <char style="wj">“Mulina omukisa mmwe okulaba bino bye mulaba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/><char style="wj">Kubanga mbagamba nti, bannabbi bangi ne bakabaka bangi abaayagala okulaba bye mulaba n’okuwulira bye muwulira naye tekyasoboka.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omusamaliya Omulungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Kale laba omunnyonnyozi w’amateeka n’asituka, ng’ayagala okugezesa Yesu, n’amubuuza nti, “Omuyigiriza, nsaana nkole ki okusikira obulamu obutaggwaawo?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Kyawandiikibwa kitya mu mateeka? Gagamba gatya?”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Omunnyonnyozi w’amateeka n’addamu nti, “ ‘Yagalanga Mukama Katonda wo n’omutima gwo gwonna, n’emmeeme yo yonna, n’amaanyi go gonna, n’amagezi go gonna.’ Era ‘yagalanga muliraanwa wo nga naawe bwe weeyagala.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesu n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ozzeemu bulungi. Kale kolanga bw’otyo oliba mulamu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Naye omunnyonnyozi w’amateeka okwagala okulaga nga bw’ali omutuufu n’agamba Yesu nti, “Muliraanwa wange ye ani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Waaliwo omuntu eyali ava e Yerusaalemi ng’aserengeta e Yeriko, n’agwa mu banyazi, ne bamukwata ne bamwambulamu engoye ze ne bazimutwalako, ne bamukuba nnyo, ne bamuleka awo ku kkubo ng’abulako katono okufa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/><char style="wj">Awo kabona eyali tategedde n’ajjira mu kkubo eryo, naye bwe yatuuka ku musajja ng’agudde awo ku kkubo n’amwebalama bwebalami n’amuyitako.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/><char style="wj">Omuleevi naye yamutuukako n’amulaba, n’adda ku ludda olulala olw’oluguudo, n’amuyitako buyisi</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/><char style="wj">Naye Omusamaliya bwe yali ng’ali ku lugendo lwe mu kkubo eryo, n’atuuka omusajja we yali; bwe yamulaba n’amukwatirwa ekisa,</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/><char style="wj">n’ajja w’ali, n’amunyiga ebiwundu ng’ayiwako amafuta, ne wayini ebiwundu n’abisibako ebiwero. Awo n’ateeka omusajja ku nsolo ye n’amutwala mu nnyumba esulwamu abatambuze, n’amujjanjaba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/><char style="wj">Enkeera Omusamaliya n’addira ddinaali bbiri n’aziwa nannyini nnyumba. N’amugamba nti, ‘Nkusaba omujjanjabe, era ensimbi ezizo zonna z’olikozesa nga zino ze nkulekedde ziweddewo, ndizikuddizaawo nga nkomyewo.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>“Kale olowooza, ku bantu abo abasatu aluwa eyali muliraanwa w’omusajja oli eyagwa mu banyazi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Omunnyonnyozi w’amateeka n’addamu nti, “Oyo eyamukolera ebyekisa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Naawe genda okole bw’otyo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Akyalira Maliza ne Maliyamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Awo Yesu n’abayigirizwa be nga bali ku lugendo lwabwe, ne batuuka mu kabuga akamu, omukazi erinnya lye Maliza n’asembeza Yesu mu maka ge. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Yalina muganda we erinnya lye Maliyamu. N’atuula awo wansi ku bigere bya Yesu, ng’awuliriza ebigambo Yesu bye yali ayogera. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Naye Maliza yali yeetawula mu mirimu ng’ategekera abagenyi, n’ajja awali Yesu n’amugamba nti, “Mukama wange, tofaayo ng’olaba muganda wange andekedde emirimu nzekka?”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Naye Mukama waffe n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Maliza, Maliza, ebintu ebikutawaanya bingi,</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/><char style="wj">naye waliwo ekintu kimu kyokka ekyetaagibwa, Maliyamu alonze omugabo omulungi ogutagenda kumuggyibwako.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ayigiriza Okusaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Awo olwatuuka Yesu ng’ali mu kifo ekimu ng’asaba, bwe yamaliriza, omu ku bayigirizwa be n’amugamba nti, “Mukama waffe, naawe tuyigirize okusaba nga Yokaana bwe yayigiriza abayigirizwa be.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Bwe mubanga musaba mugambanga nti,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Kitaffe,</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ebitabo ebimu bigamba Kitaffe ali mu ggulu</char>
    </note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">Erinnya lyo litukuzibwe,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">obwakabaka bwo bujje.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>
    <char style="wj">Otuwenga buli lunaku emmere yaffe ey’olunaku.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>
    <char style="wj">Era otusonyiwe ebyonoono byaffe,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">nga naffe bwe tusonyiwa abatukolako ebisobyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">So totutwala mu kukemebwa.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Ate n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Singa omu ku mmwe alina mukwano gwe, n’ajja gy’ali ekiro mu ttumbi n’amugamba nti, ‘Mukwano gwange, nkusaba ompoleyo emigaati esatu,</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/><char style="wj">kubanga nfunye omugenyi, mukwano gwange avudde lugendo, naye sirina kyakulya kya kumuwa.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Oli ali munda mu nju bw’ayanukula nti, ‘Tonteganya. Twasibyewo dda, ffenna n’abaana bange twebisse. Noolwekyo siyinza kugolokoka kaakano ne mbaako kye nkuwa.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/><char style="wj">Naye mbategeeza nti, Newaakubadde nga tagolokoka n’amuyamba nga mukwano gwe, naye, singa akonkona n’amwetayirira, alwaddaaki agolokoka n’amuwa by’amusabye.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bwe ntyo mbagamba nti, musabe munaaweebwa, munoonye mulizuula, mukonkone era munaggulirwawo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/><char style="wj">Kubanga buli asaba, aweebwa, n’oyo anoonya, azuula, era n’oyo akonkona aggulirwawo.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ani ku mmwe kitaawe w’omwana, omwana we ng’amusabye ekyennyanja, mu kifo ky’ekyennyanja n’amuwa omusota?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/><char style="wj">Oba ng’amusabye eggi n’amuwa enjaba?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/><char style="wj">Kale obanga mmwe ababi muwa abaana bammwe ebirungi, Kitammwe ali mu ggulu talisinga nnyo okubawa Mwoyo Mutukuvu abo abamusaba?”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ne Beeruzebuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Lwali lumu Yesu n’agoba dayimooni ku musajja eyali tayogera. Dayimooni bwe yamuvaako, omusajja oyo n’ayogera, ekibiina ky’abantu ne beewuunya. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Naye abantu abamu ne bagamba nti, “Agoba baddayimooni, kubanga amaanyi g’akozesa agaggya wa Beeruzebuli omukulu wa baddayimooni!” <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Abalala ne bamusaba akabonero akava mu ggulu nga bamugezesa.<verse eid="LUK 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Naye Yesu bwe yamanya ebirowoozo byabwe, kwe kubagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Obwakabaka bwe bulwanagana bwokka, buba bwolekedde kuzikirira, amaka bwe gayawukanamu gokka ne gokka gasasika.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/><char style="wj">Noolwekyo, singa Setaani yeerwanyisa yekka obwakabaka bwe buyinza butya okuyimirirawo? Kubanga mugamba nti ngoba baddayimooni ku lwa Beeruzebuli.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/><char style="wj">Era obanga Nze ngoba baddayimooni ku bwa Beeruzebuli kale abaana bammwe bo babagoba ku bw’ani? Be bagenda okubasalira omusango.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/><char style="wj">Naye obanga ngoba baddayimooni mu buyinza bwa Katonda, ekyo kikakasa nti obwakabaka bwa Katonda buzze gye muli.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kubanga omuntu ow’amaanyi bw’akuuma amaka ge, nga yenna yeesibye ebyokulwanyisa eby’amaanyi, tewaba ayinza kumutwalako bintu bye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/><char style="wj">Naye omuntu omulala amusinza amaanyi bw’amulumba amuggyako ebyokulwanyisa bye, bye yali yeesiga, n’atwala ebintu bye byonna, n’abigabira abalala.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Oyo atali ku ludda lwange, mulabe wange, n’oyo atakuŋŋaanyiza wamu nange asaasaanya.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omwoyo ogutali mulongoofu bwe guva mu muntu guyita mu malungu nga gunoonya aw’okuwummulira. Bwe gubulwa, gugamba nti, ‘Nzija kuddayo mu nnyumba mwe nava.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/><char style="wj">Bwe guddayo gusanga ennyumba ng’eyereddwa era nga ntegeke.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/><char style="wj">Kyeguva gugenda ne gufunayo emyoyo emirala musanvu egigusingako obwonoonefu, ne giyingirira omuntu oyo. Kale embeera y’omuntu oyo ey’oluvannyuma n’ebeera mbi nnyo okusinga eyasooka.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Awo Yesu bwe yali ng’akyayogera ebigambo ebyo, omukazi eyali mu kibiina n’ayogerera waggulu nti, “Lulina omukisa olubuto olwakuzaala, n’amabeere kwe wayonka!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Naye Yesu n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Weewaawo, naye balina omukisa abo bonna abawulira ekigambo kya Katonda ne bakigondera.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akabonero ka Yona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Awo abantu bwe beeyongera okukuŋŋaana abangi, Yesu n’abayigiriza ng’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Omulembe guno mulembe mubi. Gunoonya akabonero, naye tegujja kukaweebwa okuggyako akabonero aka Yona.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/><char style="wj">Kubanga Yona nga bwe yali akabonero eri abantu b’e Nineeve, n’Omwana w’Omuntu, bw’ajja okuba eri ab’omulembe guno.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/><char style="wj">Era ku lunaku olw’okusalirako omusango, kabaka omukazi ow’omu bukiikaddyo alisaliza abantu ab’omulembe guno omusango okubasinga, kubanga yava ku nkomerero y’ensi okujja okuwuliriza amagezi ga Sulemaani, naye oyo asinga Sulemaani ali wano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/><char style="wj">Abantu b’e Nineeve baliyimirira ne basaliza abantu b’omulembe guno omusango okubasinga, kubanga beenenya bwe baawulira okubuulira kwa Yona Naye laba asinga Yona ali wano.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ettaala y’Omubiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omuntu takoleeza ttaala n’agikweka, oba n’agivuunikako ekibbo! Naye agiwanika ku kikondo ky’ettaala n’emulisiza bonna abayingira basobole okulaba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/><char style="wj">Eriiso y’ettabaaza y’omubiri gwo. Eriiso bwe liba eddamu, n’omubiri gwo gwonna guba gujjudde omusana. Naye eriiso bwe liba eddwadde, omubiri gwo gujjula ekizikiza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/><char style="wj">Noolwekyo weekuume ekizikiza kireme kugoba musana oguli mu ggwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/><char style="wj">Singa omubiri gwo gwonna gujjula omusana, ne gutabaamu kizikiza n’akatono gujja kwakaayakana nga gwe bamulisizzaamu ettaala.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Awo Yesu bwe yali ng’akyayogera, Omufalisaayo n’amuyita okulya emmere mu maka ge, bw’atyo n’agenda n’ayingira n’atuula okulya. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Naye Omufalisaayo eyamuyita bwe yalaba nga Yesu atandise okulya nga tasoose kunaaba mu ngalo, ne yeewuunya.<verse eid="LUK 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Awo Mukama waffe n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mmwe Abafalisaayo, munaaza kungulu ku kikopo ne ku ssowaani, naye nga munda wammwe mujjudde omululu n’ebitali bya butuukirivu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/><char style="wj">Basirusiru mmwe eyakola ebweru si ye yakola ne munda?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/><char style="wj">Naye singa munaddira ebiri munda ne mubiwaayo ng’ekiweebwayo, olwo buli kintu kinaaba kirongoofu eri Katonda.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>
    <char style="wj">“Zibasanze mmwe Abafalisaayo! Kubanga muwaayo ekimu eky’ekkumi ku buli kyonna kye mufuna, ne ku buli kika kya muddo oguwunyisa obulungi era oguwoomesa enva, naye ne mutassaayo mwoyo ku bwenkanya n’okwagala Katonda. Kirungi okukola ebyo byonna, naye era n’ebirala temusaanye kubiragajjalira.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Zibasanze mmwe Abafalisaayo! Kubanga mwagala nnyo okutuula ku ntebe ez’ekitiibwa mu makuŋŋaaniro, era n’okulamusibwa mu butale ng’abantu babawa ekitiibwa.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>
    <char style="wj">“Zibasanze! Kubanga muli ng’amalaalo, agatalabika abantu kwe batambulira ng’ekiri munda tebakimanyi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Omu ku bannyonnyozi b’amateeka n’amwanukula nti, “Omuyigiriza bw’oyogera bw’otyo naffe oba ng’atuvumiddemu.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Nammwe zibasanze abannyonnyozi b’amateeka! Kubanga mutikka abantu emigugu emizito egy’amateeka g’eddiini, so nga mmwe temusobola na kukwata na lugalo lwammwe ku migugu egyo.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>
    <char style="wj">“Zibasanze! Kubanga muzimbira bannabbi ebijjukizo, so nga bajjajjammwe be baabatta.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/><char style="wj">Noolwekyo mulaga nga bwe muwagira ebikolwa bya bajjajjammwe eby’obutemu. Bo batta ate mmwe ne muzimba ebijjukizo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/><char style="wj">Noolwekyo Katonda mu magezi ge, kyeyava agamba nti, ‘Ndibaweereza bannabbi n’abatume, abamu balibatta n’abalala balibayigganya.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/><char style="wj">Era ab’omulembe guno kyemuliva muvunaanibwa olw’omusaayi gwa bannabbi bonna okuviira ddala ku kutondebwa kw’ensi,</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/><char style="wj">okuva ku musaayi gwa Aberi okutuuka ku musaayi gwa Zaakaliya, eyattirwa wakati w’ekyoto ky’ebiweebwayo ne yeekaalu. Mmwe ab’omulembe guno mbategeeza nti mugenda kuvunaanibwa olw’ebyo byonna.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>
    <char style="wj">“Zibasanze, mmwe abannyonnyozi b’amateeka! Kubanga mwafuna ekisumuluzo eky’amagezi naye mmwe bennyini ne mutayingira, ate ne muziyiza n’abalala okuyingira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Yesu bwe yava mu nnyumba eyo, Abafalisaayo n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka ne batandika okumuteganya n’okumukambuwalira ennyo n’okumubuuza ebibuuzo bingi awatali kusalako, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>nga bamutega bamukwase mu bigambo kwe banaasinziira okumukwata.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ebirabula n’Ebigumya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Mu kiseera ekyo ekibiina ky’abantu bangi nnyo, ne bakuŋŋaana n’okulinnyaganako ne balinnyaganako. Awo Yesu n’akyukira abayigirizwa be, n’abalabula ng’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mwekuume ekizimbulukusa bwe bannanfuusi bw’Abafalisaayo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/><char style="wj">Tewali ekyakisibwa ekitalimanyibwa, newaakubadde ekyakwekebwa ekitalizuulibwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/><char style="wj">Noolwekyo bye mwogeredde mu kizikiza biriwulirwa mu musana, n’ebyo bye mwogedde mu kaama, nga muli mu kisenge n’enzigi nga nzigale, bigenda kulangirirwa ku busolya bw’ennyumba.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kaakano mikwano gyange, temubatyanga abo abatta omubiri, naye ne batabaako kirala kye bayinza kukola.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/><char style="wj">Naye nzija kubalaga gwe musaanidde okutya. Mutyenga oyo alina obuyinza okutta ate n’okusuula mu ggeyeena. Weewaawo mbagamba nti oyo gwe musaanye okutyanga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/><char style="wj">Enkazaluggya ettaano tezigula sente bbiri zokka? Naye Katonda tazeerabira wadde emu bw’eti.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/><char style="wj">Era amanyi enviiri eziri ku mutwe gwo nga bwe zenkana obungi. Temutya kubanga mmwe muli ba muwendo nnyo okusinga enkazaluggya ennyingi.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Era mbategeeza nti buli anjatula mu maaso g’abantu, n’Omwana w’Omuntu, alimwatula mu maaso ga bamalayika ba Katonda.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/><char style="wj">Naye oyo anneegaanira mu maaso g’abantu, n’Omwana w’Omuntu alimwegaanira mu maaso ga bamalayika ba Katonda.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/><char style="wj">Na buli muntu alyogera ekigambo ku Mwana w’Omuntu alisonyiyibwa, naye oyo alivvoola Mwoyo Mutukuvu tagenda kusonyiyibwa.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bwe banaabatwalanga mu makuŋŋaaniro, ne mu maaso g’abafuzi ne mu b’obuyinza temweraliikiriranga kye mulyogera mu kuwoza,</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/><char style="wj">kubanga Mwoyo Mutukuvu agenda kubawa eky’okwogera mu kiseera ekyo kyennyini.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Awo omuntu omu mu kibiina n’avaayo n’agamba Yesu nti, “Omuyigiriza, gamba muganda wange angabanyize ku by’obusika bwaffe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Naye Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Owange, ani eyanfuula omulamuzi wammwe oba ow’okubamaliranga empaka zammwe?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mwekuume! Temululunkananga. Kubanga obulamu bw’omuntu tebugererwa ku bugagga bw’abeera nabwo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Awo n’abagerera olugero luno nti, <char style="wj">“Waaliwo omusajja omugagga eyalina ennimiro n’abaza ebibala bingi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/><char style="wj">N’alowooza munda mu ye ng’agamba nti, ‘Nnaakola ntya? Kubanga sirina we nnaakuŋŋaanyiza bibala byange?’</char><verse eid="LUK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kwe kugamba nti, ‘Ntegedde kye nnaakola, nzija kumenyawo amawanika gange gano, nzimbewo agasingako obunene! Omwo mwe nnaakuŋŋaanyiza ebibala byange byonna n’ebintu byange.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/><char style="wj">Era nzija kugamba emmeeme yange nti, “Emmeeme, weeterekedde bingi mu mawanika go okukuyisa mu myaka mingi egijja. Wummula, olye, onywe era weesanyuse!” ’</char><verse eid="LUK 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye Katonda n’amugamba nti, ‘Musirusiru ggwe! Ekiro kino emmeeme yo eneekuggibwako. Kale ebyo bye weetegekedde binaaba by’ani?’</char><verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bwe kityo bwe kiriba eri buli muntu eyeeterekera, so nga mwavu eri Katonda.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Temweraliikiriranga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Awo Yesu n’agamba abayigirizwa be nti, <char style="wj">“Noolwekyo mbagamba nti, Temweraliikiriranga bya bulamu bwammwe oba mmere gye munaalya oba engoye ez’okwambala.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/><char style="wj">Kubanga omwoyo gusinga wala emmere n’omubiri gusinga ebyambalo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/><char style="wj">Mulowooze ku namuŋŋoona, tezisiga so tezikungula, era tezirina na mawanika mwe zitereka mmere yaazo, naye Katonda aziriisa. Naye mmwe muli ba muwendo nnyo okukira ennyonyi ezo!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/><char style="wj">Ani ku mmwe bwe yeeraliikirira, ayinza okwongerayo obulamu bwe akatundu n’akamu?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/><char style="wj">Obanga temusobola kukola kantu katono ng’ako, kale kikugasa ki okweraliikirira ebintu ebirala?</char><verse eid="LUK 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mutunuulire amalanga bwe gakula! Tegategana wadde okulanga ewuzi z’engoye, naye mbategeeza nti ne Sulemaani mu kitiibwa kye kyonna teyagenkana mu kwambala.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/><char style="wj">Kale, obanga Katonda ayambaza bw’atyo omuddo ogw’omu nsiko, ogw’ekiseera obuseera ogubaawo leero ate enkeera ne gwokebwa mu kyoto, naye ate talisingawo nnyo okwambaza mmwe ab’okukkiriza okutono!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/><char style="wj">Temunoonyanga kye munaalya oba kye munaanywa, era temweraliikiriranga n’akatono.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/><char style="wj">Kubanga ebintu ebyo byonna amawanga ge biyaayaanira, naye Kitammwe amanyi nga mubyetaaga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/><char style="wj">Naye munoonye obwakabaka bwe, n’ebintu ebyo mulibyongerwako.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Temutya, mmwe ekisibo ekitono, kubanga Kitammwe asiimye okubawa obwakabaka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/><char style="wj">Mutunde ebintu byammwe, ensimbi ze muggyamu muzigabire abo abeetaaga, mwetungire ensawo ezitakaddiwa era mweterekere mu ggulu mu tterekero eritaggwaamu bintu, omubbi gy’atasembera wadde ennyenje gye zitayonoonera.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/><char style="wj">Kubanga obugagga bwo gye buli, n’omutima gwo gye gunaabeeranga.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mube beetegefu olw’obuweereza, era mukuume ettabaaza zammwe nga zaaka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/><char style="wj">Mube ng’abasajja abalindirira mukama waabwe; bw’akomawo okuva mu mbaga y’obugole, n’akonkona banguwa okumuggulirawo oluggi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/><char style="wj">Balina omukisa abaddu abo, mukama waabwe baalisanga nga batunula. Ddala ddala mbagamba nti, agenda kwambala atuuze abaddu abo ku mmeeza abagabule.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/><char style="wj">Balina omukisa abo, bw’alijja mu kisisimuka ekyokusatu, baalisanga nga batunula.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye mutegeere kino: singa ssemaka amanya essaawa omubbi w’anaayingirira okumenya ennyumba ye, teyandiganyizza mubbi kumuyingirira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/><char style="wj">Noolwekyo mubeere beetegefu. Kubanga Omwana w’Omuntu, ajjira mu kiseera kye mutamulowoolezaamu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Awo Peetero n’amubuuza nti, “Mukama waffe, olugero luno olugeredde ffe, oba bonna?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Mukama waffe n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Omuweereza oyo omwesigwa era ow’amagezi ye aluwa mukama we gw’alikwasa obuvunaanyizibwa obw’okulabirira abaweereza be n’okugaba emmere mu kiseera ekituufu?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/><char style="wj">Alina omukisa mukama we bw’alikomawo gw’alisanga ng’atuukiriza bulungi emirimu gye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/><char style="wj">Ddala ddala mbagamba nti mukama we alimukwasa okulabirira ebintu bye byonna.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/><char style="wj">Naye singa omuddu oyo alowooza mu mutima gwe nti, ‘Mukama wange ajja kulwawo okudda,’ n’adda ku baweereza banne, n’abakuba, n’ebiseera bye n’abimala mu kulya ne mu kunywa ne mu kutamiira,</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/><char style="wj">mukama we agenda kudda mu kiseera ky’atamusuubira, amubonereze, era amusuule eyo abatakkiriza gye bali.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omuweereza oyo eyamanya mukama we by’ayagala akole, kyokka ye n’atabikola agenda kuweebwa ekibonerezo kinene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/><char style="wj">Naye ataamanya n’akola ebisaanidde okumukubya alikubwa kitono. Oyo aweebwa ebingi alisuubirwamu bingi, n’oyo gwe basigira ebingi, alivunaanyizibwa bingi okusingawo.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>
    <char style="wj">“Najja kuleeta muliro ku nsi, era kyandibadde kirungi singa gukoledde!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/><char style="wj">Nninayo okubatizibwa kwe ndibatizibwa, naye nzija kuba mu nnaku nnyingi nga tekunnaba kutuukirizibwa!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/><char style="wj">Mulowooza nti najja kuleeta mirembe ku nsi? Mbategeeza nti sajja kuleeta mirembe wabula okwawukana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/><char style="wj">Okuva kaakano amaka gajjanga kwawukanamu, ag’abantu abataano, abasatu ku bo nga bawakanya ababiri, n’ababiri nga bawakanya abasatu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/><char style="wj">Kitaawe w’omwana alyawukana ne mutabani we, n’omwana n’ayawukana ne kitaawe, ne nnyina w’omwana alyawukana ne muwala we n’omuwala n’ayawukana ne nnyina, ne nnyazaala balyawukana ne muka mwana we ne muka mwana n’ayawukana ne nnyazaala we.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okunnyonnyola Ebiriwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Awo Yesu n’akyukira ekibiina n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Bwe mulaba ebire nga byekuluumulula ebugwanjuba, amangwago mugamba nti, ‘Enkuba egenda kutonnya,’ era n’etonnya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/><char style="wj">Ate empewo bw’ekunta ng’eva ku bukiikaddyo, mugamba nti, ‘Leero akasana kajja kwaka nnyo,’ era bwe kiba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/><char style="wj">Bannanfuusi mmwe! Musobola bulungi okunnyonnyola obubonero obuli ku nsi ne mu bbanga, muyinza mutya obutamanya obubonero obw’omu kiseera kino?</char><verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>
    <char style="wj">“Lwaki temwesalirawo ekyo kye mulaba nga kituufu?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/><char style="wj">Bw’obanga ogenda n’akuwawaabira mu mbuga z’amateeka, gezaako okumusaba ensonga zammwe muzimalire mu kkubo nga tezinnatuuka wa mulamuzi, talwa kukutwala wa mulamuzi, n’omulamuzi n’akuwaayo eri omuserikale, n’omuserikale n’akusibira mu kkomera.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/><char style="wj">Kubanga nkutegeeza nti togenda kuvaayo okutuusa nga ne sente esembayo omaze okugisasula.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Kwenenya oba Kuzikirira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Mu kiseera ekyo ne wabaawo abategeeza Yesu nga Piraato bwe yatta Abagaliraaya, omusaayi gwabwe n’agutabula mu biweebwayo byabwe. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mulowooza nti Abagaliraaya abo baali boonoonyi nnyo okusinga Abagaliraaya abalala bonna, balyoke baboneebone batyo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/><char style="wj">Nedda! Mbagamba nti bwe muteenenya nammwe mugenda kuzikirira ng’abo bwe baazikirira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/><char style="wj">Ate bali ekkumi n’omunaana omunaala gwa Sirowamu be gwagwako, ne gubatta, mulowooza be baali basinga obwonoonyi okusinga abantu abaabeeranga mu Yerusaalemi bonna?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/><char style="wj">Nedda! Mbagamba nti bwe muteenenya nammwe bwe mugenda okuzikirira bwe mutyo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olugero lw’Omutiini Ogutabala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Awo Yesu n’abagerera olugero luno nti, <char style="wj">“Waaliwo omusajja eyasimba omutiini mu nnimiro ye. N’agendangayo okugulambula okulaba obanga gubazeeko ebibala, n’asanga nga tegubazeeko kibala na kimu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/><char style="wj">Kyeyava alagira omusajja we amulimira ennimiro eyo nti, ‘Omuti guno gutemewo. Kubanga gino emyaka esatu nga nambula omuti guno, naye tegubalangako kibala na kimu. Gwemalira bwereere ettaka lyaffe.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/><char style="wj">Omulimi we n’addamu nti, ‘Mukama wange, tuguleke tetugutemawo. Ka tuguweeyo omwaka gumu, nzija kugutemeratemera era nguteekeko n’ebigimusa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/><char style="wj">Bwe gulibala ebibala gye bujja, kiriba kirungi! Naye bwe gutalibala, olwo noolyoka ogutemawo.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awonya Omukazi Omulema ku Ssabbiiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Awo ku lunaku lwa Ssabbiiti Yesu yali ng’ayigiriza mu kkuŋŋaaniro, <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>ne wabaawo omukazi eyaliko omuzimu ogwamulwaza okumala emyaka kkumi na munaana, nga yeewese emirundi ebiri era nga tasobola kwegolola. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesu n’amulaba, n’amuyita n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mukazi wattu, owonyezeddwa obulwadde bwo.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>N’amukwatako. Amangwago omukazi ne yeegolola n’ayimirira bulungi, n’atendereza Katonda!<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Naye omukulembeze w’ekkuŋŋaaniro eryo n’anyiiga nnyo, kubanga Yesu yawonya ku lunaku lwa Ssabbiiti. N’agamba ekibiina nti, “Mu wiiki mulimu ennaku mukaaga, muyinza okujjanga mu nnaku ezo ne muwonyezebwa, naye so si ku Ssabbiiti!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Mukama waffe n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Bannanfuusi mmwe! Buli omu ku mmwe tasumulula nte ye oba ndogoyi ye ku Ssabbiiti n’agitwala okunywa amazzi?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/><char style="wj">Naye si kituufu omukazi ono, muwala wa Ibulayimu, okusumululwa ku Ssabbiiti mu busibe bwa Setaani bw’amazeemu emyaka ekkumi n’omunaana?”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Bwe yayogera bw’atyo abaali bamuwakanya bonna ne baswala, naye ekibiina ky’abantu bonna ne bajjula essanyu olw’ebintu eby’ekitalo bye yakola.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olugero lw’Akaweke ka Kaladaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Awo Yesu kyeyava abayigiriza ng’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Obwakabaka bwa Katonda bufaanana na ki? Mbugeraageranye na ki?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/><char style="wj">Bufaanana na kaweke ka kaladaali omusajja ke yasiga mu nnimiro ye. Kaamera ne kavaamu omuti, n’ennyonyi ez’omu bbanga ne zituula ku matabi gaagwo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Ate era n’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Obwakabaka bwa Katonda mbugeraageranye na ki?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/><char style="wj">Buliŋŋanga ekizimbulukusa omukazi kye yatabulira mu bipimo by’obuwunga bisatu okutuusa obuwunga bwonna lwe bwazimbulukuka.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omulyango Omufunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Awo Yesu n’ayita mu bibuga ne mu bubuga; yagendanga ayigiriza ng’ali ku lugendo lwe ng’agenda e Yerusaalemi. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Ne wabaawo eyeewuunya nti, “Mukama waffe, abantu abalirokolebwa nga baliba batono?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu n’addamu nti, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/><char style="wj">“Mufube okuyingira mu mulyango omufunda kubanga mbagamba nti, bangi balyagala okuyingira naye tebalisobola.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/><char style="wj">Nannyinimu bw’alisituka n’aggalawo oluggi, mugenda kubeera bweru nga mukonkona nga bwe mwegayirira nti, ‘Mukama waffe, tuggulirewo.’ Agenda kubaanukula nti, ‘Sibamanyi, ne gye muva simanyiiyo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/><char style="wj">Nammwe muliddamu nti, ‘Twalyanga naawe era twanywanga ffenna, era wayigirizanga mu nguudo z’ewaffe.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/><char style="wj">Naye alibaddamu nti, ‘Sibamanyi, ne gye muva simanyiiyo. Munviire mwenna abakozi b’ebitali bya bituukirivu.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/><char style="wj">Era waliba okukuba ebiwoobe n’okuluma obujiji bwe muliraba Ibulayimu, ne Isaaka, ne Yakobo ne bannabbi bonna nga bali mu bwakabaka bwa Katonda, naye nga mmwe musuulibbwa ebweru.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/><char style="wj">Kubanga abantu baliva ebuvanjuba n’ebugwanjuba, ne bava ne mu bukiikakkono ne mu bukiikaddyo, ne batuula ku mmeeza mu bwakabaka bwa Katonda.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/><char style="wj">Era laba, abooluvannyuma baliba aboolubereberye, n’aboolubereberye baliba abooluvannyuma.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Anakuwalira Yerusaalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Mu kiseera ekyo ne wabaawo abamu ku Bafalisaayo abajja eri Yesu ne bamugamba nti, “Tambula ove wano, kubanga Kerode ayagala kukutta.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yesu n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Mugende mugambe ekibe ekyo nti laba ngoba baddayimooni, n’okuwonya abalwadde, leero, n’enkya, era ku lunaku olwokusatu ndimaliriza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/><char style="wj">Naye leero, n’enkya, ne luli nsaana mbeere ku lugendo lwange nga ntambula, kubanga tekisoboka nnabbi okufiira ebweru wa Yerusaalemi!</char><verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ggwe Yerusaalemi, ggwe Yerusaalemi, atta bannabbi, n’okuba amayinja abo ababa batumiddwa gy’oli, emirundi nga mingi nnyo gye njagadde okukuŋŋaanya abaana bo ng’enkoko bw’ekuŋŋaanya obwana bwayo mu biwaawaatiro byayo, naye n’ogaana!</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/><char style="wj">Kale laba ennyumba yammwe erekeddwa awo. Era mbagamba nti temugenda kuddayo kundaba okutuusa ekiseera lwe kirituuka ne mugamba nti, ‘Aweereddwa omukisa oyo ajja mu linnya lya Mukama.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awonya Omulwadde w’Entumbi ku Ssabbiiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Awo olwatuuka ku lunaku lwa Ssabbiiti, Yesu bwe yali ng’agenze okulya mu nnyumba ey’omu ku bakulembeze b’Abafalisaayo, abantu bonna abaaliwo ne bamwekaliriza amaaso. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Waaliwo omusajja omulwadde w’entumbi ng’atudde okwolekera Yesu we yali. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Awo Yesu n’abuuza Abafalisaayo n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka nti, <char style="wj">“Kikkirizibwa okuwonya ku lunaku lwa Ssabbiiti, oba nedda?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Yesu yalaba tebazzeemu, kwe kukwata omusajja omulwadde ku mukono, n’amuwonya, n’amugamba yeetambulire.<verse eid="LUK 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>N’alyoka abakyukira n’ababuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Ani ku mmwe singa omwana we agwa mu kinnya oba ente ye n’egwa mu kinnya ku lunaku lwa Ssabbiiti, atamuggyayo oba atagiggyaayo mangwago?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Era ne batamuddamu.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwetoowaza ku Bugenyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Awo Yesu bwe yalaba abagenyi abaayitibwa n’abagerera olugero ng’agamba nti, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/><char style="wj">“Bwe bakuyitanga ku mbaga ey’obugole, teweetuuzanga mu kifo ekisinga okuba eky’ekitiibwa kubanga singa ejjayo omugenyi akusinga ekitiibwa,</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/><char style="wj">eyakuyise ku mbaga ajja kumuleeta awo w’otudde akugambe nti, ‘Viira ono atuule awo w’otudde.’ Noolyoka ositukawo ng’oswadde ogende onoonye ekifo ekirala emabega.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/><char style="wj">Naye bwe bakuyitanga, otuulanga mu kifo eky’emabega, kale nno eyakuyise bw’ajja alyoke akugambe nti, ‘Mukwano gwange, jjangu nkutwale mu kifo eky’omu maaso.’ Noolyoka osituka nga ne bagenyi banno bakuwa ekitiibwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/><char style="wj">Kubanga buli muntu eyeegulumiza alitoowazibwa; n’oyo eyeetoowaza aligulumizibwa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Awo Yesu n’akyukira eyamuyita n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Bw’otegekanga ekyemisana oba ekyeggulo, toyitanga mikwano gyo, wadde baganda bo, wadde ab’olulyo lwo, wadde baliraanwa bo abagagga; kubanga bw’okola otyo nabo bayinza okukuyita olulala ne baba ng’abakusasula.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/><char style="wj">Naye bw’ofumbanga ekijjulo, oyitanga abaavu, n’abagongobavu, n’abalema ne bamuzibe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/><char style="wj">Oliweebwa omukisa kubanga bo tebalina kya kukusasula. Olisasulibwa mu kuzuukira kw’Abatuukirivu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Omu ku bagenyi abaali batudde ku mmeeza bwe yawulira ebigambo ebyo n’agamba Yesu nti, “Alina omukisa oyo alirya embaga mu bwakabaka bwa Katonda.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Waaliwo omusajja eyateekateeka okufumba embaga ennene, n’ayita abantu bangi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/><char style="wj">Bwe yamala okutegeka, n’atuma omuddu we agende ategeeze abaayitibwa nti, ‘Mujje byonna biwedde okutegeka.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye bonna ne batandika okwewolereza; eyasooka n’agamba nti, ‘Nnaakagula ennimiro noolwekyo njagala kugenda kugirambula. Nkusaba onsonyiwe, nneme kujja.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omulala n’agamba nti, ‘Nnakagula emigogo gy’ente ezirima etaano njagala kuzigezaamu. Nkusaba onsonyiwe nneme kujja.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omulala n’agamba nti, ‘Nnawasizza omukazi noolwekyo sisobola kujja.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omuddu n’akomawo n’ategeeza mukama we ng’abagenyi be yayita bwe bagambye. Mukama we n’anyiiga, n’amulagira agende mangu mu nguudo ez’omu kibuga ne mu bikubo, ayite abaavu n’abagongobavu, n’abalema, ne bamuzibe.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omuddu n’agamba mukama we nti, ‘Bonna mbayise nga bw’ondagidde, naye era mu kisenge ky’embaga mukyalimu ebifo.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“N’agamba omuddu we nti, ‘Genda mu nguudo ez’omu byalo ne mu bukubo obutono okubirize b’onoosangayo bajje, ennyumba yange ejjule.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/><char style="wj">Era mbategeeza nti tewali n’omu ku abo be nayita alirya ku mbaga yange.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Awo ebibiina by’abantu bangi nnyo bwe baali bagoberera Yesu, n’akyuka n’abagamba nti, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/><char style="wj">“Omuntu bw’anajjanga gye ndi, n’atakyawa kitaawe, oba nnyina, oba mukyala we n’abaana be, oba baganda be oba bannyina, newaakubadde obulamu bwe ye yennyini, tayinzenga kuba muyigirizwa wange.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/><char style="wj">Era oyo ateetikka musaalaba gwe n’angoberera, tayinza kuba muyigirizwa wange.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Singa omu ku mmwe ayagala okuzimba omulungooti, tamala kutuula n’abalirira omuwendo omulimu ogwo gwe gunaatwala, n’alaba obanga ensimbi ezeetaagibwa azirina okugumaliriza?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/><char style="wj">Kubanga singa tagumaliriza n’akoma ku musingi gwokka, buli agulaba atandika okumusekerera,</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/><char style="wj">nga bw’agamba nti, ‘Omuntu ono yatandika okuzimba naye n’alemwa okumaliriza!’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Oba kabaka ki agenda okulwana ne kabaka omulala amulumba, tamala kutuula n’abalirira obanga n’abaserikale omutwalo ogumu b’alina, asobola okulwanyisa kabaka omulala ajja okumulumba n’abaserikale emitwalo ebiri?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/><char style="wj">Bw’afumiitiriza n’alaba nga tajja kusobola, atumira kabaka oli omubaka, ng’akyaliko wala, okuteesa emirembe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/><char style="wj">Kale, buli muntu ku mmwe ateefiiriza byonna by’alina, tayinza kuba muyigirizwa wange.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omunnyo mulungi, naye singa guggwaamu ensa, guzibwamu gutya obuka bwagwo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/><char style="wj">Guba tegukyalina mugaso n’akamu mu ttaka wadde ne mu bigimusa, noolwekyo gusuulibwa bweru. Alina amatu agawulira awulire.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Olugero lw’Endiga Eyabula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Awo abasolooza b’omusolo n’abakozi b’ebibi ne bakuŋŋaanira eri Yesu okumuwuliriza. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Naye Abafalisaayo n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka ne beemulugunya nga bagamba nti Yesu akolagana n’abantu abalina ebibi, n’okulya n’alya nabo.<verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Yesu n’alyoka abagerera olugero luno ng’agamba nti, <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/><char style="wj">“Singa omu ku mmwe abadde alina endiga kikumi, naye emu n’emubulako, taleka ziri ekyenda mu omwenda ku ttale n’agenda anoonya eri ebuze okutuusa Lw’agiraba?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/><char style="wj">Bw’agiraba, agisitula ku bibegabega bye n’agitwala eka ng’ajaguza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/><char style="wj">Bw’atuuka eka ayita mikwano gye ne baliraanwa be bajje ng’agamba nti, ‘Munsanyukireko kubanga endiga yange eyabadde ebuze, erabise.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/><char style="wj">Mu ngeri y’emu, mbagamba nti mu ggulu eribaayo essanyu lingi nnyo olw’omwonoonyi omu eyeenenyezza okusinga ekyenda mu omwenda abatuukirivu abateetaaga kwenenya.”</char><verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olugero lw’Ennoso Eyabula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Oba mukazi ki alina ennoso ze kkumi, emu n’emubulako, atakoleeza ttaala n’anoonya mu buli kasonda konna ak’ennyumba, n’ayera n’ebuziizi yenna okutuusa lw’agiraba?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/><char style="wj">Bw’agiraba, ayita mikwano gye ne baliraanwa be n’abagamba nti, ‘Munsanyukireko, ennoso yange eyabadde ebuze ngirabye.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/><char style="wj">Mbategeeza nti mu ngeri y’emu omukozi w’ebibi omu bwe yeenenya, bamalayika ba Katonda bajjula essanyu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olugero lw’Omwana Eyazaawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Awo Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Waaliwo omusajja eyalina batabani be babiri.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/><char style="wj">Omuto n’agamba kitaawe nti, ‘Kitange, nkusaba ompe omugabo gwange ku bintu byo ogunsaanidde.’ Kitaawe n’abagabanyiza ebintu byabwe.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Waayitawo ennaku ntono, omwana omuto n’asibako ebintu bye byonna ne yeetambulira, n’agenda mu nsi ey’ewala. Bwe yatuuka eyo n’asaasaanya ebintu bye ne yeemalira mu binyumu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/><char style="wj">Mu kiseera ekyo we yamalirawo ebintu bye byonna, n’enjala nnyingi we yagwira mu nsi omwo mwe yali, n’asiibanga era n’asulanga enjala.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/><char style="wj">N’agenda abeere ew’omwami omu ow’omu nsi omwo n’amusaba amuwe omulimu, n’amusindika gye yalundiranga embizzi azirabirirenga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/><char style="wj">Omulenzi ne yeegombanga okulyanga ebikuta by’embizzi, naye ne watabaawo amuwa kantu konna.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye bwe yeddamu n’agamba nti, ‘Eka ewaffe, abasajja abapakasi aba kitange bafuna emmere nnyingi ne balya ne balemwa, naye nze ndi wano nfiira wano enjala!</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/><char style="wj">Nnaagenda eri kitange, mugambe nti, Kitange, nnyonoonye eri eggulu ne mu maaso go,</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/><char style="wj">era sikyasaanira na kuyitibwa mwana wo. Nfunira omulimu mbeere ng’abapakasi bo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/><char style="wj">Bw’atyo n’asitula n’addayo ewa kitaawe.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">
    <char style="wj">“Naye bwe yali ng’akyaliko wala n’awaka, kitaawe n’amulengera ng’ajja, n’amusaasira nnyo. Kitaawe ng’ajjudde amaziga n’amusisinkana, n’amugwa mu kifuba n’amunywegera.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/><char style="wj">Omwana n’agamba kitaawe nti, ‘Kitange, nnyonoonye eri eggulu ne mu maaso go. Sikyasaanira kuyitibwa mwana wo.’</char><verse eid="LUK 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye kitaawe n’alagira abaddu be nti, ‘Mwanguwe mangu! Muleete ekkanzu esinga obulungi mugimwambaze. Mumunaanike empeta ku ngalo ye, mumwambaze n’engatto!</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/><char style="wj">Era mugende mutte ennyana eya ssava. Tufumbe embaga nnene tujaguze.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/><char style="wj">Kubanga mutabani wange ono yali afudde kaakano mulamu, yali azaaye laba wuuno azaawuse.’ Embaga n’etandika.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mu kiseera ekyo omwana omukulu yali ali mu nnimiro. Awo bwe yali akomawo eka ng’asemberedde ennyumba, n’awulira ennyimba ez’amazina.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/><char style="wj">N’ayita omu ku baweereza n’amubuuza bwe bibadde.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/><char style="wj">Omuweereza n’amutegeeza nti, ‘Muganda wo akomyewo, era kitammwe amuttidde ennyana eya ssava olwokubanga muganda wo akomyewo nga mulamu bulungi.’</char><verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Muganda we omukulu n’anyiiga, n’okuyingira n’atayingira mu nnyumba. Naye kitaawe n’ajja n’amwegayirira ayingire,</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/><char style="wj">naye omwana n’amuddamu nti, ‘Emyaka gino gyonna nkukoledde, era tewali mulundi na gumu Lwe wali ondagidde ne nkujeemera. Naye tompangayo wadde akabuzi akato neesanyuseeko ne mikwano gyange.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/><char style="wj">Naye kale mutabani wo olukomyewo ng’ebintu byo bye wamuwa amaze okubimalira mu bamalaaya, n’omuttira ennyana ensava.’</char><verse eid="LUK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kitaawe n’amuddamu nti, ‘Laba mwana wange, tuli ffenna bulijjo, era byonna bye nnina bibyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/><char style="wj">Kaakano kituufu okusanyuka n’okujaguza. Kubanga muganda wo, yali afudde, kaakano mulamu! Yali azaaye, wuuno azaawuse!’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Omuwanika Omukalabakalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Awo Yesu n’agamba abayigirizwa be nti, <char style="wj">“Waaliwo omusajja omugagga ng’alina omuwanika we amulabiririra ebintu bye. Ne wabaawo abaamuloopera nti omuwanika oyo yali asaasaanya ebintu bye, ng’abidiibuuda.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/><char style="wj">Mukama we n’amuyita n’amubuuza nti, ‘Biki ebyo bye nkuwulirako? Kale genda otegeke lipoota y’ebintu byange nga bwe biri ogindeetere. Omulimu gukufudde.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omuwanika n’alowooza mu mutima gwe, nga yeebuuza nti, ‘Kale kaakano nkole ntya? Mukama wange wuuno angoba ku mulimu. Sirina maanyi galima, n’okusabiriza kunkwasa ensonyi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/><char style="wj">Ekinaasobozesa abantu okunsembeza mu maka gaabwe, nga bwe ngobeddwa ku mulimu, nkifunye.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“N’agenda ng’ayita buli eyalina ebbanja ku mukama we. Gwe yasookerako n’amubuuza nti, ‘Ebbanja mukama wange ly’akubanja lyenkana wa obunene?’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omusajja n’addamu nti, ‘Ammanja endebe z’omuzigo kikumi mu ataano.’ Omuwanika n’amugamba nti, ‘Kwako empapula zo kw’obanjirwa ogende owandiike endebe amakumi ataano.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omuwanika n’adda ku wookubiri n’amubuuza nti, ‘Ggwe obanjibwa ki?’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">
    <char style="wj">“N’addamu nti, ‘Ebigera by’obuwunga bw’eŋŋaano kikumi.’ ”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">
    <char style="wj">“Omuwanika n’amugamba nti, ‘Kwako empapula zo kw’obanjirwa, owandiike endala osseeko ebigera kinaana.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mukama we n’atenda nnyo omuwanika we atali mwesigwa olw’obukalabakalaba bwe. Kubanga abaana b’omulembe guno bagezigezi okusinga abaana b’omusana ab’omu mulembe gwabwe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Enkozesa y’Obugagga Entuufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Era mbategeeza nti mwefunire emikwano mu bugagga obutali butuukirivu, bwe buliggwaawo balyoke babasembeze mu weema ezitaggwaawo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/><char style="wj">Omuntu omwesigwa mu kintu ekitono, abeera mwesigwa ne mu kinene; n’oyo ataba mwesigwa mu kitono era ne mu kinene taba mwesigwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/><char style="wj">Kale obanga temwesigibwa mu bugagga obutali butuukirivu, ani agenda okubeesiga mu bugagga obw’amazima?</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/><char style="wj">Obanga toli mwesigwa ku by’omulala, kale ani alikwesiga n’akukwasa ebibyo?</char><verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Tewali muddu ayinza kuweereza bakulu babiri. Kubanga alikyawako omu n’ayagala omulala, oba aliwulirako omu n’anyooma omulala. Toyinza kuweereza Katonda na mamona.”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amateeka ga Musa n’Obwakabaka bwa Katonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Awo Abafalisaayo, abaali abaluvu b’ensimbi, bwe baawulira ebigambo ebyo ne banyooma Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mmwe mweraga mu bantu, naye Katonda amanyi emitima gyammwe. Okwerimbalimba kwammwe kubaweesa ekitiibwa mu maaso g’abantu, naye nga kya muzizo eri Katonda.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Yokaana Omubatiza bwe yali nga tannabuulira, amateeka n’obubaka bwa bannabbi byabuulirwa. Naye okuva olwo obwakabaka bwa Katonda bubuulirwa, ne buli muntu ayitibwa abuyingiremu mu bwangu ddala.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/><char style="wj">Naye kyangu eggulu n’ensi okuggwaawo okusinga n’akatundu k’ennukuta emu ey’amateeka okuggwaawo.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omusajja yenna agoba mukazi we n’awasa omulala aba ayenze; n’oyo awasa omukazi agobeddwa, naye aba ayenze.”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugagga ne Laazaalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>Awo Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Waaliwo omusajja omugagga ennyo, eyayambalanga engoye ez’effulungu ne linena era bulijjo ng’abeera mu masanyu era ng’alya ebyassava.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/><char style="wj">Waaliwo n’omusajja omwavu erinnya lye nga ye Laazaalo nga mulwadde ng’ajjudde amabwa ku mubiri gwe, eyateekebwanga ku mulyango gw’omusajja omugagga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/><char style="wj">Laazaalo ne yeegombanga okulya obukunkumuka obwagwanga wansi nga buva ku mmeeza ya nnaggagga. N’embwa zajjanga ne zikomberera amabwa ga Laazaalo.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ekiseera kyatuuka omusajja omwavu n’afa, bamalayika ne bamutwala mu kifuba kya Ibulayimu. Oluvannyuma n’omugagga naye n’afa, n’aziikibwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/><char style="wj">Naye ng’ali eyo mu magombe mu kubonaabona, n’atunula waggulu n’alaba Laazaalo ng’ali mu kifuba kya Ibulayimu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/><char style="wj">N’akoowoola nti, ‘Kitange Ibulayimu, nsaasira, ontumire Laazaalo oyo annyike olugalo Lwe mu mazzi, nkombeko, naye olulimi lumbabuukirira nnyo mu muliro guno ogumbonyaabonya!’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye Ibulayimu n’amuddamu nti, ‘Mwana wange, jjukira nga mu biseera byo ng’okyali mulamu wafuna ebirungi bye weetaaganga, naye nga Laazaalo ye afuna bibi. Kaakano Laazaalo asanyusibwa naye gwe oli mu kubonaabona.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/><char style="wj">Ate n’ekirala, wakati waffe nammwe waliwo olukonko luwanvu nnyo olutwawula, omuntu ali eno bw’ayagala okujja eyo akoma awo ku mugo gwalwo, n’oyo ali eyo ayagala okujja eno tasobola.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Awo nnaggagga n’ayaziirana nti, ‘Ayi kitange Ibulayimu, nkwegayiridde ntumira Laazaalo oyo mu maka ga kitange,</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/><char style="wj">kubanga nninayo abooluganda bataano, abandabulire, bwe balifa baleme kujja mu kifo kino ekirimu okubonaabona okwenkanidde wano.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/><char style="wj">Naye Ibulayimu n’amugamba nti, ‘Balina Musa ne bannabbi, kale bawulire abo.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omugagga n’addamu nti, ‘Nedda, kitange Ibulayimu, singa batumirwa omuntu ng’ava mu bafu, bajja kwenenya.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Awo Ibulayimu n’amugamba nti, ‘Obanga tebagondera Musa ne bannabbi, newaakubadde alizuukira okuva mu bafu talibakkirizisa.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Ekibi, Okukkiriza, Omulimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Awo Yesu n’agamba abayigirizwa be nti, <char style="wj">“Ebikemo ebireetera abantu okwonoona tebiyinza butajja, naye zimusanze omuntu oyo abireeta.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/><char style="wj">Ekyandisinze kwe kusiba olubengo mu bulago bwe n’asuulibwa mu nnyanja okusinga okwesittaza omu ku baana bano abato.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/><char style="wj">Mwekuume.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">
    <char style="wj">“Muganda wo bw’ayonoonanga, omunenyanga; era singa yeenenya omusonyiwanga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/><char style="wj">Ne bw’akusobyanga emirundi omusanvu mu lunaku olumu, naye buli mulundi n’ajja gy’oli n’akwenenyeza, musonyiwenga.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Awo abatume ne bagamba Mukama waffe nti, “Twongereko okukkiriza.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Mukama waffe n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Singa okukkiriza kwammwe kuba ng’akaweke ka kaladaali, mwandigambye omukenene guno nti, ‘Siguka ogwe mu nnyanja,’ era ne gubagondera.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye ani ku mmwe, ng’omuddu we yaakakomawo okuva okulima oba okulunda endiga, amugamba nti, ‘Jjangu mangu otuule ku mmere?’</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/><char style="wj">Tamugamba nti, ‘Teekateeka emmere yange, weerongoose olabike bulungi, olyoke ompeereze nga ndya era nga nnywa, bwe nnaamala naawe n’onywa era n’olya emmere yo?’</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/><char style="wj">Mulowooza nti Mukama w’omuweereza oyo amwebaza olw’okugondera bye yalagirwa okukola?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/><char style="wj">Nammwe bwe mutyo bwe mumalanga okutuukiriza ebyo ebyabagambibwa okukola, mugambenga nti, ‘Ffe abaddu bo abatasaanira tukoze omulimu gwaffe ogutugwanidde.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abagenge Kkumi Bawonyezebwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Awo Yesu bwe yali yeeyongerayo mu lugendo lwe ng’agenda e Yerusaalemi, n’akwata ekkubo eriyita wakati wa Ggaliraaya ne Samaliya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Awo bwe yayingira mu kabuga akamu, abasajja kkumi nga bonna bagenge ne bajja okumusisinkana. Ne bayimirira walako <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>ne bakoowoola mu ddoboozi ery’omwanguka nti, “Yesu, Mukama waffe, tukwatirwe ekisa!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Yesu bwe yabalaba n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mugende mweyanjule eri bakabona.”</char> Bwe baali nga bagenda ne bawona ne baba balongoofu.<verse eid="LUK 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Omu ku bo bwe yalaba ng’awonye n’akomawo eri Yesu nga bw’aleekaanira waggulu ng’atendereza Katonda. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>N’agwa wansi ku bigere bya Yesu ng’amwebaza. Omusajja oyo yali Musamaliya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Yesu n’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ekkumi bonna tebaawonyezebbwa? Omwenda bo baluwa?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/><char style="wj">Tebayinzizza kudda kutendereza Katonda wabula munnaggwanga ono yekka y’akomyewo?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Awo Yesu n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Situka weetambulire, okukkiriza kwo kukuwonyezza.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okujja kw’Obwakabaka bwa Katonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Awo Abafalisaayo ne babuuza Yesu nti, “Obwakabaka bwa Katonda bulijja ddi?” Yesu n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Obwakabaka bwa Katonda tebulabika nga bujja,</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/><char style="wj">era abantu tebagenda kugamba nti, ‘Laba buubuno wano,’ oba nti, ‘Buubuli wali,’ kubanga obwakabaka bwa Katonda buli mu mmwe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Oluvannyuma n’agamba abayigirizwa be nti, <char style="wj">“Ekiseera kijja lwe mulyegomba okulaba olumu, ku nnaku z’Omwana w’Omuntu, naye temulirulaba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/><char style="wj">Balibagamba nti lwe luno era nti lwe luli temugendanga era temubagobereranga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/><char style="wj">Kubanga ng’eggulu bwe limyansiza ku ludda olumu olw’eggulu ate ne limyansiza ku ludda olulala olw’eggulu, bw’atyo bw’aliba Omwana w’Omuntu ku lunaku lwe,</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/><char style="wj">Naye okusooka kimugwanira okubonaabona mu bintu bingi, n’okugaanibwa, abantu ab’omulembe guno.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nga bwe kyali mu biseera bya Nuuwa, era bwe kityo bwe kiriba ne mu biseera by’Omwana w’Omuntu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/><char style="wj">Abantu baali balya nga banywa nga bawasa era nga bafumbirwa okutuusa ku lunaku Nuuwa lwe yayingira mu lyato. Olwo amataba ne gajja ne gasaanyaawo buli kintu.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Era kiriba nga bwe kyali mu nnaku za Lutti. Abantu baali balya nga banywa, nga bagula era nga batunda, nga balima era nga bazimba amayumba,</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/><char style="wj">okutuusa ku lunaku Lutti lwe yava mu Sodomu. Olwo omuliro n’olunyata ne biyiika okuva mu ggulu ne bizikiriza buli kimu.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bwe bityo bwe biriba ku lunaku, Omwana w’Omuntu lw’alirabikirako.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/><char style="wj">Ku lunaku olwo omuntu yenna aliba waggulu ku nju, takkanga mu nju munda kuggyamu bintu bye. N’abo abaliba mu nnimiro tebaddangayo eka okubaako ne bye banonayo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/><char style="wj">Mujjukire mukazi wa Lutti!</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/><char style="wj">Buli anoonya okuwonya obulamu bwe alibufiirwa, naye buli eyeefiiriza obulamu bwe alibuwonya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/><char style="wj">Mbagamba nti ku lunaku olwo abantu babiri baliba ku kitanda kimu, Omu alitwalibwa naye munne n’alekebwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/><char style="wj">Abantu babiri baliba basa ku lubengo, omu alitwalibwa naye munne alirekebwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/><char style="wj">Abasajja babiri baliba mu nnimiro, omu alitwalibwa naye munne alirekebwa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Awo abayigirizwa be ne bamubuuza nti, “Mukama waffe, nga batwalibwa wa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Awaba ekifudde awo ensega</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Empungu mu Luyonaani, naye e Buganda okusinga tulina nsega</char></note> <char style="wj">we zirikuŋŋaanira!”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Olugero lwa Nnamwandu n’Omulamuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Awo Yesu n’agerera abayigirizwa be olugero ng’agamba nga bwe bagwanidde obutakoowanga kusaba n’obutaggwaamu mwoyo, ng’agamba nti, <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/><char style="wj">“Waaliwo omulamuzi mu kibuga ekimu, nga tatya Katonda era nga tafa ku muntu yenna.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/><char style="wj">Mu kibuga ekyo mwalimu nnamwandu eyajjanga ew’omulamuzi oyo buli lunaku ng’amwegayirira nti, ‘Nnamula n’omulabe wange.’</char><verse eid="LUK 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omulamuzi n’amala ebbanga ng’akyagaanyi. Naye oluvannyuma n’agamba mu mutima gwe nti, ‘Newaakubadde nga sitya Katonda era nga sirina muntu gwe nzisaamu kitiibwa,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/><char style="wj">naye olwokubanga nnamwandu ono aneetayiridde nnyo, nzijja kumumalira ensonga ze, kubanga ajja kunkooya olw’okuneetayirira ng’ajja gye ndi buli lunaku!’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Awo Mukama waffe n’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Muwulire omulamuzi atali wa mazima bw’agamba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/><char style="wj">Kale Katonda talisingawo nnyo kulamula abantu be, be yeerondera, abamukaabirira emisana n’ekiro ate ng’abagumiikiriza?</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/><char style="wj">Mbagamba nti agenda kubalamula mangu. Naye Omwana w’Omuntu, bw’alijja, alisanga okukkiriza ku nsi?”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Awo Yesu n’agerera olugero luno abo abeerowooza nga batuukirivu nga banyoomoola n’abantu abalala, n’agamba nti, <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/><char style="wj">“Abantu babiri baayambuka mu Yeekaalu okusaba, omu yali Mufalisaayo n’omulala nga muwooza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/><char style="wj">Omufalisaayo n’ayimirira n’atandika okusaba nga yeeyogerako nti, ‘Nkwebaza, Katonda, kubanga sifaanana ng’abantu abalala: ab’omululu, abalyazaamaanyi, abenzi, oba omuwooza ono.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/><char style="wj">Nsiiba emirundi ebiri mu wiiki, era mpaayo eri Katonda, ekimu eky’ekkumi ku bintu byonna bye nfuna.’</char><verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye omuwooza n’ayimirira wala n’atasobola na kuyimusa maaso ge kutunula eri eggulu ng’asaba, wabula ne yeekuba mu kifuba ng’asaba nti, ‘Katonda, onsaasire, nze omwonoonyi.’</char><verse eid="LUK 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mbagamba nti omusajja ono, omuwooza ye yaddayo eka ng’asonyiyiddwa ebibi bye. Kubanga buli eyeegulumiza alitoowazibwa, n’oyo eyeetoowaza aligulumizibwa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu n’Abaana Abato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Lumu ne wabaawo abaaleetera Yesu abaana baabwe abato abakwateko abawe omukisa. Naye abayigirizwa bwe baakiraba ne bajunga abaabaleeta. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Naye Yesu abaana n’abayita, n’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Muleke abaana abato bajje gye ndi, temubagaana, kubanga abali nga bano be b’obwakabaka bwa Katonda.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/><char style="wj">Ddala ddala mbagamba nti atayaniriza bwakabaka bwa Katonda ng’omwana omuto, talibuyingiramu n’akatono.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukungu Omugagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Awo omu ku bakulembeze b’Abayudaaya n’abuuza Yesu nti, “Omuyigiriza omulungi, nkole ki okufuna obulamu obutaggwaawo?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Lwaki ompita omulungi? Tewali mulungi n’omu wabula Katonda yekka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/><char style="wj">Amateeka ogamanyi nti, ‘Toyendanga, tottanga, tobbanga, tolimbanga, kitaawo ne nnyoko obassangamu ekitiibwa.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>N’amuddamu nti, “Amateeka ago gonna ngagondedde ebbanga lyonna okuva mu buto bwange.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesu bwe yawulira ebyo, n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Okyabulako ekintu kimu. Genda otunde ebibyo byonna, ensimbi z’onoggyamu ozigabire abaavu, olibeera n’obugagga mu ggulu, olyoke ojje ongoberere.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Naye bwe yawulira ebigambo ebyo n’agenda ng’anakuwadde nnyo, kubanga yali mugagga nnyo. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesu bwe yamulaba ng’anakuwadde nnyo, n’ayogera nti, <char style="wj">“Nga kizibu omugagga okuyingira mu bwakabaka bwa Katonda!</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/><char style="wj">Kyangu eŋŋamira okuyita mu nnyindo y’empiso okusinga omugagga okuyingira mu bwakabaka bwa Katonda.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Abo abaawulira ebyo kwe kubuuza nti, “Kale ani ayinza okulokolebwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yesu n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Ebitayinzika eri abantu, biyinzika eri Katonda.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Peetero n’amugamba nti, “Ffe twalekawo ebyaffe byonna ne tukugoberera!”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Yesu n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Ddala ddala mbagamba nti teri muntu n’omu eyalekawo amaka ge, oba omukazi we, oba baganda be, oba abazadde be, oba abaana be, olw’obwakabaka bwa Katonda,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/><char style="wj">atalifuna mirundi mingi n’okusingawo mu mulembe guno, ate ne mu mulembe ogugenda okujja aweebwe obulamu obutaggwaawo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ayongera Okwogera ku Kufa kwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Awo Yesu n’azza ku bbali ekkumi n’ababiri, n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Laba, twambuka e Yerusaalemi, era bwe tunaatuuka eyo, byonna bannabbi bye bawandiika ku Mwana w’Omuntu, bijja kutuukirizibwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/><char style="wj">Ajja kuweebwayo eri Abamawanga okukudaalirwa n’okuvumibwa. Balimuduulira, ne bamubonyaabonya, ne bamuwandira amalusu,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/><char style="wj">balimukuba era ne bamutta. Ne ku lunaku olwokusatu alizuukira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Naye abayigirizwa be tebaategeera ky’agamba, amakulu gaakyo gaali gabakwekeddwa, ne batategeera bye yayogera.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awonya Omuzibe w’Amaaso Omusabiriza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Awo Yesu bwe yali ng’asemberera Yeriko, ne wabaawo omusajja omuzibe w’amaaso eyali atudde ku kkubo ng’asabiriza. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Awo omusajja oyo bwe yawulira ng’ekibiina ky’abantu bayitawo, n’abuuza nti, “Kiki ekyo?” <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Ne bamuddamu nti, “Yesu Omunnazaaleesi ye ayitawo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Omuzibe w’amaaso n’akoowoola nti, “Yesu, Omwana wa Dawudi, onsaasire!” <verse eid="LUK 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Abo abaali bakulembeddemu ne bamuboggolera asirike, kyokka ye ne yeeyongera bweyongezi okuleekaana nti, “Omwana wa Dawudi, onsaasire!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Awo Yesu n’ayimirira, n’alagira, omusajja bamumuleetere. Bwe yasembera, Yesu n’amubuuza nti, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/><char style="wj">“Kiki ky’oyagala nkukolere?”</char> Omusajja n’addamu nti, “Mukama wange, njagala nziremu okulaba!” <verse eid="LUK 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yesu n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ddamu okulaba. Okukkirizakwo kukuwonyezza.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Amangwago n’addamu okulaba, n’agoberera Yesu ng’atendereza Katonda. Bonna abaakiraba ne batendereza Katonda.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Zaakayo Omusolooza w’Omusolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Awo Yesu n’atuuka mu kibuga Yeriko, n’ayitamu. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Mu kibuga omwo mwalimu omusajja erinnya lye Zaakayo; yali mukulu wa bawooza, era yali mugagga nnyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>N’afuba okulaba Yesu, naye n’atasobola ng’ali mu kibiina ky’abantu kubanga yali mumpi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Kyeyava adduka ne yeesooka ekibiina mu maaso, n’alinnya omuti omusukamooli asobole okulaba Yesu ng’ayitawo.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yesu bwe yatuuka awo n’atunula waggulu, n’amuyita nti, <char style="wj">“Zaakayo! Yanguwa okke wansi! Kubanga olwa leero ŋŋenda kuba mugenyi wo mu maka go.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Awo Zaakayo n’akka mangu okuva ku muti n’atwala Yesu mu nnyumba ye ng’ajjudde essanyu.<verse eid="LUK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Abantu bonna abaakiraba ne batandika okwemulugunya nga bagamba nti, “Agenze okukyalira omuntu alina ebibi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Awo Zaakayo n’ayimirira n’agamba Mukama waffe nti, “Mukama wange! Mpuliriza! Ebintu byange nnaabigabanyaamu wakati, ekitundu ne nkiwa abaavu; era obanga waliwo omuntu gwe nnali ndyazaamaanyizza, nnaamuliyira emirundi ena.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesu n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Olwa leero obulokozi buzze mu nnyumba muno, kubanga omusajja ono naye muzzukulu wa Ibulayimu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/><char style="wj">Kubanga Omwana w’Omuntu, yajjirira kunoonya n’okulokola abaabula.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olugero lw’Ensimbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Awo nga bakyawuliriza ebyo, Yesu n’abagerera olugero olulala. Mu kiseera ebyo yali asemberedde nnyo Yerusaalemi, era abantu ne balowooza nti obwakabaka bwa Katonda bugenda kutandika mu kiseera ekyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Waaliwo omukungu omu eyalaga mu nsi ey’ewala alye obwakabaka alyoke akomewo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/><char style="wj">Bwe yali asitula n’ayita abaddu be kkumi n’abalekera mina</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mina </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ye yali empeera eyaweebwanga omukozi oluvannyuma lw’emyezi esatu</char></note> <char style="wj">kkumi n’abagamba nti, ‘Muzisuubuzise okutuusa lwe ndidda.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye abantu be baali tebamwagala ne batuma ababaka baabwe mu nsi gye yalaga, nga bagamba nti, ‘Ffe tetwagala musajja ono kubeera kabaka waffe.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye n’afuulibwa kabaka, n’addayo mu kitundu ky’ewaabwe. Bwe yatuuka n’ayita abaddu be, be yali alekedde ensimbi, bamutegeeze amagoba ge baggyamu.</char><verse eid="LUK 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Eyasooka n’ajja n’agamba nti, ‘Ssebo, mina gye wandekera navisaamu mina kkumi.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mukama we n’amwebaza, n’amugamba nti, ‘Oli muddu mulungi nnyo. Kubanga obadde mwesigwa mu kintu ekitono ennyo, nkuwadde okufuga ebibuga kkumi.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omuddu owookubiri n’ajja, n’agamba mukama we nti, ‘Ssebo, mina gye wandekera navisaamu mina ttaano.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Oyo naye n’amugamba nti, ‘Onoofuga ebibuga bitaano.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Awo omuddu omulala n’ajja, n’agamba mukama we nti, ‘Mina gye wandekera yiino, nagitereka bulungi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/><char style="wj">Nakutya, kuba, nga bw’oli omuntu omukakanyavu, otwala ebitali bibyo, n’okungula n’ebibala by’otaasiga.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mukama we n’amuddamu nti, ‘Oli musajja mubi nnyo! Nzija kukusalira omusango ng’ebigambo byo by’oyogedde bwe biri. Wamanya nga ndi muntu mukalubo, nga ntwala ebitali byange, era nga nkungula bye saasiga,</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/><char style="wj">kale, lwaki ensimbi zange tewazissa mu banka, bwe nandikomyewo nandizisanzeeyo nga zizadde n’amagoba?’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“N’alyoka agamba abaali bayimiridde awo nti, ‘Mumuggyeeko mina eyo mugiwe oli alina ekkumi.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ne bamugamba nti, ‘Naye ssebo, oli alina mina kkumi!’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“N’abaddamu nti, ‘Mbagamba nti oyo yenna alina, alyongerwako; ate oyo atalina, n’akatono k’alina kalimuggibwako.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/><char style="wj">Kaakano njagala abo bonna abalabe bange, abaajeema nga tebaagala mbeere kabaka waabwe, mubandeetere wano, mubattire mu maaso gange.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ayingira mu Yerusaalemi n’Ekitiibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Awo Yesu bwe yamala okwogera ebigambo ebyo, n’atambula ng’akulembedde abayigirizwa be okwolekera Yerusaalemi. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Bwe yali asemberera ebibuga Besufaage ne Besaniya ng’ali ku lusozi oluyitibwa olwa Zeyituuni, n’atuma abayigirizwa be babiri n’abagamba nti, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/><char style="wj">“Mugende mu kabuga akatuli mu maaso bwe munaaba mwakakayingira, munaalaba omwana gw’endogoyi, oguteebagalwangako, nga gusibiddwa awo. Mugusumulule, muguleete wano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/><char style="wj">Singa wabaawo ababuuza nti, ‘Lwaki mugusumulula?’ Mumuddamu nti, ‘Mukama waffe agwetaaga.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Awo abaatumibwa ne bagenda ne basanga omwana gw’endogoyi nga Yesu bwe yabagamba. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Era bwe baali nga bagusumulula bannannyini gwo ne bababuuza nti, “Lwaki musumulula omwana gw’endogoyi ogwo?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Ne baddamu nti, “Mukama waffe agwetaaga.”<verse eid="LUK 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Omwana gw’endogoyi ne baguleeta eri Yesu, ne bagwaliirako eminagiro gyabwe, Yesu n’agwebagala. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Bwe yali ng’agenda, abantu ne baaliira ebyambalo byabwe mu luguudo.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Awo bwe yatuuka oluguudo we luserengetera olusozi olwa Zeyituuni, ekibiina kyonna eky’abayigirizwa, ne batandika okutendereza Katonda, mu ddoboozi ery’omwanguka olw’ebyamagero bye yali akoze nga boogera nti,<verse eid="LUK 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>“Aweereddwa omukisa Kabaka ajja mu linnya lya Mukama!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">“Emirembe gibe mu ggulu, n’ekitiibwa kibeere waggulu ennyo!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Naye abamu ku Bafalisaayo abaali mu kibiina ne bagamba Yesu nti, “Omuyigiriza, lagira abayigirizwa bo basirike!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yesu n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Mbategeeza nti ssinga bo basirika, amayinja gano ganaaleekaana!”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Akaabira Yerusaalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Awo Yesu bwe yali ng’asemberera ekibuga Yerusaalemi, bwe yakirengera, n’akikaabira. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>N’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Singa otegedde leero ebireeta emirembe ebyakulagirwa! Naye kaakano bikukwekeddwa, amaaso go tegayinza kubiraba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/><char style="wj">Ekiseera kigenda kutuuka abalabe bo lwe balikuzimbako ekigo okukwetooloola ne bakuzinda,</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/><char style="wj">ne bakumerengulira ku ttaka munda mu bisenge byo ggwe n’abaana bo. Abalabe bo tebalirekawo jjinja na limu nga litudde ku linnaalyo, kubanga omukisa Katonda gwe yakuwa ogw’okulokolebwa wagaana okugukozesa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mu Yeekaalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Awo Yesu n’ayingira mu Yeekaalu n’agobamu abaali batundiramu. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Kyawandiikibwa nti, ‘Ennyumba yange eneebanga ya kusinzizangamu,’ naye mmwe mugifudde ‘empuku y’abanyazi.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Okuva mu kiseera ekyo Yesu n’ayigirizanga mu Yeekaalu buli lunaku. Naye bakabona abakulu n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka, n’abakulembeze b’Abayudaaya ne bagezaako okufuna akaagaanya we banaamuttira. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Naye ne balemwa kubanga abantu bonna baamussaako nnyo omwoyo nga bamuwuliriza.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Bamubuuza Obuyinza gy’Abuggya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Awo Yesu bwe yali ng’ayigiriza era ng’abuulira Enjiri mu luggya lwa Yeekaalu, bakabona abakulu, n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka n’abakulembeze b’Abayudaaya ne bajja gy’ali. <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>Ne bamubuuza nti, “Tubuulire, buyinza ki obukukozesa bino? Era ani eyakuwa obuyinza obwo?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yesu n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Nange ka mbabuuze ekibuuzo kino.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/><char style="wj">Okubatiza kwa Yokaana kwava eri Katonda nandiki kwava mu bantu?”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Ne basooka okwogeraganyaamu bokka ne bokka nga bagamba nti, “Bwe tunaagamba nti, ‘Kwava mu ggulu,’ ajja kutubuuza nti, ‘Kale, lwaki temwamukkiriza?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Naye ate bwe tunaddamu nti, ‘Kwava mu bantu,’ abantu bonna bajja kutukuba amayinja, kubanga bamatizibwa nti Yokaana yali nnabbi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Kyebaava baddamu nti, “Tetumanyi gye kwava.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Nange sijja kubabuulira gye nzigya obuyinza obunkozesa bino.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olugero lw’Abalimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Awo Yesu n’akyukira abantu n’abagerera olugero luno nti, <char style="wj">“Waaliwo omusajja eyalina ennimiro ey’emizabbibu, n’agipangisa abalimi, n’agenda olugendo, n’amalayo ebbanga ddene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/><char style="wj">Awo ekiseera eky’amakungula bwe kyatuuka, n’atuma omu ku baddu be eri abalimi bamuwe ku bibala eby’emizabbibu gye. Naye abalimi abapangisa ne bamukuba ne bamugoba n’addayo ngalo nsa eri mukama we.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/><char style="wj">N’abatumira omuddu we omulala, n’oyo ne bamukuba ne bamuswaza nnyo, n’addayo ngalo nsa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/><char style="wj">N’abatumira omuddu owookusatu, naye ne bamukuba ne bamussaako n’ebiwundu ne bamugoba mu nnimiro.</char><verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nannyini nnimiro ne yeebuuza nti, ‘Nkole ntya? Ka mbatumire omwana wange gwe njagala ennyo, oboolyawo banaamussaamu ekitiibwa.’</char><verse eid="LUK 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Omwana oyo bwe baamulengera ne bateesa nti, ‘Ono y’agenda okusikira ennimiro eno nga kitaawe afudde. Ka tumutte, ebyobusika tubyesigalize.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/><char style="wj">Ne bamuggya mu nnimiro nga bamukulula ne bamutta.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">
    <char style="wj">“Mulowooza nannyini nnimiro abalimi abo alibakola atya?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/><char style="wj">Agenda kujja abazikirize bonna, n’ennimiro agiwe abalala.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Awo bwe baabiwulira ebyo ne bagamba nti, “Ekintu ng’ekyo kireme kubaawo!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Yesu n’abatunuulira n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Kale ekyawandiikibwa kino kitegeeza ki? Ekigamba nti,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Ejjinja abazimbi lye baagaana,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">lye lifuuse ejjinja ekkulu ery’oku nsonda.’</char><verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>
    <char style="wj">Omuntu yenna agwa ku jjinja eryo alibetentebwa, na buli gwe lirigwako lirimubetenta.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Awo abannyonnyozi b’amateeka ne bakabona abakulu bwe baawulira ebigambo ebyo, ne baagala bamukwatirewo mangwago, kubanga baamanya ng’olugero lwali lukwata ku bo. Naye ne batya abantu.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuwa Omusolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Ne balinda okutuusa lwe banaafuna akaagaanya babeeko kye bakola. Ne batuma abakessi eri Yesu nga beefudde ng’abantu abalungi abaagala okumanya. Baasuubira nti mu ebyo by’anaddamu, nga bamubuuzizza ebibuuzo ebirimu emitego, munaabaamu kwe banaasinziira okumukwata ne bamuwaayo ewa gavana. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Abakessi ne babuuza Yesu nti, “Omuyigiriza, tumanyi nga By’oyogera n’ebyo by’oyigiriza bya mazima, era nga tofaayo ku bigambo eby’abantu obuntu wabula oyigiriza ebyo Katonda by’ayagala. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Kyetuva tukubuuza nti kituufu okuwa Kayisaali omusolo oba si kituufu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Yesu n’ategeera mangu obukuusa bwabwe, n’abagamba nti, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/><char style="wj">“Mundage ensimbi eya ffeeza. Ekifaananyi kino ekiriko ky’ani? N’erinnya lino ly’ani?”</char> Ne baddamu nti, “Bya Kayisaali.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Kale ebya Kayisaali mubiwenga Kayisaali, n’ebya Katonda mubiwenga Katonda.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Ne balemwa okumukwasa mu ebyo bye yaddamu ng’abantu bonna bali awo. Bye yaddamu ne bibeewuunyisa nnyo, ne basirika busirisi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzuukira n’Okuwasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Awo abamu ku Basaddukaayo abatakkiririza mu kuzuukira, ne bajja eri Yesu, ne bamubuuza nti, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>“Omuyigiriza, amateeka ga Musa gagamba nti ssinga omusajja omufumbo afa nga tazadde baana, muganda we awasenga nnamwandu alyoke afunire muganda we omufu ezzadde. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Waaliwo abooluganda musanvu, asinga obukulu n’awasa, kyokka n’afa nga talese mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Adda ku mufu n’awasa nnamwandu; kyokka naye n’afa nga tazadde mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Okutuusa abooluganda bonna lwe baafa ne baggwaawo nga buli omu awasizza ku nnamwandu oyo, kyokka nga tewali alese mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Oluvannyuma n’omukazi naye n’afa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Kale mu kuzuukira omukazi oyo aliba muka ani? Kubanga abooluganda bonna omusanvu yabafumbirwako!”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesu n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Obufumbo buli kuno ku nsi, abantu kwe bawasiza era ne bafumbirwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/><char style="wj">Naye abo abasaanyizibwa okuzuukira mu bafu bwe batuuka mu ggulu tebawasa wadde okufumbirwa,</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/><char style="wj">era tebaddayo kufa nate, kubanga baba nga bamalayika. Era baba baana ba Katonda kubanga baba bazuukizibbwa mu bulamu obuggya,</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/><char style="wj">Naye nti abafu bazuukizibwa, ne Musa yannyonnyola bye yalaba ku kisaka, bwe yayita Mukama Katonda wa Ibulayimu, Katonda wa Isaaka, era Katonda wa Yakobo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/><char style="wj">Kino kitegeeza nti ssi Katonda wa bafu wabula Katonda wa balamu, kubanga bonna balamu gy’ali.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Abamu ku bannyonnyozi b’amateeka ne bagamba nti, “Omuyigiriza, ozzeemu bulungi!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Ne watabaawo ayaŋŋanga kwongera kumubuuza bibuuzo birala.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo Mwana w’ani?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Awo Yesu n’ababuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Lwaki Kristo ayitibwa Omwana wa Dawudi?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/><char style="wj">Songa Dawudi amwogerako mu Zabbuli nti,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Katonda yagamba Mukama wange nti,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">Tuula ku mukono gwange ogwa ddyo</char><verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>
    <char style="wj">okutuusa lwe ndifuula abalabe bo</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">
    <char style="wj">entebe y’ebigere byo.’</char><verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>
    <char style="wj">Noolwekyo obanga Dawudi amuyita Mukama we, kale ayinza atya okuba omwana we?”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Awo abantu bonna nga bawulira, Yesu n’akyukira abayigirizwa be n’abagamba nti, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/><char style="wj">“Mwekuume abannyonnyozi b’amateeka. Baagala nnyo okutambula nga bambadde amaganduula agagenda gakweya, n’abantu okugenda nga babalamusa mu butale, era baagala nnyo okutuula mu bifo eby’ekitiibwa mu makuŋŋaaniro ne ku mbaga!</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/><char style="wj">Balimbalimba nga basaba essaala empanvu, ng’eno bwe basala enkwe okunyaga ebintu bya bannamwandu. Noolwekyo bagenda kufuna ekibonerezo ekisingira ddala obunene.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Okugaba kwa Nnamwandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Awo Yesu bwe yayimusa amaaso n’alaba abantu abagagga nga bateeka ebirabo byabwe mu ggwanika mu Yeekaalu. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>N’alaba nnamwandu omwavu ng’awaayo busente bubiri. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>N’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ddala ddala mbagamba nti nnamwandu oyo omwavu agabye okusinga bali abagagga bonna.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/><char style="wj">Kubanga bagabye kitono nga bakiggya ku bugagga bwe bafisizzaawo, naye nnamwandu mu bwavu bwe awaddeyo kyonna ky’alina.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzikirizibwa kwa Yeekaalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Ne wabaawo aboogera ku bulungi bw’amayinja agaweebwayo eri Katonda okuzimba Yeekaalu. <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>Naye Yesu n’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ekiseera kijja ebirungi bino byonna bye mutunuulira lwe biribetentulwa ne watasigalawo jjinja na limu nga litudde ku linnaalyo, eritalisuulibwa wansi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Ne bamubuuza nti, “Omuyigiriza, ebyo biribaawo ddi? Ye walibaawo akabonero akaliraga nti biri kumpi okubaawo?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yesu n’addamu nti, <char style="wj">“Mwekuume muleme kulimbibwalimbibwa. Kubanga bangi balikozesa erinnya lyange, nga bagamba nti, ‘Nze nzuuyo.’ Naye temubakkirizanga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/><char style="wj">Naye bwe muwuliranga entalo n’obwegugungo, temutyanga. Kubanga entalo ziteekwa okusooka okujja, naye enkomerero terituuka mangwago.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>N’ayongera n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Amawanga galirwanagana, n’obwakabaka ne bulwanagana ne bunaabwo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/><char style="wj">Wagenda kubeerawo musisi ow’amaanyi ennyo, n’enjala ennyingi mu bitundu eby’enjawulo, ne kawumpuli. Walibaawo n’ebyentiisa ate n’obubonero okuva mu ggulu.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Naye bino byonna nga tebinnabaawo balibayigganya, balibakwata. Balibawaayo mu makuŋŋaaniro, ne mu maaso ga bakabaka ne bagavana, ku lw’erinnya lyange, ne musibibwa ne mu makomera.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/><char style="wj">Kiribaviiramu okufuna omukisa okuba abajulirwa bange.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/><char style="wj">Naye temweraliikiriranga gye muliggya ebigambo eby’okuwoza,</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/><char style="wj">Kubanga ŋŋenda kubawa ebigambo n’amagezi ebiriremesa n’abalabe bammwe okubaako n’eky’okuddamu!</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/><char style="wj">Muliweebwayo bakadde bammwe, ne baganda bammwe ne mikwano gyammwe, balibawaayo mukwatibwe, era abamu ku mmwe muttibwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/><char style="wj">Abantu bonna balibakyawa nga babalanga erinnya lyange.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/><char style="wj">Naye n’oluviiri olumu bwe luti olw’oku mitwe gyammwe terulizikirira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/><char style="wj">Kubanga bwe muligumiikiriza muliwonya obulamu bwammwe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzikirizibwa kwa Yerusaalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bwe mulabanga nga Yerusaalemi kyetooloddwa amaggye, nga mutegeera nga Okuzikirizibwa kw’ekibuga ekyo kutuuse.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/><char style="wj">Abo abalibeera mu Buyudaaya baddukiranga ku nsozi, abaliba mu Yerusaalemi bakivangamu ne badduka, n’abo abalibeera mu nnimiro tebakomangawo mu kibuga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/><char style="wj">Kubanga ebyo bye biriba ebiseera Katonda mwaliwolera eggwanga, n’ebigambo ebiri mu Byawandiikibwa birituukirizibwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/><char style="wj">Nga ziribasanga abakazi abaliba embuto n’abayonsa! Kubanga eggwanga liribonaabona, n’abantu baalyo balisunguwalirwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/><char style="wj">Abamu balittibwa n’ekitala ky’omulabe, abalala balikwatibwa ne bawaŋŋangusibwa mu mawanga gonna amalala ag’oku nsi. Yerusaalemi kiriwangulwa bannaggwanga ne bakirinnyirira okutuusa ekiseera kyabwe eky’obuwanguzi lwe kirikoma mu kiseera Katonda ky’aliba ateesezza.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okujja kw’Omwana w’Omuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Walibaawo obubonero ku njuba, ne ku mwezi, ne ku mmunyeenye. Wano ku nsi amawanga galibeera mu kunyolwa, olw’ab’amawanga, ng’abantu basamaaliridde olw’ennyanja eziyira n’amayengo ageesiikuula.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/><char style="wj">Abantu baliggwaamu amaanyi ne bazirika nga batidde nnyo olw’ebirijja ku nsi; kubanga amaanyi g’eggulu galinyeenyezebwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/><char style="wj">Mu kiseera ekyo muliraba Omwana w’Omuntu ng’ajjira mu kire n’obuyinza n’ekitiibwa kingi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/><char style="wj">Kale ebintu ebyo bwe bitandikanga muyimiriranga butereevu ne muyimusa amaaso gammwe waggulu! Kubanga okulokolebwa kwammwe nga kusembedde.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eky’okuyiga ku Muti Omutiini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Awo Yesu n’abagerera olugero luno nti, <char style="wj">“Mutunuulire omuti omutiini n’emiti emirala gyonna.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/><char style="wj">Bwe mulaba nga gitandise okutojjera, mumanya ng’ebiseera eby’ebbugumu bituuse.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/><char style="wj">Mu ngeri y’emu bwe muliraba ebintu nga bibaawo, nga mumanya nti obwakabaka bwa Katonda buli kumpi okutuuka.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ddala ddala mbagamba nti omulembe guno teguliggwaawo okutuusa ng’ebintu ebyo byonna bituukiridde.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/><char style="wj">Eggulu n’ensi biriggwaawo, naye ebigambo byange tebigenda kuggwaawo.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwekuume muleme okwemalira mu binyumu n’okutamiira, n’okweraliikirira eby’obulamu, okujja kwange okw’amangu kuleme kubakwasa nga temugenderedde ng’abagudde mu mutego.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/><char style="wj">Kubanga olunaku olwo lulituuka ku buli muntu mu nsi yonna.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/><char style="wj">Mutunule nga musaba Katonda buli kiseera, abawe amaanyi okubasobozesa okuwona ebintu ebyo byonna, Omwana w’Omuntu bw’alijja mulyoke musobole okuyimirira mu maaso ge.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Buli lunaku Yesu yayigirizanga mu Yeekaalu, bwe bwawungeeranga n’ava mu kibuga n’asula ku lusozi oluyitibwa olwa Zeyituuni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Mu makya abantu bonna ne bajjanga mu Yeekaalu okumuwuliriza.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Alya mu Yesu Olukwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Embaga ey’Emigaati Egitazimbulukuswa eyitibwa Okuyitako yali esembedde. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Bakabona abakulu n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka baali bakola kaweefube okusala amagezi okutta Yesu, naye nga batya abantu okusasamala. <verse eid="LUK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Awo Setaani n’ayingira mu Yuda Isukalyoti eyali omu ku bayigirizwa ekkumi n’ababiri, <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>n’agenda eri bakabona abakulu n’abakuumi ba Yeekaalu abakulu, n’ateesa nabo nga bw’anaamuwaayo gye bali. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Ne basanyuka nnyo, era ne bakkiriza okumusasula. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Yuda n’akkiriza okuwaayo Yesu, n’anoonya akakisa konna mw’anaamuweerayo gye bali nga tewali kibiina.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekyekiro eky’Enkomerero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Awo olunaku olw’Emigaati Egitazimbulukuswa, okuttirwa omwana gw’endiga ogw’embaga y’Okuyitako, ne lutuuka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yesu n’atuma Peetero ne Yokaana n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mugende mututegekere ekyekiro kyaffe eky’okuyitako, tujje tukirye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Ne bamubuuza nti, “Oyagala tukitegekere wa?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Yesu n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Munaaba mwakayingira mu kibuga, mujja kulaba omusajja eyeetisse ensuwa y’amazzi ng’atambula. Mumugoberere okutuuka mu nnyumba mw’anaayingira,</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/><char style="wj">mugambe nnyinimu nti, ‘Omuyigiriza atutumye gy’oli ng’agamba nti: Ekisenge ky’abagenyi kiruwa mwe nnaaliira Okuyitako n’abayigirizwa bange?’</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/><char style="wj">Ajja kubalaga ekisenge ekinene ekya waggulu nga kitegekeddwa bulungi. Omwo mwe muba mutegekera.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Ne balaga mu kibuga, ne basanga buli kimu nga Yesu bwe yabagamba. Ne bateekateeka Okuyitako.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Awo ekiseera ky’okulya bwe kyatuuka, Yesu n’atuula n’abayigirizwa be okulya. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Yesu n’agamba abayigirizwa be nti, <char style="wj">“Ebbanga eryo lyonna mbadde ndowooza nnyo ku Kyekiro kino eky’Okuyitako, nga njagala nkirye nammwe nga sinnaba kubonyaabonyezebwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/><char style="wj">Kubanga mbagamba nti sigenda kuddayo kulya nammwe Okuyitako okutuusa lwe kulituukirizibwa mu bwakabaka bwa Katonda.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Awo Yesu n’addira ekikompe ky’envinnyo, bwe yamala okwebaza Katonda, n’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Mukwate, munyweko mwenna.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/><char style="wj">Kubanga mbagamba nti, Sigenda kuddayo kunywa ku kibala kya muzabbibu okutuusa ng’obwakabaka bwa Katonda buzze.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Ate n’atoola omugaati, bwe yamala okwebaza Katonda, n’agumenyaamenyamu, n’abagabira ng’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Guno gwe mubiri gwange oguweebwayo ku lwammwe. Mukolenga bwe muti nga munzijukira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Bwe baamala okulya ekyekiro, n’addira nate ekikompe era mu ngeri y’emu n’akibakwasa ng’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ekikompe kino ke kabonero ak’endagaano ya Katonda empya ekakasibwa mu musaayi gwange oguyiyibwa ku lwammwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/><char style="wj">Naye muwulire kino. Omuntu agenda okundyamu olukwe atudde wano nange ku mmere.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/><char style="wj">Kigwanira Omwana w’Omuntu, okufa nga Katonda bwe yateekateeka. Naye zimusanze omuntu oyo amulyamu olukwe.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Awo abayigirizwa ne batandika okwebuuzaganya bokka na bokka nti ani ku bo ayinza okukola ekintu ng’ekyo!<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Empaka ku Bukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Era ne batandika okuwakana bokka ne bokka, ani asinga ekitiibwa mu bo? <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Naye Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Bakabaka b’abamawanga bafuga abantu baabwe, n’ab’obuyinza ne babazunza mu kino na kiri, naye abafugibwa tebalina kya kukola wabula okubayita abayambi baabwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/><char style="wj">Naye mu mmwe tekisaanira kuba bwe kityo. Oyo asinga ekitiibwa mu mmwe asaana yeeyisenga ng’asembayo, n’omukulembeze mu mmwe asaana abeere ng’omuweereza wammwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/><char style="wj">Mu nsi muno omukungu y’atula ku mmeeza abaddu be ne bamuweereza. Naye wano mu ffe nze muweereza wammwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/><char style="wj">Naye mmwe mubadde wamu nange mu biseera bino eby’okugezesebwa kwange,</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/><char style="wj">era kubanga Kitange ampadde obwakabaka, noolwekyo mbaatulira kati nti mbawadde ekifo</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/><char style="wj">okutuula n’okulya era n’okunywera ku mmeeza yange mu bwakabaka bwange obwo, era mulituula ku ntebe ne mulamula ebika bya Isirayiri ekkumi n’ebibiri.</char><verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Simooni, Simooni, Setaani asabye okukuwewa ng’eŋŋaano,</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/><char style="wj">naye ggwe nkusabidde okukkiriza kwo kuleme kukuggwaamu. Era bw’olimala okwenenya, yamba mu kuzimba n’okunyweza okukkiriza kwa baganda bo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Awo Peetero n’addamu nti, “Mukama wange, neeteeseteese okusibirwa awamu naawe mu kkomera, era n’okufiira awamu naawe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Peetero, nkutegeeza nti leero ononneegaana emirundi esatu enkoko nga tennakookolima.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Awo Yesu n’ababuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Bwe nabatuma okubuulira Enjiri, ne mutatwala nsimbi wadde ensawo, oba omugogo omulala ogw’engatto, mwalina okwetaaga ekintu kyonna?”</char> Ne baddamu nti, “Nedda.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Naye kaakano alina ensawo eterekebwamu ensimbi agitwale, n’ensawo ng’ey’omusabiriza bwe mutyo. Atalina kitala, atunde ku ngoye ze akyegulire!</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/><char style="wj">Kubanga mbagamba nti kyetaagisa okutuukirizibwa mu nze ekyawandiikibwa nti, ‘Yabalirwa wamu n’abamenyi b’amateeka,’ ebinkwatako biteekwa okutuukirira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Abayigirizwa ne bamugamba nti, “Mukama waffe, wano tulinawo ebitala bibiri!” N’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Bimala!”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asaba ku Lusozi olwa Zeyituuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Awo Yesu n’afuluma mu kibuga awamu n’abayigirizwa be n’akwata ekkubo erigenda ku lusozi olwa Zeyituuni nga bwe yali empisa ye. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Bwe yatuuka eyo n’agamba abayigirizwa be nti, <char style="wj">“Musabe Katonda, muleme kuwangulwa kukemebwa.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Ye n’abavaako akabanga ng’awakasukwa ejjinja, n’afukamira n’asaba nti, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/><char style="wj">“Kitange, obanga kwe kusiima kwo ekikompe kino kinzigyeko. Naye si nga Nze bwe njagala, wabula ky’oyagala kye kiba kikolebwa.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Awo malayika eyava mu ggulu n’ajja n’amugumya. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Yali mu kunyolwa kunene nnyo okw’omwoyo, ne yeeyongera okusaba ennyo n’atuuyana n’entuuyo ezamuvaamu ne ziba ng’amatondo g’omusaayi, era ne gatonnya wansi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Bwe yayimuka ng’amaze okusaba n’addayo eri abayigirizwa be, naye n’abasanga nga beebase, olw’ennaku eyali ebakutte. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Lwaki mwebase? Muzuukuke, musabe, muleme kuwangulwa kukemebwa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Akwatibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Awo Yesu bwe yali ng’akyayogera, ekibiina ky’abantu ne batuuka nga Yuda, omu ku bayigirizwa be ekkumi n’ababiri, y’abakulembedde. Yuda n’ajja butereevu awali Yesu, n’amunywegera. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Naye Yesu n’amugamba nti, <char style="wj">“Yuda, Omwana w’Omuntu omulyamu olukwe ng’omugwa mu kifuba?”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Abayigirizwa abalala bwe baalaba ekyali kigenda okubaawo ne babuuza Yesu nti, “Mukama waffe, tubateme n’ebitala byaffe?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Era omu ku bo n’atemako n’ekitala okutu kw’omuweereza wa Kabona Asinga Obukulu. <verse eid="LUK 22:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Naye Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Temwongera kubalwanyisa.”</char> N’akwata ku kutu kw’omusajja, n’amuwonya!<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Yesu kwe kukyukira bakabona abakulu, n’abakulu b’abakuumi ba Yeekaalu, n’abakulembeze b’Abayudaaya abaali bakulembedde ekibiina ky’abantu, n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Ndi munyazi, n’okujja ne mujja gye ndi nga mwambalidde ebitala n’emiggo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/><char style="wj">Lwaki temwankwatira mu Yeekaalu? Nabeeranga omwo buli lunaku. Naye nammwe eno ye ssaawa yammwe, n’ekizikiza we kiragira obuyinza bwakyo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetero Yeegaana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Awo ne bakwata Yesu ne bamutwala mu nnyumba ya Kabona Asinga Obukulu. Peetero n’agoberera nga yeesuddeko akabanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Bwe baamala okukuma omuliro wakati mu luggya ne batuula okwota; Peetero naye n’atuula wakati mu bo, n’ayota omuliro. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Omuwala omuweereza n’amulengera ng’omuliro gumumulisizza, n’amutunuulira enkaliriza, okutuusa lwe yagamba nti, “Omusajja ono yali ne Yesu!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Peetero ne yeegaana nti, “Omukazi, oyo gw’oyogerako nze simumanyi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Bwe waayitawo akabanga omuntu omulala n’alaba Peetero n’amugamba nti, “Naawe oli omu ku bo.” Peetero ne yeegaana nti, “Nedda, ssebo, si bwe kiri.” <verse eid="LUK 22:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Bwe waali wayiseewo ng’essaawa nnamba, omuntu omu n’ayogera ng’akakasa nti, “Ddala n’ono yali wamu ne Yesu kubanga naye Mugaliraaya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Peetero n’addamu nti, “Omusajja, by’oyogerako sibimanyi!” Peetero bwe yali akyayogera enkoko n’ekookolima. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Mu kaseera ako Mukama waffe n’akyuka n’atunuulira Peetero. Peetero n’ajjukira Yesu kye yagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Enkoko eneeba tennakookolima ononneegaana emirundi esatu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Awo Peetero n’afuluma okuva mu luggya n’akaaba nnyo amaziga!<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaserikale Baduulira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Awo abasajja abaali bakuuma Yesu ne batandika okumuduulira n’okumukuba. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Ne bamusiba ekitambaala ku maaso ne bamukuba ebikonde, oluvannyuma ne bamubuuza nti, “Nnabbi! yogera ani akukubye?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Ne bamuvuma n’ebigambo ebirala bingi.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mu Maaso g’Olukiiko Olukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Enkeera mu makya Olukiiko Olukulu olw’Abayudaaya, nga lulimu bakabona abakulu, n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka, n’abakulembeze b’Abayudaaya, ne lutuula. Yesu n’aleetebwa mu maaso g’Olukiiko olwo.<verse eid="LUK 22:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Ne bamubuuza nti, “Obanga ggwe Kristo, tubuulire.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesu n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Bwe nnaababuulira temujja kunzikiriza,</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/><char style="wj">ne bwe nnaababuuza ebibuuzo temujja kunnyanukula.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/><char style="wj">Naye ekiseera kituuse, Nze, Omwana w’Omuntu, okutuula ku mukono ogwa ddyo ogwa Katonda Ayinzabyonna.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Bonna ne baleekaana nti, “Kwe kugamba nti ggwe Mwana wa Katonda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Yesu n’abaddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Nga bwe mugambye bwe ntyo bwe ndi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Ne bagamba nti, “Ate twetaagira ki obujulizi obulala? Kubanga ffe ffennyini twewuliridde ng’ebigambo bino biva mu kamwa ke.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mu Maaso ga Piraato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Awo Olukiiko lwonna ne lusituka, ne batwala Yesu ewa Piraato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Ne batandika okumuwawaabira nti, “Omuntu ono ajagalaza eggwanga lyaffe, ng’atuziyiza okuwa Kayisaali omusolo, nga yeeyita Kristo, kabaka.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Piraato kwe kubuuza Yesu nti, “Ggwe kabaka w’Abayudaaya?” Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Ggwe okyogedde.”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Awo Piraato n’akyukira bakabona abakulu n’ekibiina ky’abantu n’abagamba nti, “Siraba musango muntu ono gw’azizza.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Naye ne beeyongera okulumiriza nga bagamba nti, “Asasamazza abantu n’okuyigiriza kwe mu Buyudaaya mwonna. Yatandikira Ggaliraaya okutuukira ddala ne wano!”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Piraato bwe yawulira ebyo kwe kubuuza nti, “Omuntu ono Mugaliraaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Bwe yategeera nga Yesu Mugaliraaya, n’amuweereza eri Kerode, kubanga Ggaliraaya kyali kifugibwa Kerode, ate nga Kerode mu kiseera ekyo yali ali mu Yerusaalemi.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Awo Kerode bwe yalaba Yesu, n’asanyuka nnyo, kubanga yali atutte ekiseera kiwanvu ng’ayagala okulaba Yesu. Era okuva ku ebyo bye yali amuwuliddeko yasuubira ng’ajja kumulaba ng’akolayo ekyamagero. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>N’amubuuza ebibuuzo bingi, naye Yesu n’atamuddamu. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Mu kiseera ekyo, bakabona abakulu, n’abannyonnyozi b’amateeka baali awo mu busungu obungi ne baleekaanira waggulu nga bamulumiriza. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Kerode n’abaserikale be ne batandika okuduulira Yesu, n’okumuvuma. Ne bamwambaza ekyambalo ekinekaaneka, ne bamuzzaayo ewa Piraato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Ku lunaku olwo lwennyini, Kerode ne Piraato, abaali bakyawaganye, ne bafuuka ba mukwano.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Piraato Asalira Yesu ogw’Okufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Awo Piraato n’akuŋŋaanya bakabona abakulu, n’abakulembeze b’Abayudaaya, n’abantu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>n’abagamba nti, “Mwandeetedde omuntu ono nga mumuwawaabira nti asasamaza abantu bajeeme. Mubuuzizza nnyo era ne neetegereza bulungi ensonga eyo nga nammwe we muli, naye ne nsanga nga talina musango ku ebyo bye mumuwawaabidde. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Ne Kerode naye tamulabyeko musango era kyavudde amukomyawo gye tuli. Omuntu ono talina ky’akoze kimusaanyiza kibonerezo kya kufa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Noolwekyo ŋŋenda mukangavvulamu, ndyoke mmusumulule.”<verse eid="LUK 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Ku buli mbaga ya Kuyitako, Piraato ng’ateekwa okubateera omusibe omu. <verse eid="LUK 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Ekibiina kyonna ne kireekaana nnyo nti, “Oyo mutte! Otuteere Balaba.” <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Balaba ono yali asibiddwa lwa kukulembera kasasamalo mu kibuga, era n’olw’obutemu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Piraato olw’okwagala okusumulula Yesu, n’ayongera okwogera nabo. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Naye ne beeyongera okuleekaana nti, “Mukomerere ku musaalaba! Mukomerere ku musaalaba!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Piraato n’ayogera nabo omulundi ogwokusatu nti, “Lwaki? Azzizza musango ki? Sirabye nsonga yonna emusaanyiza kibonerezo kya kufa. Noolwekyo ka mmukangavvule, ndyoke mmusumulule.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Naye ne beeyongera nnyo okuleekaana, n’okuwowoggana nga baagala Yesu akomererwe ku musaalaba. Era okuleekaana kwabwe ne kuwangula.<verse eid="LUK 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Awo Piraato n’akola nga bwe baayagala. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>N’asumulula Balaba, gwe baasaba eyali asibiddwa olw’okusasamaza abantu n’olw’obutemu. Naye n’abakwasa Yesu bagende bamukole nga bwe baagala.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Akomererwa ku Musaalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Awo ne bafulumya Yesu okumutwala okumukomerera. Bwe baali bamutwala ne basanga omusajja Omukuleene erinnya lye Simooni, yali ava mu kyalo nga yaakayingira mu kibuga, ne bamuwaliriza okusitula omusaalaba gwa Yesu ku kibegabega kye; n’agusitula n’agutwala ng’atambulira emabega wa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Ekibiina kinene ne bagoberera Yesu nga mwe muli n’abakazi abaali bamukaabira nga bwe bakuba ebiwoobe. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Naye Yesu n’abakyukira n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Abawala ba Yerusaalemi, temukaabira Nze, wabula mwekaabire era mukaabire n’abaana bammwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/><char style="wj">Kubanga ekiseera kijja abakazi abatalina baana lwe baliyitibwa ab’omukisa ddala.</char><verse eid="LUK 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Baligamba ensozi nti, “Mutugweko,”</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">n’obusozi nti, “Mutuziike.” ’</char><verse eid="LUK 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>
    <char style="wj">Kale, obanga bino babikola ku muti omubisi, naye ku mukalu kiriba kitya?”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Waaliwo n’abasajja abalala babiri, bombi nga bamenyi ba mateeka, abaatwalibwa ne Yesu okuttibwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Awo bwe baatuuka mu kifo ekiyitibwa Ekiwanga, ne bamukomerera awo ku musaalaba, awamu n’abamenyi b’amateeka, omu ku ludda lwa Yesu olwa ddyo n’omulala ku ludda olwa kkono. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yesu n’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Kitange, basonyiwe, kubanga kye bakola tebakimanyi.”</char> Awo abaserikale ne bagabana ebyambalo bye nga babikubira akalulu.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Ekibiina ne kimutunuulira. Abakulembeze b’Abayudaaya ne bamusekerera nga bagamba nti, “Yalokolanga balala, ka tulabe naye bwe yeerokola, obanga ye Kristo wa Katonda Omulonde we.”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>N’abaserikale nabo ne bamuduulira ne bamuwa wayini omukaatuufu, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>nga bagamba nti, “Obanga ggwe Kabaka w’Abayudaaya, weerokole!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Waggulu w’omutwe gwa Yesu ku musaalaba kwateekebwako ekiwandiiko mu bigambo bino nti,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="LUK 23:38">Ono ye Kabaka w’Abayudaaya.<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Omu ku bamenyi b’amateeka abaakomererwa naye n’avuma Yesu ng’agamba nti, “Si ggwe Masiya? Kale weerokole era naffe otulokole.” <verse eid="LUK 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Naye munne bwe baakomererwa n’amunenya, n’amugamba nti, “N’okutya totya Katonda, nga naawe oli ku kibonerezo kye kimu kya kufa? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Ffe tuvunaaniddwa bya nsonga, kubanga ebikolwa byaffe bitusaanyiza kino. Naye ono talina kisobyo kyonna ky’akoze.”<verse eid="LUK 23:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>N’alyoka agamba nti, “Yesu, onzijukiranga bw’olijja mu bwakabaka bwo.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesu n’amuddamu nti, <char style="wj">“Ddala ddala nkugamba nti olwa leero ojja kubeera nange mu Lusuku lwa Katonda.”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Awo obudde bwe bwatuuka essaawa omukaaga ez’omu ttuntu, enzikiza n’ekwata ku nsi yonna, okutuusa ku ssaawa ey’omwenda, <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>kubanga enjuba yalekeraawo okwaka. Amangwago eggigi ly’omu Yeekaalu ne liyulikamu wabiri. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Awo Yesu n’ayogerera waggulu n’eddoboozi ery’omwanguka ng’agamba nti, <char style="wj">“Kitange, nteeka omwoyo gwange mu mikono gyo.”</char> Bwe yamala okwogera ebigambo ebyo, n’afa.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Omuserikale Omuruumi omukulu w’ekitongole eyakulembera abaserikale abaakomerera Yesu, bwe yalaba ebibaddewo, n’atendereza Katonda ng’agamba nti, “Mazima omuntu ono abadde mutuukirivu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Abantu bonna abaali bazze okwerolera, bwe baalaba ebibaddewo ne baddayo ewaabwe nga beekuba mu kifuba nga bajjudde ennaku nnyingi. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Mikwano gya Yesu, awamu n’abakazi abajja naye nga bamugoberera okuviira ddala e Ggaliraaya, baali bayimiridde nga beesuddeko akabanga, nga batunuulira byonna ebibaddewo.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuziikibwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Laba waaliwo omusajja erinnya lye Yusufu, ng’atuula mu Lukiiko Olukulu olw’Abayudaaya, yali musajja mulungi era nga mutuukirivu, <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>teyakkirizaganya na banne mu ebyo bye baasalawo ku Yesu ne bye baakola. Yali wa mu kibuga Alimasaya eky’omu Buyudaaya. Yali ng’alindirira n’essuubi ddene okulaba obwakabaka bwa Katonda. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Omusajja ono n’agenda eri Piraato n’asabayo omulambo gwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Bwe yaguggya ku musaalaba, n’aguzinga mu lugoye lwa linena olweru ennyo, n’agugalamiza mu ntaana ey’empuku eyali etemeddwa mu lwazi, era nga teziikibwangamu muntu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Bino byonna byaliwo ku Lwakutaano, olunaku olw’okweteekerateekerako ng’enkeera ye Ssabbiiti.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Omulambo gwa Yesu bwe gwali gutwalibwa mu ntaana, abakazi abaava e Ggaliraaya ne bagoberera nga bavaako emabega, ne balaba entaana n’omulambo gwe nga bwe gwagalamizibwamu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Ne balyoka baddayo eka ne bategeka ebyakaloosa n’amafuta ag’okusiiga omulambo gwa Yesu. Naye ne bawummula ku Ssabbiiti ng’etteeka bwe liragira.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuzuukira kwa Mukama Waffe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Awo ku lunaku Lwassande<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lwassande, lwe lunaku olusooka mu wiiki</char></note>, lwe lusooka mu wiiki, mu makya ennyo, abakazi ne baddira ebyakaloosa n’amafuta, bye baali bategese, ne bagenda ku ntaana. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Ne basanga ejjinja eryali liggadde omulyango oguyingira mu ntaana, nga liyiringisibbwa okudda wabbali. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Bwe batyo ne bayingira mu ntaana, naye omulambo gwa Mukama waffe Yesu tebaagusangamu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Ne bayimirira awo nga babuliddwa eky’okukola. Amangwago, abasajja babiri ne balabika mu maaso gaabwe nga bambadde engoye ezimasamasa ng’okumyansa kw’eraddu. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Abakazi ne batya nnyo, ne bakutama ne batunula wansi, abasajja ne babagamba nti, “Lwaki omuntu omulamu mumunoonyeza mu ntaana? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Taliiwo wano, azuukidde! Mujjukire bye yabagamba nga muli e Ggaliraaya nti, <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/><char style="wj">‘Omwana w’Omuntu, ateekwa okuweebwayo mu mikono gy’abantu ababi, bamukomerere ku musaalaba, naye nga ku lunaku olwokusatu alizuukira.’ ”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Ne bajjukira ebigambo bye ebyo.<verse eid="LUK 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Awo ne bayanguwa mangu ne bagenda, ne bategeeza abayigirizwa ekkumi n’omu n’abalala bonna, ebintu ebyo byonna. Bano be bakazi abaalaga ku ntaana, era ne bategeeza abayigirizwa ebintu ebyo: <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Maliyamu Magudaleene, ne Jowaana, ne Maliyamu nnyina Yakobo, n’abalala. Ne bategeeza abatume ebintu ebyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Naye bye baababuulira nga biwulikika ng’ebitaliimu makulu, era tebaabikkiriza. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Kyokka Peetero n’adduka n’alaga ku ntaana, n’akutama n’alingiza n’alaba ng’engoye za linena Yesu mwe yali azingiddwa ziri wabbali zokka nga njereere, n’addayo eka nga yeewuunya.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku Luguudo lw’e Emawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ku lunaku olwo lwennyini abasajja babiri, abamu ku abo abaagobereranga Yesu, baali batambula nga bagenda mu kabuga akayitibwa Emawu, akaali kilomita nga kkumi na bbiri okuva e Yerusaalemi. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Baali bagenda boogera ku kufa kwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Amangwago Yesu yennyini n’abeegattako n’atambula nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Kyokka tebaamutegeera, kubanga ekyo Katonda yali akibakisizza.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Biki bye munyumyako nga bwe mutambula mu kkubo?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Ne bayimirira ng’amaaso gaabwe gajjudde ennaku. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Omu ku bo, erinnya lye Kulyoppa n’amuddamu nti, “Oli mugenyi mu Yerusaalemi atamanyi bya kitalo ebyaliwo mu wiiki eyise?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Yesu n’ababuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Biki ebyo?”</char> Ne baddamu nti, “Ebyagwa ku Yesu Omunnazaaleesi eyali omusajja Nnabbi ow’amaanyi mu bye yakolanga ne bye yayogeranga eyakola ebyamagero ebyewuunyisa, era yali Muyigiriza wa kitalo, mu maaso ga Katonda ne mu maaso g’abantu bonna. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Naye bakabona abakulu n’abakulembeze baffe baamukwata ne bamuwaayo n’asalirwa omusango ogw’okufa, ne bamukomerera ku musaalaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Twali tusuubira nti, Ye Kristo anaalokola Isirayiri. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Ebyo nga bikyali awo, nga wayiseewo ennaku ssatu bukyanga bino bibaawo abamu ku bakazi b’ewaffe baatwewuunyisizza. Olwa leero baakedde ku ntaana, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>naye omulambo gwe tebaagusanzeemu. Bwe baakomyewo baatugambye nti bayolesebbwa ba bamalayika abaabagambye nti mulamu! <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Abamu ku bannaffe abasajja nabo ne bagendayo mangu, nabo ne basanga ng’omulambo gwa Yesu teguliimu mu ntaana, ng’abakazi bwe baagambye.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Yesu n’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Nga muli bantu basirusiru! Mmwe ab’emitima eminafu egirwawo okukkiriza bannabbi bye baategeeza!</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/><char style="wj">Tekyagwanira Kristo okubonaabona mu bintu byonna n’oluvannyuma alyoke ayingire mu kitiibwa kye?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>N’atandikira ku Musa n’ayitaayita mu bannabbi bonna ng’agenda abannyonnyola Ebyawandiikibwa bye bimwogerako.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Bwe baasemberera akabuga we baali bagenda, Yesu n’aba nga eyeeyongerayo, <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>naye ne bamuwaliriza asule ewaabwe kubanga n’obudde bwali buwungedde. N’akkiriza, asigale.<verse eid="LUK 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Awo bwe yali ng’alya nabo n’addira omugaati, ne yeebaza n’agumenyamu, n’abawa. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Amangwago amaaso gaabwe ne gazibuka ne bamutegeera! Ate n’ababulako mu kaseera ako! <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Ne batandika okwewuunaganya nga bagamba nti, “Emitima gyaffe tegyabuguumiridde bwe yabadde ayogera naffe mu kkubo ng’atunnyonnyola Ebyawandiikibwa?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Awo ne basituka mangu ne baddayo mu Yerusaalemi, ne basanga abayigirizwa ekkumi n’omu ne bannaabwe abalala nga bakuŋŋaanye, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>nga bagamba nti, “Ddala Mukama waffe azuukidde! Alabikidde Peetero!” <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Ne bannyonnyola, nga Yesu bwe yabalabikira nga bali mu kkubo batambula, era nga bwe yategeerekeka gye bali ng’amaze okumenya omugaati.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Alabikira Abayigirizwa be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Awo bwe baali bakyayogera ebyo Yesu n’ayimirira mu makkati gaabwe n’abalamusa nti, <char style="wj">“Emirembe gibeere nammwe!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Naye bonna ne bakankana nga batidde nnyo, nga balowooza nti balaba muzimu! <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Yesu n’ababuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Lwaki mutidde bwe mutyo? Lwaki mubuusabuusa mu mitima gyammwe?</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/><char style="wj">Mulaba ebibatu byange. Mutunule ne ku bigere byange! Kaakano mutegeere nga ye Nze kennyini. Munkwateko mukakasize ddala nti ssiri muzimu, kubanga omuzimu tegubeera na mubiri na magumba nga Nze bye nnina.”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Bwe yali ng’ayogera n’abalaga ebibatu bye n’ebigere bye. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Naye nga bakyabuusabuusa kyokka nga balina essanyu era nga basamaaliridde n’alyoka ababuuza nti, <char style="wj">“Mulinawo wano ekyokulya?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Ne bamuwa ekitundu ky’ekyennyanja ekyokye, <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>n’akitoola n’akiriira mu maaso gaabwe nga bamutunuulira!<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Nabategeeza nga nkyali nammwe nti ebintu byonna ebyampandiikibwako mu mateeka ga Musa, ne mu bya bannabbi, ne mu Zabbuli, byali biteekwa okutuukirira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>N’alyoka asumulula emitima gyabwe, ne bategeera ebyawandiikibwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>N’abagamba nti, <char style="wj">“Kyawandiikibwa dda nnyo nti Kristo kimugwanira okubonaabona, n’okufa era ku lunaku olwokusatu azuukire mu bafu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/><char style="wj">Era mu linnya lye Enjiri ey’okwenenya n’okusonyiyibwa ebibi eribuulirwa amawanga gonna okutandikira mu Yerusaalemi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/><char style="wj">Muli bajulirwa b’ebyo,</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/><char style="wj">Laba mbaweereza ekisuubizo kya Kitange. Mubeere mu kibuga okutuusa lwe mulyambazibwa amaanyi agava mu ggulu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okugenda mu Ggulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Awo Yesu n’abakulembera ne balaga e Besaniya. N’ayimusa emikono gye waggulu, n’abawa omukisa. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Bwe yali ng’akyabawa omukisa, n’abavaako, n’asitulibwa, n’atwalibwa mu ggulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Ne bamusinza, ne baddayo mu Yerusaalemi nga bajjudde essanyu lingi. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Ne babeeranga mu Yeekaalu bulijjo nga batendereza Katonda.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
